<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Ndonde Hamba Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc1">Ngani Jammbone jijijaandikwe na Aluka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Aluka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Aluk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ngani Jammbone jijijaandikwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Aluka</para>
  <para style="imt">Nnongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Injiili ja kulengenea na Aluka nga chitabu chimo pakati ja hitabu yengi ya Lilagano liyono nnani ja Akilisito. Kila chimo chikakemwa Injili, lilobhe hele maana jakwe nga Ngani Jammbone. Hitabu hikaajandikwa baada ya Ayesu kujomoka, hitabu heye hikajaandikwa na angota Amatayo na Ayohana na Amaluko na Aluka baada ja Ayesu kujomoka. Aluka bhangajaandika ngani nnani ja umomi gwa Ayesu tu nambo bhakajaandika nnani ja hikubho hibhakatenda bhanapunji bha Ayesu bhakatendanga baada ja kujomoka na kuyoka kwa Ayesu. Kabhele bhakajaandika chitabu chichikemitwa Hikubho ya Akaalondohi. Bhakwa bhabhaimanya muuda gwene yakubhee Injili kulengenia na Aluka chibhakajaandika. Nambo akaachomi bhajingi bhakondanga komboleka bhakajaandika mu chaaka cha 70 tangu Akilisito.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aluka bhabhakibha aganga nga bhabhakaandika. Namuna ja kujaandika kwabhe na chilongelo chabhe jilaangia kubhee bhakibha nga amundu bhabhakweti malango. Aluka bhakapala kujaandika ngongolei yene nnani ja ngongolei ya Ayesu kwa kongolela mabhokelo kwa namuna jijikabhokela, ili bhangi bhakombolange kumanyanga pabjhachomanga 1:1-17. Aluka chula ja 1:1-3, Aluka bhakibha ngabha Ayahudi. Bhakolosai 4:10-14 bhakajaandika kwa namuna yakubhee bhandu ngabha Bhayahudi bhakombolanga kumanyikana. Ngani heje jilaangia kwa namuna chibhakongolela chiiyobhalilike kwa Chiyahudi Aluka 1:8.</para>
  <para style="ip">Injili kulengenia na Aluka jilaandana muno na hitabu ya Amatayo na Amaluko ligonogo hitabu heye hikongolela ngani yelayela kwa namuna jelajela. Pakati ja hitabu heyo, chitabu cha Aluka chikongolela maha umomi gwa Ayesu. Ayesu bhakahatambula maha nnani ja kulekelea mabhou mu Aluka 3:3; 11:4; 17:3-4; 23:34; 24:47 na 24:47. Kabhele bhakakulumikia majopelo mu chula ja 3:21, 5:16; 6:12; 11:12; 22:32.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabhile</para>
  <para style="io">Mu chula ja 1:1-4 Aluka bhakongolela Injili jabhe na kongolela kwa niki bhatendakujaandika.</para>
  <para style="io">Ngapena bhangolela nnani ja kubhekekwa kwa Ayesu na namuna jijikabhekwa ligongo lya lihengo lya Aluka 1:5-4:13.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Akolo Ateofilo, bhandu bhajingi bhatekuchimilanga kujandika ngani hiitendikwe pakati jitu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Bhatekujaandikanga handa chibhakatulubholelanga na bheni bhala bhabhaibhonite hikubho heyo kwa miho gabhenji kubhoka kandahi, na kutangacha ujumbe. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Kwa henela hakolo Ateopilo baada ja kulolekea maha hilebhe kubhokela kandai, na nenga monite yammbone ninyandikile maha kila chilebhe. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />ndenda henela ili namwenga nkombole kuhimamya mwabhene ukweli gwa genigala gabhannyigine.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhelekwa kwa Ayohana am'batichaji kutekutangachwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Muda Ahelode pabhakibha apalume bha Kuyuda, kukabhehe na bhakukung'a jumo lihina lyakwe Achakalia, bha chibhoga cha bhakukung'a chichikemwa Kuabiya. Hanu bhabhe bhakibha bhakemwa Aelizabeti chibhoga cha akung'i Aaluni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Bhoha bhabhele bhakibhanga bhandu bhammbone nnongi ja Annoongo, bhakibhanga bhatenditakutamanga kwa kukamulanga amuli na malagilo goha ga Hangwana. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Nambo bhangabhanganga bhatekujaliwanga kupata bhana kwakubhe Aelizabeti bhakibha ntoonga na bhena bhoha bhabhele bhakibhanga bhatekongopalaanga muno. <verse eid="LUK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Lichobha limo Azakalia pajikibha chaamu jabhe ja kutenda lihengo lya kukung'a mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo, <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Azakalia bhakaagulikwa kwa gudugudu, handa chiiyobholilike, ili bhajingile mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo ligongo lya bhapukie ubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Bhandu bhajingi muno, bhakibhanga bhakondikininge panja bhatendita kujopa muda gonogwe gwa kupukiha ubhani. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Akaatumichi bha Kunani Kulihunde bha Hangwana akaabhokela Azakalia monomwe nkati, bhakaajemelela upande gwa kunnelo gwa litatali lya kubhokea mbeeko kwa Annoongo lya kupukia ubhani. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Azakalia pabhakabhona bhena antumichi bha Kunani Kulihunde bha Hangwana bhakahechuka muno, bhakajogopa. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Nambo Antumichi bha kunani kulihunde bha Annoongo bhakaalobholela, “Azakalia, nkotokujogopa, kwa kubhehe Annoongo bhatekujohanikiha kujopa kwinu, na Aelizabeti hanubhinu bhapakummelekela mwana mwanalome, namwenga mpakumpekeha lihina lyakwe yohana. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Mpakuhekela muno na mpakuhachukila muno na bhandu bhajingi bhapakuhangalala muno ligongo lya kubhelekwa kwabhe. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Apakubhehe nkolongwa nnoongi ja Hangwana. Ngang'we divai na choha chela chakolelwa, apakutwelela Mboomo ja Annoongo lichobha lya kubhelekwa kwabhe. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Ayohana bhapakwaabhujia bhandu bhajingi bha Kuichilaeli kwa Hangwana Annoongo bhabhenji. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Bhena bhapakwaalongolea nnongi ja Hangwana na bhena bhapakubhehe na machili na Mboomo handa ja halondoi Aeliya. Bhapakuhitendebhua mitima ya atati yaajendele bhana bhabhenji na bhapakwatendanga bhabhangajoanga bhagananikie ngani yaambone na bhaabhekelange maha Bhandu bhabhe.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Achakalia bhakaakonya bhena akaatumichi bha Kunani Kulihunde bha Hangwana, “Nga chilebhe niki chichipa kunangiha chikubho heche? Nenga nga chihokolo na hanu bhangu bhatekongopala.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Antumichi bhena bha Kunani kulihunde bhakaajangula Azakalia, “Nenga nga Agabulieli, antumichi bha Annoongo ndumitwe kulongela na mwenga, Ngani heje Jammbone. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Nangocheni, ligongo mwangajohanikia ganannobholile mpakubhehe ngalongela, nkombola hopo kulongela mpaka lichobha chigapakubhokela genago ligongo mwanganyohanikia malobhe gangu, na genago gapakubhokela kwa muda gwakwe.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Wakati gonogwe, bhandu bhoha bhatendita kwaalendelela Azakalia kongo bhabhi kangachanga kwaniki bhakaabhite muno mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Pabhakabhoka panja, bhakombola hopo kulongela nabho. Bahi bhandu bhakahimanya kubhehe bhaibhonite yakangachika Mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo. Nambo bhatendita kulongela nabho kwa hilolelo kwa mabhoko, ligongo bhakibha ngakombola kulongela.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Pabhakajomola machobha gabhe gakutenda lihengo lyabhe lya kukung'a mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo, Azakalia bhakabhuja kwaachabhe. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Baada ja machobha Aelizabeti hanu bhabhe bhakajukuta chitumbo. Bhakatama nkati kwa mihei nhano. Bhakalobhola, <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />“Hene nga chibhandendile Hangwana mu machobha gangani bhatekongolee kiha na bhandendile gammbone.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kubhelekwa kwa Ayesu kutendakutangachwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Mu mwehi gwa sita gwa chitumbo cha Aelizabeti Annoongo bhakaatuma Agabulieli antumichi bha kunani Kulihunde gwa Hangwana bhajaule kono mu chilambo cha Kunazaleti kono Kugalilaya, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />kwa haikege jumo nhenja bhabhankema Amalia bhabhalombwite na mundu bhamo lihina lyake Achupu bha lilagwa cha Adaudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Antumichi bha Kunani Kulihunde bhakahika na kwaachalimia, “Hangwana bhabhii pamo na mwenga ntekubhalikiwa!”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Amalia pabhajowinaje malobhe hago bhakachikonya muno na kuganikiha muno maana ja chalamu heyo. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Nambo antumichi bha Kunani Kulihunde bha Annoongo, bhakalobholela Amalia, “Nkontokujogopa Annoongo bhatekuntendela gammbone. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Kwakubhehe, mpakupata chitumbo mpakubheleka mwana mwanalome na mwenga mpakumpekea lihina lyake Ayesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Bhenabho bhapakubhehe amundu bha mamulaka na bhapakwakema amwana bha Annoongo Bhabhabhii Nnani Muno. Na bhena bhapakubhehe ukolo handa atati bhabhe Adaudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Henela bhapakuchihukumula chilagwa cha Ayakobo machobha goha na ukolo gwabhe ngabhehe na majomokelo!”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Amalia bhakaajangula, “Hikomboleka bholi genago na nenga naamanya hopo mwanalome?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Antumichi bha Kunani Kulihunde gubhaajangwilaje Amalia, “Mboomo ja Annoongo jipakunhikila na machili gabhe Annoongo bhabhabhile kunani muno gapakunwekela handa nheka na bhenabho bhabhabhile kwa ligongo lya Annoongo bhabhapakubhelekwa bhapakemwa Mwana jwa Annoongo. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Nnole halongo bhinu Aelizabeti, bhenabho bhabhakakemwa ntonga bhapetwile chitumbo bhabhi bhakongopile, na gongo nga mwehi gwabhe gwa chita kwa bhenabho yakubhehe bhandu bhakaimanyanga kubhehe ntonga. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Kwa maana chaakwa chilebhe changakomboleka kwa Annoongo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Amalia bhakalobhola, “Nenga nga antumichi bha Hangwana, nndendele handa chinnongile.” Ngapena bhenibhala Antumichi bha Kunani Kulihunde bhakajaula.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amalia bhatenda kwaatyangila Aelizabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Mu machobha gogogo Amalia bhakatabha ulendo kujenda kwa chindema mpaka chilambo chimo chichibhile mu matombi ga Yudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Konokwe Amalia bhakajingila mu nyuumba ja Azakalia, bhakaachalimia Aelizabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Aelizabeti pabhalijoa lilobhe lya Amalia bhabhi kwaachalimia, popopo mwana jwakibha mulutumbo lwa Aelizabeti bhakajemeka kuhina hina. Na bhena Aelizabeti bhakatweelelwa na Mboomo ja Annoongo, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />bhakalobhola kwa lilobhe likolongwa, “Mwenga ntekutendelwa gammbone na kupunda hakaikege bhoha, na jono jumpakummeleka bhaatendile gammbone. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Nambo kwaniki chilebhe heche chibhokile nenga hata anyoogolo bha Hangwana bhangu bhaike kwachangu? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Pangajoha ntenda kunjalimia, kachoko tu mwana jwabhile mulutumbo lwangu bhakahina hina kwa kuhangalala. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Mbaya jinu mwenga chibhantendile gammbone kila chinnongile chipakutendekwa.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amalia bhatenda kwatukucha Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Ngapena Amalia bhakalobhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">“Ntima ngwangu gutenda kwaatukucha Hangwana,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />ndenda kuhachuka Mu Annoongo bhabhile amwokochi bhangu.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Kwa kubhehe bhatekulolekea kiha bhatekungombokela kuchitulua kwa antumichi bhabhe. Henela kubhokela nangocheni hibhelei yoha hipakungema nenga ndendwile gammbone.<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Kwa kubhehe Annoongo bhena hakola machili goha bhandendite makolongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">lihina lyabhe bhene jika jabhe nga bhammbone muno.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />kiha jabhe kwa bhandu bhabhaatopea Anoongo muno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:50">hutama machobha goha chibhelei kwa chibhelei.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Bhateendite makolongwa kwa machili gabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">bhatekwapwilingania bhabhakolite na mbwinya mu maganikilo ga mu mitima jabhenji.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />bhatekwabhoa akaapalume kubhoka mu mamulaka gabhenji nambo bhatekwakweanga bhabhachituluanga,<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Bhabha kweti njala bhatekwajukutia hilebhe yammbone na akola hilebhe bhatekwaleka bhangali chilebhe.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Bhatekuchijangatila antumichi jwabhe Aisilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54">bhakombokile ahadi jabhe jakwaakolela kiha.<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Handa chikaalobhelolea akaatati bhitu na handa jibhakaalobholela kwa akahokolo bhitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:55">Abulaimu na ubhelehi gwabhe goha machobha goha.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Amalia bhakatama kwa Aelizabeti kwa muda gwa mihehi jitatu ngapena bhakabhuja kwaachabhe.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhelekwa kwa Ayohana Am'batichaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Muda gwa kuchijogola kwabhe Aelizabeti gukaika nabhena bhakachijogola mwana mwanalome. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Andami na bhandu bha halongo bhabhe bhakapatanga ngani yakubhehe Hangwana bhatekwaabhonela kiha ngolongwa, bhakaahachukanga pamo na akaalongo bhabhe Aelizabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Lichobha lya nane bhakahikanga kuhina mwana, hakaanung'una bhabhe bhakapalita kumpekehanga lihina lya Achakalia, atati bhabhe. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Nambo hanyongo bhabhe bhakalobholela, “Ngabha bahi apakemwa Ayohana.” <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Akaanung'una bhabhe bhakaalobholela, “Mbona jakwa johajola mu chilagwa chabhe jwene lihina Ayohana.” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Bhandu bhakaakonya kwa hilolelo atati bhabhe Azakalia bhapatange kuimanya atati bhabhe bhakapala bhampekehe lihina niki. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Nabhena bhakajopa chibao chakujandikila, na bhakajaandika henela, “Lihina lya mwana nga Ayohana” Na bhandu bhoha bhakakangacha. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Popopo Azakalia bhakajemeka kulongela kabhele bhabhi kwalumbalila Annoongo. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Akaandami bhoa bhakajingilwanga na nkangachiko, na ngani heyo jikajenela kooha mu chilambo cha hitombi ya Kuyudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Bhoha bhabhakajohanikia hikubho heyo, bhakaganikianga mu mitima yabhenji bhakalobholanga, “Bholi, Mwana hojo hapakubhe mundu jwa mamuna niki?” Maana hakika machili ga Hangwana gakibha pamo na jonojwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulondoi gwa Azakalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Ngapena Azakalia, atati bhabhe Ayohana bhakatwelelwa Mboomo ja Annoongo nabhena bhakalobhola ulondoi hogo,<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Bhalumbalilwe Hangwana Annoongo bha ku Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">kwa kubhehe bhatekwahikilanga na kwakomboa bhandu bhabhe.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Bhate kutupekea mwokochi akola machili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">mmelehi jwa Adaudi antumichi bhabhe.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Handa Annoongo chibhakalobhola pena kandai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:70">kupetela akaalondoi bhabhakabhekwa ligongo lyabhe,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />kubhehe bhapakutubhoa mmabhoko ga akapwati bhitu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:71">na kubhoka kwa bhandu bhabhatuchimwaanga.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Bhakalobhola bhapakulangia kiha kwa akanohota bhitu, na kwaatendelanga gammbone</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">na kombokela lilagano bhabhakalibheka ligongo lya bhena mweene.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Handa chibhakalagia atati bhitu Aibulahimu kwa kulapila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:73">yakubhehe bhapakutupekea twenga bhalaka.<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />bhapakutubhoa kubhoka mmabhoko ga akaapwati bhitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:74">ili kutukombolea twenga kwaatumikila pangali bhoga,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />na kubhehe upande gwabhe na kondekwa nnoongi jabhe mu machobha gitu goha.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Na mwenga mwanangu, mpakemwa alondohi bha Annoongo bhabhabhi kunani muno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">mpakwalongolela Hangwana na kwaalakia ndela ligongo lya bhena.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Kwatangachianga bhandu yakubhe bhapakuokolewanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:77">kwa ndela ja kulekelelwa yaambi yabhenji.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Ligongo lya kuchitimalika na kiha ya Annoongo bhitu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">na nhana gwa wokopu gwabhe gupakutumulikila kubhoka kunani,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />na nhana gukombole kwaamulikilanga bhoha bhabhatamanga mu lubhendu lukolongwa lwa malilo, na kututandaa mu ndela ja amani.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Mwana jonojwe hakakola, na bhakapata machili mu mboomo. Na mwana jonojwe akatama palulemba mpaka lichobha lyaakachilangia kwa bhandu bha kuisilaeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Kubhelekwa kwa Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Amatayo 1:18-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Machobha gala Aguchitino akolo bha ku Loma, bhakalagia bhandu bhoha bha Kuloma bhabhalanganikwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Kubhalanganwa konokwe kukibha kwa mala ja kwanja, wakati Akulenio pabhakibha akolo mu chilambo cha Kusilia. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Bahi, bhandu bhoha bhakajaulanga kubhalanganikwanga kila mundu na chilambo chakwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Achupu kabhele bhakabhoka chilambo cha Kunazaleti, chichibhi mu chilambo cha Kugalilaya na kujaula mu chilambo cha kubetelehemu chichibhi kuyuda. Achupu bhakajaula konokwe ligongo bhakabhokela mu chilagwa cha Adaudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Bhakajaulanga konokwe kubhalanganikwa pamo na hanu bhabhe Amaliamu bhakibha bhajukwite chitumbo. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Pabhakibhanga konokwe Kubetelehemu, machobha gabhe ga kuchijogola Amalia likaika, <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />bhakachijogola mwana jwabhe mwanalome jwa litibho, bhakanhweka maanjala, bhakang'oneka mu lipelekete lya kubhacha lya kuliha hinyama ligongo bhangapatanga napachi mu nnyumba ja hakaageni.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhatumichi bha Kunani Kulihunde bha Annoongo bhaabhokelanga bhabhalianga hinyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Mahali penapo pakibha na bhakulianga bhabhakibhanga bhakitamanga kubhandikila na bhatenda kulendelanga hinyama yabhenji kilo. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Akaatumichi bha kunani kulihunde bha Hangwana gubhabhokilaje chikang'ang'anua, na nhana gwa kung'anyima gwa Annoongo gukaamulikilanga kohakoha, bhenaangota bhakajogopanga muno. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Nambo antumichi bha Hangwana gubhakalobhola, “Nkotokujogopa! ndekunnetelanga ngani jammbone ja jipakubhehe jakuhangalala kwa bhandu bhoha bha Kuisilaeli. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Kwa maana, leleni mu chilambo cha Adaudi, atekubhelekwa mwokochi ligongo linunji, nga Akilichito Hangwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Chenjeni chipakubhehe nga nnolelo kwaachinunji, Mpakunkolela mwana chilemba bhanwekite maanjala, bhanng'onike palipelekete lya kubhacha lya kuliha hinyama.” <verse eid="LUK 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Na popopo likabhonekana lilubhalo likolongwa lya akaatumichi bha kunani kulihunde bhabhi bhabhilinge na bhenibhala antumichi bhabhikwatukucha Annoongo bhakalobhola, <verse eid="LUK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Bhatukuchwe Annoongo kunani kulihunde, na pambani pachilambo pabhehe na amani kwa bhandu bhoha bhabhapalite!” <verse eid="LUK 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Bheni bhala bhatumichi bha kunani kulihunde bha Hangwana bhabhapaleka na kujaula kunani kulihunde, akaachugaji bhakalobholelana, “Tujaulange mu chilambo cha Kubetelehemu yakubhehe Hangwana bhatulobholile.” <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Bahi, bhakajaulanga chindema, bhakaakolela Amalia na Achupu na jonijola mwana chilemba bhang'onikinge pakuliya hinyama. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Pabhakabhona mwana hojwe bhakalobholelanga bhandu bhangi ngani hibhakalobholelwanga na bhatumichi bha kunani kulihunde nnani ja jono mwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Bhandu bhoha bhabhakajohanga ngani jibhakalobholelwanga na bhachungaji bhakakangachanga muno. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Nambo Amalia bhakahibheka ngani muntima gwabhe na kuganikia. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Bhenibhala akaachungaji bhakabhujanga palulemba, kongo bhabhi kwaatopea Annoongo na kwalumbalila kwa gabhakalobholelwanga na kugabhona.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana bhampekeanga lihina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Mu lichobha lya nane, mwana bhakanhina na bhakampekea lihina Ayesu, lihina libhakapekewa na bhatumichi bha kunani kulihunde bhahi tangu Amalia kupata chitumbo.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhapelekwa mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Machobha ga kuchiking'inda Amalia pagakajomoka handa chiipaalikwa na chelia, hakabhelei habho bhakantolanga mwana, kujaula najo ku Yelusalemu ili bhammeke nnoongi ja Hangwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Handa jiijandikwe mu chelia ja Hangwana, “Kila habhelei bha kujemeka mwanalome bhapakubhokekwa ligongo lya lihengo lya Hangwana.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Kabhele bhakajaulanga ili bhabhoange mbeeko, njebha hibhele au mabhunda gabhele ga nguunda, handa chiipalikwa mu chelia ja Hangwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Muda hogwe konokwe mu Yelusalemu kukibha na mundu jumo, lihina lyabhe Asimeoni. Amundu bhenabho bhatendita kutenda hikubho yammbone nnongi ja Annoongo. Amundu bhenabho bhatendita kulendela ukombohi gwa bhandu bha Kuisilaeli. Na bhenabho bhakibha na Mboomo ja Annoongo. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Mboomo ja Annoongo bhakabhehe bhatekwaakikichia ngawee tangu bhangammona Akilichito bhabhaagulikwe na Hangwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Bahi Asimoni bhakahika pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo bhabhi kwaatandaa na Mboomo ja Annoongo na akaabheli bha Ayesu bhakannetanga mwana jwabhenji Ayesu pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo handa chiipalikwa na chelia, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Asimoni bhakantola mwana Ayesu mmabhoko gabhe kongo bhabhikwalumbalila Annoongo, bhakalobhola,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Hangwana nangocheni, ntendite handa chinkalobhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">mwaleke antumichi bhinu bhagoloke maha.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Kwa miho gangu ndekugubhona ukombohi ginu,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />yakubhe ntekuyalicha gabhonekane kwa bhandu bha hilambo yoha,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Gongoni nga nhana gugupakwamulika bhandu bhabhangaamanya Annoongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:32">na ukolo kwa bhandu bha Kuisilaeli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Atati bhabhe Ayesu na hanyoongo bhabhe Ayesu bhakibha bhatenda kangachaanga genigala gagakalobholekwa nnani ja mwana jwabhenji. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Bahi Asimeoni bhakaapetelanga machi, bhakaalobholela Amalia hanyoongo bhabhe Ayesu, “Nnyoonikie mwana hojojo bhabheelikwe kwa ligongo kugwee na kuokolewa kwa bhandu bhajingi bha Isilaeli. Nabhena apakubhehe chilolelo kubhoka kwa Annoongo hiipakanikwa na bhandu bhajingi, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />na ili maganikilo ga bhandu bhajingi gabhonekane pangali kuchiiya. Namwenga, mwabhene, mpakubhehe na kuhechuka kukolongwa.” <verse eid="LUK 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Pakibha na haikege bhamo na bhena bhakibha halondoi bha Annoongo, lihina lyabhe Aana amwali bha Afanueli, bha chilongelo cha Aasheli. Mu umwali gwabhe bhakalombwa na kutama yaaka saba tu na hangwana bhabhe. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Nambo bhakaigalila nhwelwa mpaka pabhakahikila yaaka makomi nane na ncheche. Muuda gonogwe bhakibha ngabhoka pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo bhakatama pangali kulyee nga bhakaajopa Annoongo kilo na muhi. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Popopo Aana bhakachipia nnongi ja Achupu na Amalia bhakaachukulu Annoongo, nakujeenela ngani ja mwana jonojwe kwa bhandu bhoha bhabhatendita kulendelanga kwaakomboanga na kulekelelwa kwa bhandu bha Kuyelusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayusufu na Amalia bhabhuja Kunazaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Akaabhelei bha Ayesu pabhaakajomolanga kutenda goha gagaapaalikwa na chelia ja Hangwana, bhakabhujanga kwachabheenji mu chilambo cha Kunazaleti mu chilambo cha Kugalilaya, <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Amwana Ayesu bhakakola, bhakapunda kubhehe na machili, bhakatweeleelwa malango, na wema gwa Annoongo gukibha pamo nabho.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana Ayesu bhajaula pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Akaabhelei bha Ayesu bhakibhanga bhayobhalilinge kujaulanga Kuyesalemu kila chaaka wakati gwa lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Ayesu pabhakibha na yaaka komi na hibhele, bhakajaulanga pamo na nabho mu lichobha likolongwa handa chibhayobhalilike. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Achupu na Amalia pabhakajomolanga kuhangalala, bhakajemekanga ulendo gwa kubhujaanga kwachabheenji nambo Ayesu bhakaigalila Kuyeluchalemu pangali kuimanya akaabhelei bhabhenji. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Bhakaganikianga kubhehe bhakibha pamo na lilubhalo lya bhandu bhabhakibhanga mu hulendo, bhakajendanga muhi goha bahi bhakajemekanga kunnolehanga mwakaalongo bhabhe na mmagaanja. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Pabhakalepelanga kwabhona, bhakabhujanga ku Yelusalemu kwaalolea.<verse eid="LUK 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Lichobha lya tatu, bhakaakolela bhatamite pakati ja bhaalimu bhachelia pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo bhakibha atendakwaajonikia na kwaakonyanga machwali. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Bhoa bhabhakajoanga malobhe gakwe bhakakangachanga luunda lwabhe na namuna chibhatendita kwaajangulanga. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Akaabheli bhakwe pabhaakammona bhakakangachanga. Amaliamu anyongo bhabhe, bhakaakonya Ayesu, “Gwe mwanangu nga niki chintutendile henela? Nenga na atati bhinu tutendita kunnolea kongoni tubhile na bhooga.” <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Ayesu bhakaakonyanga, “Kwa niki ntenda konolea? Bholi mwangaimanya kubhehe mbaalikwa kubhehe pa Nyuumba ja Atati bhangu?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Nambo akaabhelei bhabhe bhangaimanya maana gakwe gabhaalongililinge. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakabhuja pamo na bhenaangota mpaka ku Nazaleti, nambo anyongo akagabheka genago mu ntima gwakwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Nabhena Ayesu bhakapunda kukola mu malango na kutandamala, na kupunda kupaalikwa na Annoongo na bhandu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Ayohana Am'batichaji bhatenda kwaatangachianga bhandu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Amatayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Amaluko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Ayohana 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Mu chaka cha komi na nhano cha utawala gwa ukolo gwa Akaichali Tibelio, Apontio Pilato bhakibha akolongwa bha Kuyuda. Ahelode bhakabhehe akolo bha ku Galilaya, na hanug'una bhabhe Apilipo bhakibha akolo bha Kuitulea na Kutulakoniki. Na Alusania bhakibha akolo bha ku Abilene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />na Aanasi na Akayafa bhakibhanga bhakukung'na bhakolongwa. Wakati gonogwe lilobhe lya Annoongo likaikila Ayohana amwana bha Achakalia, konokwe palulema. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Bahi, Ayohana bhakajaula mu hilambo yoha hiibhii ngulugulu mwa loochi lwa ku Yolodani. Bhakabhe bhatenda kwaubilianga ligongo bhandu bhakotimange na kubhatichwa ili Annoongo bhabhokange mu yaambi. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Handa chiijaandikwe mu chitabhu cha Alondoi bha Annoongo Aichaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">“Lilobhe lya mundu litendakema kubhoka palulema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Munhalakiange ndela ja Hangwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">nnyululange mu chehemu bhabhapala kupeta.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Kila likote lipakuyelelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">litombi na hitombi hipakuyalagalilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">papapendite bhapakunyulula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">na ndela yangali mmbone hipakuhalakilwa maha.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Na, bhandu bhoha bhapakugubhona bhokopu kubhoka kwa Annoongo.’”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Bahi, Ayohana bhakaalobholelanga lilubhalo lya bhandu bhajingi bhabhahikanga ili bhabatichwe, “Mwaangota ubhelehi gwa lijoka! Nga ganiki bhabhankongolilinge mpakombola kujibhutuka lilaka lya Annoongo jijibhandikile kuhika? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Nnangiange kwa hikubho yakubhe nnekitinge chaambi. Nkotokujemakanga nangocheni kuchilobholelanga mumitima jinunji, ‘Tubhi nabho atati bhitu Aibulahimu!’ Ndendakunnobholelanga ukweli, Annoongo bhakombola kugalobholela maganga gangani kubhehe bhana bha Aibulahimu. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Bahi, libhago libhekitwe maha pamikega ja mikongo, henela kila nkongo gwanga hogola mabibho gambone gupakuheketwa na kugujeha pamoto.” <verse eid="LUK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Na nkutuli gwa bhandu gukaakonya, “Tutende niki bahi?” <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Ayohana bhakajangula, “Jwaabhile na ngobho hibhele hampekehe jwaanga ngobho, na jonijola jwaabhile na chakulya bhampekee nnyakwe.” <verse eid="LUK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Nabhena bhabhatochanga kodi bhakaikanga ili bhabatichwe, gubhaakonyitaje Ayohana, “Bhaajigana natwenga, tutende niki?” <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Nabhena bhakalobholela, “Nkotokutolanga kodi kupeta chibhannobholile.” <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Ngapena manyemba bhakaankonya Ayohana, “Natwenga tutende niki?” Nabhena Ayohana bhakaajangula, “Nkotokwaapokonyolanga hilebhe ya bhandu kwa machili wala kwahukumula kwa unami. Nkolonikange na nchahala gwinunji.” <verse eid="LUK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Bhandu bhoha bhakibhanga bhalendelanga kuhika kwa bhena Akilichito bhabhaagulikwe na Hangwana, na bhenaangota bhatendita kuchikonya konya mu mitima jabhenji nnani ja Ayohana komboleka habha nga bheni bhala Akilichito yakubhehe Annoongo bhabhatumite. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Penapo Ayohana bhakajangulanga bhoha, “Nenga ndenda kummatichanga kwa machi, nambo bhatenda kuika bhabhakolite na machili kumbeta nenga na nenga ngapalikwa hopo kujogola migoji ya champali yabhe na bhenabho bhapakummatichanga kwa Mboomo ja Annoongo na mooto. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Bhanabho bhatekola na chipalo chakupepetela mmabhoko gabhe na bhena bhapakuhalakia pakukobhatela mapemba, na kukumba mapemba gammbone na kubheka mu ngokwe na mapohi na kugajocha mooto gwangahimika.” <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Kwa malobhe gangi gajingi Ayohana bhakaalobholelanga bhandu bhalekange yaambi kwa kwaakongolelanga Ngani Jammbone. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Nambo Ayohana pabhakaakalipila akolo Ahelode, ligongo bhaatolite Ahelodia hanu bha anung'una bhabhe, na gabhou goa gabhatendite. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Ngapena Ahelode bhakapundia ubhou gwabhe kwa kwatabha mu ligelecha Ayohana.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayesu bhatenda kubhatichwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Amatayo 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Amaluko 1:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Bhandu bhoha pabhatendita kubatichwanga na bhena Ayesu bhakabatichwa. Na pabhatendita kujopa, kunani kulihunde kukajogoka, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Mboomo ja Annoongo akatulukia hakibha handa njebha. Lilobhe likajoanika kubhoka kunani kulihunde, “Gwenga nga amwana jwangu junampala, ndekubhajilwa namwenga.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilagwa cha Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Amatayo 1:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Ayesu pabhakajemeka lihengo lyabhe, na bhakibha na yaaka makomi gatatu, na bhandu bhakaganikia bhena bhakibha nga amwana bha Achupu na Achupu bhabhakibha amwana bha Aheli. <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Aheli bhakibha amwana bha Amatali, na Amatati bhakibha amwana bha Alawi, na Alawi bhakibha amwana bha Ameliki, na Ameliki bhakibha amwana bha Ayanai, na Ayanai bhakibha amwana bha Achupu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />na Achupu bhakibha amwana bha Amatia, na Amatati bhakibha amwana bha Aamochi, na Aamochi bhakibha amwana bha Anahumu, na Anahumu bhakibha mwana jwa Ahechili, na Ahechili bhakibha mwana jwa Anagai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />na Anagai bhakibha mwana bha Amaati, na Amaati bhakibha mwana bha Amatatia, na Amatatia bhakibha amwana bha Achemeni, na Achemeni bhakibha mwana jwa Ayocheki, na Ayocheki bhakibha amwana bha Ayoda <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />na Ayoda bhakibha mwana jwa Ayohanani, na Ayohanani bhakibha mwana jwa Alesa na Alesa bhakibha mwana jwa Azelubabeli, na Achelubabeli bhakibha mwana jwa Asheatieli na Asheatieli bhakibha mwana jwa Aneli, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />na Aneli, bhakibha mwana jwa Aameliki, na Ameliki bhakibha mwana jwa Bahi, na Bahi bhakibha mwana jwa Akochamu, na Akosamu bhabhakibha mwana jwa Aelimadamu, na Aelimadamu bhakibha mwana jwa Aeli, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />na Aeli bhabhakibha mwana jwa Ayochua, na Ayoshua bhakibha amwana jwa Aeliezeli, na Aeliezeli bhakibha mwana jwa Ayolimu, na Ayolimu bhakibha mwana jwa Amatati, na Amatati bhakibha mwana jwa Alawi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />na Alawi bhabhakibha mwana jwa Asimeoni, na Asimeoni bhakibha mwana jwa Ayuda, na Ayuda bhakibha mwana jwa Achupu, na Achupu bhakibha mwana jwa Ayonamu, na Ayonamu bhakibha mwana jwa Aeliakimu, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />na Aeliakimu bhakibha mwana jwa Amelea, na Amelea bhakibha mwana jwa Amena na Amena bhakibha mwana jwa Anatani, na Anatani bhakibha mwana jwa Adaudi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />na Adaudi bhabhakibha mwana jwa Ayese, na Ayese bhakibha mwana jwa Aobedi, na Aobedi bhakibha mwana jwa Aboazi, na Aboazi bhakibha mwana jwa Asolomoni, na Asolomoni bhakibha mwana jwa Anashoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />na Anashoni bhakibha mwana jwa Aminadabu, na Aminadabu bhakibha mwana jwa Aadimini, na Aadimini bhakibha mwana jwa Aalini, na Aalini bhakibha mwana jwa Ahesiloni, na Ahesiloni bhakibha mwana jwa Apelesi, na Apelesi bhakibha mwana jwa Ayuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />na Ayuda bhabhakibha mwana jwa Ayakobo, na Ayakobo bhakibha mwana jwa Aisaka, na Aisaka bhakibha mwana jwa Abulaamu, na Abulaamu bhakibha mwana jwa Atela, na Atela bhakibha mwana jwa Anaoli, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />na Anaoli bhakibha mwana jwa Achelugi, na Aselugi bhakibha mwana jwa Aleu, na Aleu bhakibha mwana jwa Apelegi, na Apelegi bhakibha mwana jwa Aebeli, na Aebeli bhakibha mwana jwa Ashela, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />na Achela bhakibha mwana jwa Akainamu, na Akainamu bhakibha mwana jwa Alufakisadi, na Alufakisadi bhakibha mwana jwa Ashemu, na Ashemu bhakibha mwana jwa Anoa, na Anoa bhakibha mwana jwa Alameki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />na Alameki bhakibha mwana jwa Ametusela, na Ametusela bhakibha mwana jwa Ahenoki, na Ahenoki bhakibha mwana jwa Ayaledi, na Ayaledi bhakibha mwana jwa Amahalaleli, na Amahalaleli bhakibha mwana jwa Akainamu, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />na Akainamu bhakibha mwana jwa Aenoshi, na Aenoshi bhakibha mwana jwa Aseti, na Aseti bhakibha mwana jwa Aadamu, bhakibha bha Annoongo.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kwaalenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Amatayo 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Amaluko 1:12-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Ayesu bhakabhoka kuloochi lwa Yolodani bhakibha bhatekutwelela Mboomjo ja Annoongo bhakaatandaha na mboomo ja Annoongo kujaula palulemba. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Konokwe bhakaajiga na alichetani kwa machobha makomi ncheche. Muda goha bhakibha bhanga lyehe chohachela, na baada ja machobha hago bhakabhehe na njala. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Ngapena alichetani bhakaalobholela, “Handa mwenga nga amwana bha Annoongo, ntendebhue maganga kubhehe nkate.” <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Ayesu gubhaajangwiliaje, “Jijaandikwe mu chitabu cha Annoongo amundu bhalama hopo kwa kulyehe nkate jika.” <verse eid="LUK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Ngapena lichetani bhakaapetula mpaka kulitombi kundepela na kwaalangiha guna kamo palume jabhe joha pachilambo. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Ngapena lichetani bhakaalobholela Ayesu, “Mbakunpekeha ukolo goha na kuhalala kwakwe ligongo heye yoha mbatite nenga na ndenda kombola kwaapekeha joha jola junampalana. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Na yoha heye mbakumpekeha kubhehe jinu handa mpakungotimiha na kunyopa.” <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Ayesu gubhajangwilaje, “Lichetani hitekujaandikwa mu majandiko ga Annoongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:8">‘Mpakwakotimila Hangwana Annoongo bhinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:8">na kwaachalila bhenabho jika jabhe!’”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Alichetani bhakaatola Ayesu na kumpeleka mpaka Kuyeluchalemu, na kwabheka nnani ja Nnaala gwa Nyuumba Ja Annoongo na kwaalobholela, “Handa mwenga nga mwana bha Annoongo, nchigwie pahi kubhoka pambani. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Kwakubhe hitekujaandikwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:10">‘Annoongo bhapakwaatumanga akatumichi bhabhe bha kunani kulihunde bhannendele,’<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />na kabhele, ‘Bhapakumpetula mmabhoko gabhenji</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:11">nkoto kobhanduka lukongono lwinu paliganga.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Nambo Ayesu bhakaajangula, “Bhakaalobholela kabhele hitekujaandikwa, ‘Nkotokwaajiga Hangwana Annoongo bhinu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Lichetani pabhakajomola kwaalenga kwa kila ndela, bhakanneka kwa muuda gugupaalikwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayesu bhatenda kujemeka lihengo lyabhe konokwe ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Amatayo 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Amaluko 1:14-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Penapo Ayesu bhakabhuja ku Galilaya bhabhi bhatwelile Mboomo ja Annoongo, na ngani yabhe hikajenela mu Kugalilaya na hilambo yoha hiikabhandikila. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Nabhena bhakibha bhatenda kwajigananga bhandu mu nyuumba ya kongana Bhayahudi na bhandu bhoha bhakibha bhaalumbalila bhenabho.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayesu bhatenda kanikwa konokwe ku Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Amatayo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Amaluko 6:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Bahi, Ayesu bhakajaula mu chilambo cha ku Nazaleti, chilambo chibhakakolile, na Lichobha lya Kupomolela jijikakemwa Sabato, bhakajingila mu nyuumba ja kongananga Bhayahudi. Bhakajema ili bhachoome majandiko ga Annoongo kwa lilobhe. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Bhakapokela chitabu cha Aisaya, halondoi bha Annoongo, na bhakachiiligula bhakalolea bhakakongana na chehemu jijijandikwe henela.<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Mboomo ja Hangwana jibhi pamo na nenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">kwakubhehe bhatekuhagula</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">kubhaletela akahaocho Ngani Jammbone.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Bhatekunduma nintangachiange bhabhakatabhwa kujogolekwa kwabhenji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">na bhangalolanga bhakombolange kulola kabhele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">bhandumite kwalekelelanga bhabhabhabhonelwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />Na kutangacha chaaka cha Hangwana chichikondekwa.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Baada ja kuchoma, bhakachiiliga chitabu chela, bhakaapekeha antumichi, ngapena bhakatama, bhandu bhoha bhabhakabhehe mu Nyuumba ja konganilanga Bhayahudi bhakaalolekea miho. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakajemeka kwaalobholelanga, “Leleni majandiko gangani gatekwela handa chintekujohanga.” <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Bhandu bhoha bhakaapala na bhakakangachanga malobhe ga mmbone gabhatendita kulongela, bhakibha bhatenda kukonyana, “Ngati, habha ngabha mwana jwa Achupu?” <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Ayesu bhakalobholelanga, “Niimanyi mpanobholela chilongelo heche, ‘Anng'anga, nchilamie mwabhene.’ Hikubho hiitendite konikola ku Kapelenaumu mugatende na pambani kwaachinu.” <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Bhakaendelea kulongela, “Kweli nannobholelanga, bhakwa halondoi bha Annoongo bhakondekwa mu chilambo chabhe. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Nambo, nnyohanikiange! kweli kukibha na bhawelwa bhajingi mu chilambo cha ku Isilaeli wakati gwa Aelia. Kunani kukatabhwa na hula jakibha hopo kwa yaaka hitatu na miheyi sita, kukabhe na njala ja likuluta mu chilambo choha. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Hata henela, Aelia bhangalagikiwa kwa bhawelwa bhoha bhala ila kwa haikege hawelwa bha ku Selepati mu chilambo cha Kusidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Kabhele, mu chilambo cha ku Isilaeli wakati gwa Aelisha kukibha na akatamwa mambujupuju bhajingi. Hata henela, bhakwa bhohabhala bhabhakalama ila tu Anaamani amundu kubhoka chilambo cha ku Silia.” <verse eid="LUK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Bhandu bhoha bhabhakibha mu jenijela nyuumba ja konganilanga Bhayahudi pabhakajohanga genago bhakachimwanga na kutumbala muno. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Bhakajemanga, bhakaapia panja Ayesu bhakakamula chiminya nkwekwe na kwaapeleka kundepela ja litombi, ili bhaanokolele palichembo. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Nambo Ayesu bhakapeta pakati jabhenji, bhakajaula.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kulibhoa lihoka kubhoka kwa amundu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Amaluko 1:21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakatuluka mpaka ku Kapelenaumu ku ngome ja ku Galilaya, na Lichobha lya Kupomolela bhakajemeka kujigana bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Bhakakangachanga muno na majigano gabhe, bhakajigana kwa mamulaka. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Na mu nyuumba ja konganilanga Bhayahudi na mundu bhabhakibha bhabhapoganikwe na mahoka, bhakapota nyenye kwa lilobhe likolongwa na kongo bhabhikulongela. <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Mpala kututenda niki mwe mwa Ayesu bha ku Kunachaleti? Bholi, ntekuhika kututiniha? Ndenda kummanya yakubhehe mwenga nga ganiki. Mwenga nga bhammekitwe ligongo lya Annoongo!” <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Ayesu bhakaakalipila bheni bhala lihoka, bhakilobhola, “Nkotoke jii Mummoke mundu hojo!” Pena jono lihoka likaagwia pahi mundu jola nnoongi ja bhandu na likaabhoka pangali kwaulaha nnnongi ja bhoha. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Bhandu bhoha bhakakangachanga, bhatendita kulobholelana, “Lyende nga lijigano lya namuna niki, habha amundu bhatekola uwecho na machili gakulumikiha mahoka gabhoke na genago gatenda kubhoka.” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Ngani ja Ayesu hikajenela kila mahali hiikatindila mu chehemu joha.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhaalamia bhandu bhajingi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Amatayo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Amaluko 1:29-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Ayesu bhakabhoka mu jeni jela Nyuumba ja konganilanga Bhayahudi na bhakajaula kaja kwa Asimoni. Bhakaajopa Ayesu bhaalamie hakibhabhe Asimoni kwa kubhehe bhakibha na chitamwa chikolongwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Bahi, Ayesu bhakahika na kujema kubhandikila nabho, bhakachikalipila cheni chela chitamwa, na chenecho chikaaleka. muda gogogo haikege bhakajinuka na kujemeka kwatumikilanga. <verse eid="LUK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Lyobha palikatipika, bhandu bhoha bhakibhanga na akaatamwa bhabhenji kubhokela kutali kutali bhakaaletanga kwa Ayesu, na bhena bhakabheeka mabhoko gabhe nnani ja kila atamwa, na kwaalamianga. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Na genago mahoka gakabhokanga kwa bhandu bhajingi, bhakapotanga nyenye bhakilobhola, “Mwenga nga amwana bha Annoongo!” Nambo Ayesu bhakaakalipilanga na kwaahibhilanga bhakoto kulobhola, kwa maana mahoka bhakaamanya kubhehe bhenabho nga Akilichito bhammekitwe ligongo lya Annoongo.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kutangacha Lilobhe lya Annoongo konokwe ku Yudea</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Amaluko 1:35-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Malabhi jakwe tuputupu, Ayesu bhakabhoka kujaula chehemu pa jika jabhe. Bhandu bhatendita kwaaloleha. Na pabhakahikanga chehemu jibhabhile, bhakalenga kwaahibhila bhakoto kubhoka. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Nambo Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga, “Mbalikwa kutangacha Ngani Jammbone ja Ukolo gwa Annoongo mu hilambo yengi, kwa kubhehe chenecho nga Annoongo chibhandumite ndende.” <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Henela bhakaendelea kutangacha lilobhe lya Annoongo mu Nyuumba ja konganilanga Bhayahudi konokwe Kuyudea.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhakaagula bhanapunji bha kwanja</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Amatayo 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Amaluko 1:16-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Lichobha limo, Ayesu bhakibha bhatekujema nngulugulu ja litanda lya Genesaleti, na nkutuli nkolongwa gwa bhandu bhajingi bhakibha bhatekwaatindila bhabhi kuminyana, bhabhi kujohanikihanga lilobhe lya Annoongo. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Bhakabhona mitumbwi jibhele nngulugulu mwa litanda. Na bhakoka homba bhene bhabhi bhabhokitinge, bhabhi kuhatambula na kuhalakiha mapelele gabhenji. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Baada ja Ayesu kujingila mu ntumbwi gumo gugukabhehe gwa Asimoni, bhakaajopa Achimoni bhagupeleke mu mmachi pakujendea muno kubhoka nngulugulu mwa litanda. Bhakajigananga lilubhalo lya bhandu bhabhi bhatamite mu goni gola ntumbwi <verse eid="LUK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Pabhakajomola kujigana, bhakaalobholela Asimoni, “Nangocheni npeleke ntumbwi mpaka pamachi gakujendea ngapena nkatuluange mapelele ginunji nkakokange homba.” <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Asimoni bhakaajangula, “Mwe mwa Hangwana, tutekuchimilaa kukoka homba kilo choha pangali kupata chilebhe, nambo kwakubhehe nnongile, tupakujaula kutulua mapelele gitu mmachi.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Pabhakajeha mapelele gabhenji mmachi, na pabhakatendanga henela bhakakokanga homba hijingi, na mapelele gabhenji gakajemeka kupapuka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Bhakapotanga himbwele kwaakemanga akaajabhe bhabhakibha mu ntumbwi gongi bhahikange kwajangatilanga. Na bhena bhakahikanga na bhakahitwelehanga mitumbwi yoha hibhele homba, na mitumbwi jabhenji hikabhandikila kutibhila. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Asimoni Apetulo chibhakabhona genago, bhakatindibhala majugwa nnoongi ja Ayesu bhakalobhola, “Hangwana mmoke nnongi jangu, nenga nga mundu bha chaambi!” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Kwa kubhehe bhenabho na ajabhe bhakibha bhatekangachanga muno kwa kukoka homba hijingi. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Hiyoyo Ayakobo na Ayohana, bhana bha Azebedayo, yakubhehe nga bhakoka homba ajabhe Asimoni na bhenabho bhakakangachanga. Penapo Ayesu bhakaalobholela Asimoni, “Nkotokujogopa kwa kubhehe kujemeka nangocheni mpakubhehe hopo bhakoka homba nambo mpakubhehe amundu bha kwaaletanga bhandu kwa Annoongo.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Bahi, baada ja kuhiletanga mitumbwi nngulugulu ja litanda, bhakalekanga kila chilebhe na kwaakagula Ayesu luhaju kwa luhaju.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayesu bhaalamia atamwa mambujupuju</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Amatayo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Amaluko 1:40-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Wakati Ayesu pabhakibha mu chimo cha chilambo cha konokwe, konokwe mundu jumo jwakibha na mambujupuju mmele goha, na bhena pabhakaabhona Ayesu bhakagwee manguku na kwaajopa na kulobhola, “Hangwana, hanampalite, mpakombola kunnamiha ili ngombole kwakotimila Annoongo.” <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Ayesu bhakagunyulula lubhoko lwabhe, kwakwaha bhenibhala mundu na kulobhola, “Ndendakupala, nnyelejeike!” Mala mundu jonojwe mambujupuju gakalama na kondekwa kwaachalila Annoongo. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Na bhena Ayesu bhakaakulumikia, “Nkotokunnolobholela mundu johajola, nambo nnyabhule nkachilangihe kwa akaakung'i, na nkabhohe mbeeko yakubhehe Amusa bhakaamulicha na kondekwa kwaachalila Annoongo gubhehe uchuhuda kwabhenji.” <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Nambo ngani nnani ja Ayesu hikapuunda kujenela kila mahali kupunda wakati gongi goha gola, na malubhalo gajingi ga bhandu bhakibha gakondikininge ili kwaajohanikiha na kulamiwa hitamwa yabhenji. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Hata henela Ayesu bhakajaula mahali pa jika jabhe, na kujopa.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayesu bhalamia amundu bhabhapolite</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Amatayo 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Amaluko 2:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Lichobha limo, Ayesu pabhatendita kwaajigananga bhandu. Mapalichayo na bhakujigana chelia kubhoka mu kila chijiji cha ku Galilaya, ku Yudea na ku Yeluchalemu bhakibha bhatamitinge penapo. Machili ga Hangwana gakibha pamo na Ayesu ligongo lya kwaalamianga bhandu hitamwa yabhenji. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Pena bhandu teno bhakahikanga bhabhi bhaapetwile mundu jumo jwaapolite mmele kongo bhabhi bhanng'onike pachindanda, bhakalenganga kwaajingia nkati, bhaabheke nnongi ja Ayesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Nambo pabhakalepelanga kujingila nkati, ligongo lya kujimbika bhandu. Bahi bhakakwelanga nnani ja litatali lya nyuumba na bhakapobholanga mahali penipala pabhakibha Ayesu na kwaatulua jono ntamwa pamo na chindandaa chabhe, na bhakammeka nnoongi ja Ayesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Nabhena Ayesu pabhakabhona kuhobhalela kwaabhenji, bhakaalobholela bhena amundu, “Aganja ntekulekelelwa mabhou ginu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Bhabhajigana malagilo ga Amusa na Mafalisayo bhakajemekanga kuchikonyanga, “Nga aganiki abhabha bhabhaaponja Annoongo? Jwakwa mundu jwakombola kulekelea mabhou ila nga Annoongo jika jabhe!” <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Ayesu bhakahimanya kuganikiha kwaabhenji, bhakakonyanga, “Kwa niki ntenda kuganikihanga genago mu mumitima jinunji? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Nga chiniki chichibhi cha kupepeka muno, kulobhola, ‘Ntekulekelelwa mabhou ginu,’ au kulobhola, ‘Nnyeme nnyeende?’ <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Bahi, mbala muhimanye kubhehe Mwana jwa Mundu bhatekola mamulaka gakulekelea bhandu mabhou gabhenji pachilambo.” Penapo bhakaalobholela bhenibhala amundu jwapoolite mmele, “Nnyeme, ntole chindanda chinu, nnyabhule kwaachinu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Pena, jono mundu jwaapolite mmele bhakajema nnoongi jabhenji, bhakatola chindanda chabhe chibhatendita kugolokela bhakajaula kwachakwe kongo bhabhi kwalumbalila Annoongo. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Bhandu bhoha bhakakangachanga na bhakahechukanga, bhakaalumbalila Annoongo bhabhikulobholanga, “Leleni tutekugabhona ga kangachika.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kwaakema Alawi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Amatayo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Amaluko 2:13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Pabhakajomola genago, Ayesu bhakapita panja, bhakammona ntocha kodi jumo lina lyabhe Alawi, bhatamite pa nyuumba ja kulepela kodi. Ayesu bhakaalobholela, “Nngagule.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Alawi bhakajinuka, bhakaleka kila chilebhe, na kwaakagula. <verse eid="LUK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Alawi bhakaalakila Ayesu chelehe ngolongwa kwaachabhe. Na lilubhalo likolongwa lya bhatocha kodi na bhandu bhangi bhakibha bhakahika penipala kulyee nabhe. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Nambo Mafalisayo na bhabhajigana malagilo ga Amusa mu lyeni lyela lilubhalo bhakaakokolekelanga bhanapunji bha Ayesu bhabhikulobholanga, “Kwa niki ntendakulyanganga na kung'we pamo na bhatocha kodi na bhabhabhii na mabhou?” <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Ayesu bhakaajangula, “Bhangalwalanga ngabhalolea ang'anga, nambo bhabhalwala nga bhaalolea ang'anga. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Nangaika kwakemanga bhandu bhammbone nnongi ja Annoongo, nambo bhabhabhii na mabhou, bhakombolange kuleka mabhou gabhenji.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda konywa ngani ja kutabha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Amatayo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Amaluko 2:18-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Bhandu bhangi bhakaalobholela Ayesu, “Bhanapunji bha Ayohana Ambatichaji bhatenda kutabha na kujopa, hata bhanapunji Mafalisayo bhatendanga hela hela. Nambo bhanapunji bhinu bhatenda kulyehe na kung'we.” <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Ayesu bhakajangula, “Bholi, mkombolanga kwaatendanga akaageni bha hangwana ulombela kutabha wakati bhakibha pamo nabho? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Nambo wakati gupakuika kubhehe hangwana bha ulombela bhapakutolekwa kubhoka pakati jabhenji, penapo nga pabhapakutabhanga.” <verse eid="LUK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Ayesu bhakalobhola kwa kulandanikiha hoko, “Jwakwa mundu jwaheketa chibhamba mu ngobho jiyono na kutotela mu ngobho ja lolo, bahi handa ntendite henela, bhapakupapula jene ngobho jiyono, na kabhele chene chibhamba cha ngobho jiyono ngabhajilana na ngobho ja lolo. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Kabhele jwakwa mundu jwalekela divai jiyono mu mihuko ja limbendela ja lolo handa bhatendite henela jene divai jiyono jipakupapula jene mihuko ja limbendela ja lolo na divai jipakujitika na jenejo mihuko jipakupapuka. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Nambo divai jiyono jilekelwa mu mihuko jiyono ja mambendela. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Jwaakwa mundu jwapaala kung'we divai jiyono ngapena bhakapalaja divai ja lolo ligongo kulobhola, ‘Jenijela ja lolo nga jammbone muno.’”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu nga Hangwana mu lichobha lya kupomolela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Amatayo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Amaluko 2:23-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Lichobha limo lya Kupomolela, Ayesu bhatendita kupeta mu migonda ga ngano, na bhanapunji bha Ayesu bhakajemekanga kukeleta ngano, bhakabhoanga mbeju kwa mabhoko gabhenji, bhakalyenganga. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Mafalisayo bhangi bhakabhakonyanga, “Kwa niki ntendanga chikubho changapaalikwa Lichobha lya Kupomolela?” <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Ayesu bhakaajangulanga, “Bholi, mwangachoma namuna chibhakatenda Adaudi pamo na akaajabhe pabhakibhanga na njala? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Adaudi bhakajingila mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo na kutola mikate jijakabhekwa ligongo lya kulegwa na akaakung'i, bhakalyee na kwaapekehanga akaajabhe. jangapaalikwa mundu kulyee jene mikate nga akaakung'i jiakabhenji.” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Henela Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga, “Mwana bha Amundu nga bhabhile na mamulaka mu Lichobha lya Kupomolela.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhaalamia amundu jwaapolite lubhoko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Amatayo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Amaluko 3:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Mu Lichobha lyengi lya kupomolela, Ayesu bhakajingila mu Nyuumba ja konganilananga Bhayahudi, bhakajigana bhandu. Monimola nkati pakibha na amundu bhabhapolite lubhoko lwabhe lwa kunnelo. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Bhabhajigana malagilo ga Amusa na Mafalisayo bhakalolea pabhalemwite ili bhakombolange kwahukumula Ayesu na henela bhatendita kulendelanga bhabhone handa bhakaalamia amundu Lichobha lya Kupomolela. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Nambo Ayesu bhakaimanya kuganikia kwabhenji, bhakaalobholela bhenibhala bhabhapolite lubhoko, “Nnyinuke, nnyeme nnongi ja bhandu bhoha.” Bhenibhala amundu bhakajaula na kujema nnongi ja bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakaalobholela, Ndenda kukonyaanga, “Bholi, nga yammbone kutenda chilebhe chibhou au chilebhe chammbone mu lichobha lya kupomolela? Kuguokoa umomi gwa mundu au kugutiniha?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Ayesu bhakabhalola bhandu bhoha upande goha, ngapena bhakaalobholela bheni amundu bhabhapolite bhandu, “Na bhenabho bhakalunyulula lubhoko lwabhe na lubhoko lukabhehe na machili.” <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Nambo Mapalisayo bhakatumbala muno bhakajemeka kukonyana akaachinabhene bhakalobholelana namuna ja kwatendela Ayesu ubhou.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kuhagula akaandundame bha Annoongo komi na hibhele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Amatayo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Amaluko 3:13-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Lichobha limo Ayesu bhakajaula kulitombi kujopa, na bhena bhakacheha konokwe kilo mpaka tuputupu bhabhikwaajopa Annoongo. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Pajikahika kundabhi bhakaakema bhanapunji bhabhe, pakati jabhenji akaahagulanga bhandu komi na bhabhele akabhakema akaandundame. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Asimoni bhabhakemwa lihina Apetulo lihina libhakalipata na Ayesu na Aandulea anung'un bhabhe Asimoni na Ayakobo na Ayohana na Apilipo na Abatolomayo. <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Amatayo na Atoma, Ayakobo mwana jwa Aalufayo na Asimoni bhabhapotanila chilambo chabhe, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Ayuda mwana jwa Ayakobo na Ayuda Aichikaliote bhenibhala bhabhakaakana Ayesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kwaalamia bhandu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Amatayo 4:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Ayesu pabhakatuluka na akaandundame bhabhe kubhoka kulitombi, Ayesu bhakajema pachitwela, Pena pakibha na libhoga likolongwa lya bhanapunji bhabhe na nkutuli gwa bhandu bhabhabhokitinge pande yoha ya Kuyuda na bhabhabhokitinge Kuyeluchalemu na bhabhabhokitinge mu hilambo ya kumbwani ja Kutilo na Kuchidoni. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Bhandu bhenabho bhakahikanga kwaajonikia Ayesu na kulamia hitamwa yabhenji, hiyoyo bhenabho bhandu bhabhakahikanga na mahoka bhakahikanga kulamiwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Bhandu bhoha bhakapalanga kwakwaha Ayesu, kwa kubhehe machili gatendita kwaabhoka na kwalaamianga bhandu.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhangalala na kulaga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Amatayo 5:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Ayesu akaatendebhukilanga bhanapunji bhabhe, na kulobhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">“Nchikonjanga mwangota akaahocho, bhantekutendelwa gammbone na Annoongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">kwa kubhehe ukolo gwa Annoongo nga gwinunji!”<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />“Nchikonjanga mwangota bhammilinge na njala nangocheni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">ligongo baadae bhapakunnyukutianga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Nchikonjanga mwangota bhanng'utanga nangocheni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">kwa kubhehe baadaye mpakuheka kwa kuhangalala!”<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />“Nchikonjanga mwangota ikabhe bhandu bhapakunchimwanga, na kutama kutali na mwangota na kwaatukana na kwalobholelanga malobhe gangalimmbone, kwa ligongo lya lihina lya Amwana bha Amundu! <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Nhangalalange na kukina wakati pagapakupiitila hikobho yene kwa ligongo chawadi jinunji nga ngolongwa kunani kulihunde. Kwa ligongo akaakolo bhabhenji bhakaatendelenga henela akaalondoi bha Annoongo.”<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />“Nambo mpakulaganga mwangota bhammilinge mataajili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:24">ligongo mpokilinge umomi gwammbone.”<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />“Mpakulaganga bhannyukutanga nangocheni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">kwa ligongo mpakubhanganga na njala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Mapakulaganga mwangota bhanhekanga nangocheni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">ligongo baadae mpakugutanga na kuombolechanga.”<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />“Mpakulaganga handa bhandu bhoha bhannumbalilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:26">ligongo akanahota bhabhenji bhakaatendelanga hela hela akaalondoi bha umani.”<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwaapalange akapwaati bhinunji</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Amatayo 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />Ndendakunkongolelanga mwangota bhannyohanikianga, mwapalange akapwati bhinunji, mwatendeelange gammbone bhenibhala bhabhanchimwanga. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Mwaatendelange gammbone bhabhaalani, na mwajopelange kwa Annoongo bhenibhala bhabhantendelanga gangammbone. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Mundu handa bhampotite lijegwa limo mwatendebhukie lijegwa lya bhele, mundu hana bhampokite likoti linu nkoto kwaahibhila na ngobho ja nkati. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Joha jola jwapakunnyopa mupekee, na mundu handa bhampokite chilebhe chinu nkotokulonga bhammujikihe. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Mwandetendelange bhangi hela hela handa chimpalanga bhantendelange.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“Handa mwapalitinge tu bhanibhala bhabhampalanga, bholi, mpakupatanga hiingwa niki? Kwakubhe hata hakaakola mabhou bhaapalanga bhenibhala bhabhaapalanga” <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Kabhele, handa mwatendilinge gammbone bhenibhala jika bhabhantendelanga gammbone, mpakupata chiniki? Hata bhabhakolite mabhou bhatendanga hela hela. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Handa mwakopichinge bhenibhala tu bhang'anikia kubhujianga kila chilebhe, bholi, nnangianga gammbone niki? Hata bhabhakolite mabhou kwakopechanga akaakola mabhou bhanjenji kongo bhabhikuganikia kulepwa maha. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Ila mwangota mwapalange akapwati bhinu na kwatendelanga gammbone. Nkopechange panga lolela kunnepanga, na tucho jinunji jipakubhehe ngolongwa, mwangota mpakubhehe bhana bha Annoongo bhabhabhii. Kwakubhe bhenabho nga bhammbone bhangu bhangalimmbone na bhangali na chukulani na bhabhabhilinge hakabhou. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Nkolange kiha handa atati bhinu Annoongo chibhabhile na kiha.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkotokwaakumulanga bhandu bhangi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Amatayo 7:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Nkotokwaukumulanga bhangi, na mwangota ngahukumulwanga, nkotokwakokolekelanga bhangi, na mwaangota Annoongo ngakokolekwanga, mwalekelele bhangi, namwangota Annoongo bhapakunkekelea. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Mwapangange bhandu bhangi hilebhe na Annoongo bhapakumpekeanga mwangota. Kubhehe, mpakupokelanga mmabhoko ginunji chipemo chichitwelile, chikachinyindilwa na kutwelela hikapukunyikwa mpaka kujitika. Kwakubhe chipemo chelachela chintumianga kwa bhangi nga chochocho chibhapakutumia Annoongo kwaachinu.” <verse eid="LUK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Ayesu akaabholelanga kabhele kulandana kongoni, Bholi, jwangalola bhatendakombola kuntandaa jwangalola nnyakwe, Ngabha! Bhoha bhapakutumbukilanga mulihembo. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Mwanapunji ngampeta bhabhajigana bhabhe, nambo kila mwanapunji handa bhajomwile kuchijigana bhabhee handa bhabhajigana bhabhe. <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Kwa niki nchibhona chipalamande mu liho lya nnung'una jwinu, nambo popopo ngachilola chitela chichibhile mu liho linu? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Au, nkombola bholi kunnobholela nnung'una jwinu, “Nnung'una, nnendeoti, nimmoe chipalamande chichibhile mu liho linu. Kongoni ngabhona chitela chichibhile mu liho linu mwabhene? Mwandendemundu mwenga! Mmohe oti chipalamnde chichibhile mu liho linu, na penapo mpakulola maha kwa kombola kuchibhoa chipalamande chichibhile mu liho lya nnung'una jwinu.”<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkongo gumanyikana kwa mabibo gakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Amatayo 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Gwakwa nkongo gwammbone guguogola mabibo gabou, wala nkongo gwangali mbone ngaogola mabibo gammbone. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Kila nkongo gutendakumanyika na mabhobho kubhokana na mabibo gakwe. Bhandu ngakombolanga kabha mabibo ga makuju kubhoka mu chitekete cha miibha au zabibu mu nkongo ja michoonda. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Mundu jwammbone kubhoka hikubho yammbone kubhoka mu ntima gwabhe, na mundu jwangali mmbone kubhoha gangali mmbone gagabhile mu ntima gwabhe, ligongo amundu kubhoa genigala gagatwelile mu ntima gwabhe.”<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia kwa bhabhachenganga bhabhele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Amatayo 7:24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Kwa niki ndendakungemanga nenga, ‘Hangwana, Hangwana,’ nambo ngatendanga gambaala nenga? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Mbakunnangianga namuna chibhabhile amundu bhabhaika kwaachangu na kujoonikia malobhe gangu na kugatumia? <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Bhenabho bhalandana na amundu bhabhachenga nyuumba, bhabhakehema pahi muno mpaka kugukolela mwaala na kujemeka kuchenga kubhokela penapo. Pajikakoma hula ngolongwa muno machi gakatweelela na kujipota nyuumba jenejo na jangapukunyika, ligongo jikachengwa nnani ja mwaala. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Nambo johajola jwaoanikie malobhe gangu bhakotokutenda choachela, bhena bhalandana na amundu bhabhachengite nyuumba nnani ja nhanga, pangali kuhemba pahi muno. Pajikakoma hula ngolongwa machi gakatwelela kujipota nyuumba jenejo na kubomoka joha.!”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Kuhobhelela kwa akolo bha linyemba lya ku Loma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Amatayo 8:5-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Ayesu pabhakajomola kolongela genago goha nnogni ja bhandu, bhakajaula ku Kapelenaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Konokwe kukibha na akolo bha lilubhalo lya manyemba makomi komi yakubhe bhakibha ntumichi jwabhe jwabhampalite muno. Jonojwe ntumichi hakibha ntamwa kubhandikila na kuwehe. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Bhenibhala akolo bha manyemba makomi komi pabhakajoa ngani ja Ayesu, bhakaatumanga hakanaota bhangi bha bhayaudi bhajaulange kwaajopa bhaike kunnamia ntumichi jwabhe. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Pabhakaika kwa Ayesu, bhakaajopa muno, bhakalobholanga, “Hojo mundu hipaalikwa bhajangatilwe, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Kwa maana bhatenda kwaapala bhandu bhitu, na bhena bhatekuchengela Nyuumba ja konganilanga.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Bahi, Ayesu bhakajaula pamo nabho. Pabhakabhandikila kuhika pa nyuumba ja bhenibhala akolo, bhenibha akolo bha lilubhalo bhakaatumanga akaaganja bhabhe kwalobholela Ayesu, “Hangwana, nkotokuchiabhua muno, maana mwenga mpaalikwahopo nnyingile mu nnyumba jangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Kwakubhe nangachibhona nenga namwene mbaalikwahopo hata kuhika kwaachinu. Nambo nnobhole tu lilobhe, na antumichi bhangu bhapakulama. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Kwakubhehe nenga kabhele nga mundu ndekubhe pahi ja mamulaka, na ndekola manyemba bhabhilinge pahi jangu bhabhajeketelanga chinaakongolelanga. Handa naalobholile bhamo, ‘Nnyabhule!’ nabhena bhatendakujaula, ndenda kwalobholela bhangi, ‘Nhike!’ nabhena bhatenda kuika, hata habhanda bhangu handa naalobholile, ‘Ntende henela!’ nabhena bhapakutenda.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Ayesu pabhakajoha malobhe genago, bhakakangacha, na bhena akalitendebhukila lyenilyela lilubhalo lya bhangu bhabhatendita kunkagula, na bhakaalobholelanga, “Na nangaabhona amundu bhabhabhile na imani ngolongwa handa jenjeni hata mu bhandu bha ku Isilaeli”<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Bhenibhala bhandu bhabhakatumwanga kwa Ayesu pabhabhujanga pakaja pa bhenibhala akolo bhakaakolela bhenibhala antumichi bhalamite.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatendakwaayoa mwana jwa anyoongolo nhwelwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Pabhakajomola genago tu, Ayesu bhakajaula mu chilambo chimo chikemitwa ku Naini, lilubhalo lya bhandu pamo bhakanapunji bhabhe bhakalongana nabho. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Bahi, pabhakabhandikila kuhika pa nnyango nkolongwa gwa chilambo, bhakabhokelanga bhandu bhapeetwilinge malilo ga analome bhamo, mwana jwa jiika jwa bhenibhala haikege nhelwa. Bhandu bhajingi bha chenichela chilambo bhakibhanga pamo na bhenibhala nhelwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Hangwana Ayesu pabhakammona haikege bhenibhala nhelwa bhakaakolee kiha, bhakaalobholela, “Nkotokuguta.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Ngapena, bhakajaula, bhakalikwaa jenijela njeega, na bhenibhala bhabhakalipetula bhakajekanga. Penapo bhakalobhola, “Mwee nkakombo! Ndendakunnobholela, nnyimuke!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Bhenibha nkakombo bhabhakawee bhakajimuka na kutama, bhakajemeka kulongela. Na Ayesu bhakaapeleka kwa anyongolo bhabhe. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Bhandu bhoha bhakahechukanga, bhakabhee bhatenda kwaalumbalila Annoongo bhakalobholanga, “Alondoi akolo bha Annoongo bhatekubhokela pakati jitu. Annoongo bhatekuika kuwakombolanga bhandu bhabhe.” <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Ngani heyo jikajenela mu chilambo cha ku Yudea na mu hilambo hiitindila pa Yudea.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayohana mmbatichaji bhaakatumanga bhanapunji kwa Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Amatayo 11:2-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Bhanapunji bha Ayohana mmatichaji bhakannobholela Ayohana nnani ja ngaani jabhe yohoa. Nabhena Ayohana, bhakaakemanga bhakanapunji bhabhele pakati ja bhenibhala bhakanapunji bhabhe, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />bhakaatumanga kwa Hangwana Ayesu bhaakonye, “Bholi, mweenga nga bhenibhala bhabhahika, au tuwalendelele bhangii?” <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Bhenibhala bhanapunji pabhakahika kwa Ayesu bhakaalobholela, “Ayohana mmatichaji bhatutumite tuhike kwaachinu kunkonya, ‘Bholi mweenga nga bhenibhala bhabhapakuhika au twaalendele bhangi?’” <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Muuda gogogo, Ayesu bhakaalamianga bhandu bhangi bhabhatendita kulaga kwa hitamwa na kubhoanga mahoka na kwaalamianga bhangalola bhakombolange kulola kabhele. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Bahi, Ayesu bhakaajangula bhanapunji bha Ayohana, “Nnyabhulange nkaalobhelele Ayohana genigala gamugabhonite na kugajoha, bhangalola bhatendakulola, hakanangwabha bhatendakujenda, bhabhabhile na mambujupuju bhalamitinge na nkondekwa kwaajopa Annoongo, bhangajoanga bhatendakujoa, bhabhawilinge bhatekwayoanga, na hakahocho bhatendakutangachiwanga Ngani Jammbone. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Bhachikonje bhenibha amundu bhanga bhoga na nenga!” <verse eid="LUK 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Bhenibhala bhandu bhabhakatumwanga Ayohana pabhakabhokanga, Ayesu bhakajemeka kwalilobholela lilubhalo ngani ya Ayohana, bhakilobhola, “Pankajaulanga palulemba nkajaulanga kulolanga chiniki? Bholi, kulola matete gagapukunyikwa na mboongo? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Bahi, nkajaulanga kulola chiniki? nkajaulanga kunnola mundu jwawalite ngobho ya bei ngolongwa? Bhandu bhabhawalanga ngobho ya bei ngolongwa na kubhehe na hilebhe yammbone bhatamanga mu nyuumba ya chipalume, yakubhehe ngatama kumanyai! <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Bahi, nnobholelange, nambo nkajaulanga kulolanga chiniki? Nkajaulanga kwaalola alondoi bha Annoongo? Elo, ndendakunnobholelanga nkajaulanga kwaalola kupunda alondoi <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Habhabha nga yakubhehe ngani yabhe hitekujaandikwa mu Majaandiko ga Annoongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">‘Nnyoonikie mbakwaatuma nyuumbe jwangu bhannongolele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">yakubhe bhapakunhalakia ndela ja kupeta mwenga.’”<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga kabhele bhandu, “Ntendakunnobholelanga, pakati ja bhandu yakubhehe mwikege bhapaapite bhakwa bhabhabhile nkolongwa muno kupunda Ayohana Mmbatichaji. Nambo, jonijola jwaabhile nchoko choko muno mu upalume gwa Annoongo nga nkolongwa kupunda Ayohana.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Bhandu bhoha pamo na hata akaatochanga kodi pabhakajoanga malobhe ga Ayesu, bhakakondaanga kubhehe Annoongo nga bhammbone. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Nambo Mafalisayo na bhabhajigana malagilo ga Amusa bhakakananga genigala yakubhehe Annoongo bhagatendange, bhakakananga kubatichwanga na Ayohana. <verse eid="LUK 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Ayesu bhaheendelea kulobhola, “Bholi, mbakwalandanakia na chiniki bhandu bha chibhelei heche? Bhalandaana na chiniki? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Bhenaangota nga handa bhana bhabhatamite mahali pa kuhuchianga hilebhe na kemana lilubhalo kwa lilubhalo, gwendu bhakabhee bhatekutama pamakonganilo ga bhandu na kulobholelana, libhoga limo na lyengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">‘tumpotilinge lipyombyo, nambo mwangaina!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">twakanyeembelelanga nnyeembo ya kumalilo nambo mwangaguta!’<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Kwa maana Ayohana ambatichaji bhakahika, na bhenabho bhakibha bhatenda kutama pangali kulyehe, na mwangota nkalobholanga, ‘Bhatekupoganikwa na mahoka!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Nabhena amwana bha Amundu bhatekuhika, bhatenda kulyehe na kung'wee, na mwangota nkalobholanga, ‘Mwalole habha mundu bhakulyehe muno na bhakolelwa, aganja bha bhatochanga kodi na bhabhilinge na mabhou!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Nambo luunda lwa Annoongo jitendakulangia yakubhehe nga jammbone kwa bhenibhala bhoha bhabhajikonda.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Haikege bhabhabhile na mabhou bhatenda kwapakaa mahuta Ayesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Lichobha limo Amfalisayo bhamo bhakaalalika Ayesu kujaula kulyee chakulya cha kimuho kwaachakwe. Bhakajiingila nkati mwa jonojwe Mafalisayo bhakataama palikai na kulye chaakulya. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Bahi, mu chilambo chenichela pakibha na haikege bhamo bhabhabhile na mabhou. Pabhakajoa yakubhehe Ayesu bhatendakulyee mu nyuumba na bhenibhala Amafalisayo bhakapetula ntuumba gwa mahuta ga kunuungila muno. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Bhakaika, bhakakotima kuyeto ja makongono ga Ayesu, bhakaguta, na mahoi jabhe gakaagwila Ayesu mumakongono gabhe. Bhenibhala haikege bhakahunguta makongo ga Ayesu kwa majunju gakwe. Kabhele bhakaanamatila na kwasalimia kwa kuhangalala na kwaapakala mahuta ga kunuungila. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Jonijola Mafalisayo bhabhakaalalika Ayesu, pabhakalola genago bhakachilobholela muntima gwabhe, “Handa Amundu habha bhakabhile alondoi bha Annoongo bhakahimanya kubhehe nga aganiki bhatenda kwakwaha, na bhenabho haikege nga bha namuna niki, yakubehe bhena haikege nga bhabhii na mabhou.” <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Ayesu bhakaalobholela jonijola Mafalisayo, “Asimoni, nibhile na chilebhe cha kunnobholela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Asimoni bhakajaangula, “Elo bhabhajigana, nnobholele.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Ayesu bhakajemeka kwa kulobhola, “Bhandu bhabhele bhabhakajahika mbiya kwa amundu bhabhakujahika mbiha, amundu bhamo bhakalongwa dinali mia nhano jitenda kukagulana na malepo gakutenda lihengo kwa machobha mia nhano, na bhangi bhakalongwa dinali makomi nhano jitenda kukagulana na malepo gakutenda lihengo kwa machobha makomi nhano. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Bahi pabhakalepela kulepa magambo genago, jonijola mundu bhakaalekelela bhoha bhabhele. Ngocheni nga aganiki bhapakwaapala muno bhena amundu bhabhaalonga?” <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Asimoni bhakajangula, “Kweli, nga bhenibhala bhabhaalekile ligambo likolongwa nga bhabhapakumpala muno bhenibhala bhabhaalonga” Ayesu bhakaalobholela, “Ntakujaangula maha.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Ngapena bhakatendebhukila bhenibhala haikege na kuwalobholela Asimoni, “Asimoni mummonite hojo haikege, pangajiingila mu nyuumba jinu mwangambekea machi ga kujelejea makongono gangu, nambo habha haikege bhatekunyelenyea makongo gangu kwa mahoi gabhe na kuhunguta kwa majungu gabhe. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Nambo mweenga mwanganjalimia kwa kunamatila, nambo kabhokela pangajiingila mu nyuumba habha haikege bhangaleka kunjalimia kwa kuhangalala. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Mweenga mwangambakala mahuka mmutwe gwangu, nambo bhena haikege bhatekumbakala mmakongono gangu mahuta ga kunuugila. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Kwa henela ndenda kunnobholela, mabhou gabhe gagabhile gajingi gatekulekelelwa, kwa kubhehe bhatekulangia upalyo nkolongwa. Nambo bhenibhala bhabhalekelilwe mabhou kachoko, hupala kachoko.” <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Bahi, Ayesu bhaakalobholela bhenibhala haikege, “Ntekulekelelwa mabhou ginu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Penapo, bhenibhala bhabhatendita kulyee pamo na Ayesu bhatendita konyananga bhabhikulobholanga, “Habha nga aganiki bhabhalekelea mabhou?” <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Na bhena Ayesu bhakaalobholela bhenibhala haikege, “Imani jinu jitekunaamia, nnyabhule kwa amani.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Hakaikege bhabhalongininge na Ayesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Pabhakajomola genago, Ayesu bhakajaula mu hilambo yoha na muhijiji kujaula kutangacha Ngani ja mmbone ja ukolo gwa Annoongo. Na bhenibhala bhanapunji komi na bhabhele bhakalongana nabho. <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />Kabhele hakaikege teno yakubhe Ayesu bhakibha bhatekwabhoha mahoka na kwalamianga hitamwa, bhalongana nabho. Habho nga akaangota Amalia kubhoka ku Magidalene, yakubhehe Ayesu bhakaabhoha mahoka saba, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Na Ayoane hanu bha Kuza, bhakibha halendei akolo bha nyuumba ja Ahelode, Asusana na haikege bhangi bhajingi. Bhenabho haikege bhakibha bhatendita kwaajangatila Ayesu pamo na akanapunji bhabhe kwa hilebhe yabhenji akaachibhenenji.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanikiha kwa amundu bhakumicha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Amatayo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Amaluko 4:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Na bhandu kubhoka mu kila chilambo bhatendita kwaahikila Ayesu, bhenabho bhakajemeka kulongela nabho kwa kulandanikiha. <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Bhakumicha bhakajaula kumicha mbeju. Pabhatendita kumicha yeengi hiikagwila nndela na bhabhatendita kujenda monomwe nndela, bhatendita kuilebhata na hijuni kulyee. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Mbeju yengi hikagwehe pa mwaala, na litepo palikamela lyela likajoma kwa kubhehe cheembwe jikibha jakwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Mbeju Yengi hikagwehe pakati ja mikongo ja miibha, jenijela mikongo ja michonda hikamela pamo na jene mbeju na kuchitabha tabha. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Mbeju yengi hikagwehe mu undopi gwammbone, hikamela na kuogola muno hikaogola hijingi mala makomi komi kupunda yeni yela hihikamichwa.” Ayesu pabhakajomola kulobhola genago, bhakapiha lilobhe, “Amundu bhoha bhala bhabhajoine na bhahimanye!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ligongo lya kujigana kwa kulandanakia</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-23">Amatayo 13:10-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Amaluko 4:10-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Ayesu bhakakonywa na bhanapunji bhabhe maana gwa kulandanikiha hokwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Na Ayesu bhakaajangula, “Mwangota bhatekunpekehanga makakala ga kugamanya ngani hitekuchiiya ya ukolo gwa Annoongo, nambo kwa bhandu bhangi ndenda kulongela nabho kwa kulandanikiha, ligongo pabhapakulola bhakotokombolanga kulola, na pabhajohanikihanga bhakoto kuhimanyanga.”<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kuatambula kulandanikiha kwa bhakumicha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Amatayo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Amaluko 4:13-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Bahi, heje nga maana ja kulandanikiha hoko, mbeju nga lilobhe lya Annoongo. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Yeniyela hihikagwehe nndela hilandana na kulandanikiha lilobhe, na lichetani bhahika na kulibhoa mu mitima yabhenji ligongo bhaleke kuhobhalela na kombolewa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Mbeju yeniyela hihikagwehe mu undopi gugubhile pa mwaala hulandana na bhandu bhabhakajohanga Lilobhe lya Annoongo na kulipokelanga kwa kuhachukanga. Nambo kwa kubhehe Lilobhe lya Annoongo litama hopo mu mitima jabhenji, pabhalengwanga kachoko tu kuhengeleka mitima <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Kwa mbeju yeniyela hihikagwehe mu mikongo ja miibha, hilandana na bhandu bhabhalijoha Lilobhe lya Annoongo, nambo pabhajenda nalyo kuchihabhua na lipamba na bhabhalokolila hilebhei na kuhangalila hilebhe ya kunong'a ya pachilambo. Bhandu habho bhatamanga hopo kwa kukagula majandiko ga Annoongo. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Nambo mbeju hihikagwee mu undopi gwakonda hutenda kulandana na bhandu bhabhajohanikia Lilobhe lya Annoongo, na kulikamula maha kwa ntima gwammbone na kujeketela bhena bhandu bhatenda kuchitimalika na kugakamula majandiko ga Annoongo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lumuli lulubhile kuhi ja chindanda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Amaluko 4:21-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Bhandu ngajaikiha lumuli na kujiwekela kwa chibhega au kujibheka kuhi ja chindanda. Nambo bhajibhekanga pachitumbembe ili bhandu bhabhapakujingila nkati bhapate kulola nhana gwabhe. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Kwa kubhehe chakwa chilebhe chohachela chichitekuchiiya yakubhehe chipakumanyikana, na chohachela chichibhekitwe pakuchiiya chipakumanyikana na kubhekwa palundwanje. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Kwa kubhehe, mmangange maha namuna chimjohanga, kwa kubhehe bhabhabhile na chilebhe bhapakujonjokelwa, nambo bhanga chilebhe, hata cheni chela chibhaganikiha bhabhi nacho, bhapakupokwa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kwaalobholanga anyongo na akaanung'una bhabhe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Amatayo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Amaluko 3:31-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Lichobha limo anyongo mundu na akaanung'una bhabhe Ayesu bhakajaula kwaalola, nambo bhangakombolanga kwabhandikila ligongo lya nkondekano gwa bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Amundu bhano bhakalobholela Ayesu, “Anyongo bhinu na akaanung'una bhinu bhabhi panja, bhapalanga kummona.” <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Nambo Ayesu bhakaajangula, “Anyongo bhangu na anung'una bhangu nga habha bhoha bhabhajohanikianga lilobhe lya Annoongo na kulikamula.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kuchihukumula chimbonga chikotoke</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Amatayo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Amaluko 4:35-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Lichobha limo Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga bhanapunji bhabhe, “Tujoomboke tujabhule mpaka kuntundu ja lilibha.” Ngapena bhakakwelanga mu ntumbwi nkolongwa na kujemeka kujomboka. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Pabhakibhanga mu ulendo na ntumbwi, Ayesu bhakahikilwa na lugono, bhakagoloka, Bahi, Chimbonga chikolongwa chikajemeka kujojela, gakaleta mawimbi, na machi gakajemeka kujingila mu ntumbwi, na bhakibha mu hali ja kujogoha kutibhila. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Bhenibhala bhanapunji bhabhe bhakajendelela Ayesu, bhakajimuha penapo bhabhi kwalobholela, “Hangwana, Hangwana nnnyimuke! Tutenda kujaula kutibhila!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Ayesu bhakajimuka, bhakajikalipila jenijela mboongo ngolongwa na mawimbi, na jenijela mboongo ngolongwa jikakotoka, ku lilibha kukabhehe na amani. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakakonyanga bhanapunji bhabhe, “Imani jinunji jibhi kooji?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Nambo bhanapunji bhakakangachanga na kujogopanga kongo bhabhikulobholelana, “Habha nga aganiki, bhajikalipila hata mboongo na mawimbi na gatenda kwajohakikiha?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kunlamia mundu jwakweti na mahoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Amatayo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Amaluko 5:1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Ngapena Ayesu pamo na bhanapunni bhabhe bhakajomboka lilibha lya ku Galilaya, bhakaikanga kuntundu ja mu chilambo cha Wagelachi, chichibhandikile na ku Galilaya, kuntundu ja lilibha <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Ayesu pabhakatuluka mu ntumbwi nkolongwa na bhakakongana na mundu jumo jwa chenichela chilambo bhabhi bhapoganikwe na mahoka bhakahikila Ayesu. Nabhena amundu lichobha litandamaho bhakibha ngawala ngobho na wala kutama mu nyuumba, ila ku makabuli. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Pabhaakabhona Ayesu bhakachigwiha pahi ja pamakongono ga Ayesu bhakapota nyenye, na bhakalobhola kwa lilobhe likolongwa, “Ayesu mwana jwa Annoongo jwabhile nnani muno mpala kundenda chiniki? Ndenda kunnyopa nkoto kunagia!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Kwa kubhehe Ayesu bhakaakulumikia lyenilyela lihoka lyabhoke bhenibhala amundu. Mala jijingi bhandu bhatendita kwaatabhila jono mundu kwa mandondolo mmakongono na ngamulo mmabhoko na kwaabheka pahi ja kwaalolekea. Nambo bhatendita kujitema gena mandondolo na ngamulo na kupelekwa na jono lihoka kululemba.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Bahi, Ayesu bhakaakonya, “Lihina linu nga aganiki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Bhena amundu bhakajangula, “Twenga nga lilubhalo lya manyemba elupu sita.” Bhakajangula henela ligongo bhakibha na mahoka gajingi. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Genigala mahoka gatendita kwaapembelea Ayesu kwa chibhujila bhujila ili gakotokwaapelekanga mu lihembo litandamaho. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Penapo genigala mahoka gakaapembelea Ayesu gajende gakaajingile genigala magolobhe, na Ayesu gakaajeketela gatende handa chiipalikwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Mahoka hago gakaabhoka bhenibhala amundu, na kwaajingila genigala magolobhe, na libhoga lyoha likapolomondoka pa chiyelelo kwa chindema na kutibhila mu lilibha, na gakawee goha. <verse eid="LUK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Bhenibhala bhabhakibha bhakuliya lyenilyela lilubhalo lya magolobhe pabhakalola gagabhokile, bhakabhutukanga, bhakajaulanga kutangachanga ngani hejo mu hijiji na mu hilambo. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Bhandu bhakabhoka kujaula kuchibhonela chichibhokile. Pabhakahika penapo pabhakibha Ayesu bhakaakolela bhenibhala amundu bhabhokilwe na mahoka bhatamite kubhandikila na Ayesu, bhakibha bhawalite ngobho yabhe kongo bhabhi malango gabhe gatekwaabhujila, bhenibhala bhandu bhakajogopanga muno. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Bhenibhala bhandu bhabhakalola ngani hejo pajikabhokela bhakakongolelananga bhena bhandu namuna bhenibhala mundu bhabhakibha bhapoganikwe na mahoka chibhakannamia mundu jola jwakibha na mahoka. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Ngapena bhandu bhoa bha chilambo cha Wagelachi bhakakamulwa na bhoga nkolongwa. kwa henela bhakaajopa Ayesu bhabhoke, bhajaule. Henela Ayesu bhakakwela kabhele mu ntumbwi nkolongwa, bhakajaula. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Wakati Ayesu pabhatenda kujaula benibhala amundu jwaabhokitwe na genigala mahoka bhakaajopa Ayesu bhajaule pamo nabho. Nambo Ayesu bhakaalobholela, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Mmuje kwachinu nkakongolele goha Annoongo gabhantendile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Bahi, mundu jola bhakajaula kutangacha kila chehemu mu chenichela Chilambo ngani yoha hibhatendwile na Ayesu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amwali jwa Ayailo bhatenda kwaayoa na haikege bhamo bhatendita kulamiwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Amatayo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Amaluko 5:21-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Wakati Ayesu pabhakabhuja kubhoka kuntundu ja bha Gelachi, na kwaapokela kwa kuhangalala na lilubhalo lya bhandu kwa kubhehe bhatenda kwalendela. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Penapo bhakaika amundu bhamo bhakemitwa Ayailo, bhabhakibha akolo bha nyuumba ja konganilanga Bhayahudi, bhakahika bhakachigwia mumakongono ga Ayesu, bhakaajopa bhajaule kwaachabhe, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />kwa kubhehe mwali jwabhe jwa jika, jwabhile na yaaka komi na hibhele, jwakibha bhatenda kulwala kubhandikila Kujomoka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Ayesu pabhakibha bhatenda kujaula, lilubhalo lya bhandu likaaminya muno. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Bahi, kukibha na mwikege jumo pakati ja lyenilela libhoga lya bhandu, yakubhe bhakibha atamwa jwa kubhoka mihai kwa yaka komi na hibhele, kabhele bhakibha bhajomwile hilebhe yabhe kwa akaaganga ili bhapate kulama, nambo jwakwa jwakakombola kunlamiha. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Bhenabho haikege bhakaakagula Ayesu kuyeto, bhakaakwaha palupindo lwa ngobho jabhe. Palapala bhakalama chitamwa chabhe cha kubhokwa na mihai. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Ayesu bhakakonya, “Bholi, nga aganiki bhabhatekwaha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Bhoha bhakalobhola jwaakwa amundu bhabhankwaite. Na bhenabho Apetulo bhakalobhola, “Hangwana, lilubhalo lya bhandu bhajingi litekuntindila na kuminyana!” <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Nambo Ayesu bhakalobhola, “Habhile mundu atekungwaha, niimanyi kwa kubhehe machili gatekumoka.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Jonijo mwikege pakalola yakubhe bhakombola hopo kuchihia, bhakachipia bhabhi kulendemela, bhakachigwia manguku nnoongi ja Ayesu, penapo bhakakongolela nnongi ja bhandu bhoha kwa niki bhakakwaha na namuna chibhakalamiwa gunakamo. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Ayesu bhakaalobholela, “Mwali, kuhobhalela kwinu kutekunnamia. Nnyabhule kwa amani.” <verse eid="LUK 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Ayesu pabhakibha tangu bhaendelea bhalongela, bhakahika amundu kubhoka ku nyuumba ja Ayailo, bhenibhala akolo jwa Nyuumba ja konganila Bhayahudi, kwaalobholela, “Amwali bhinu bhatekujomoka nkotokwaabhua bhabhajigana?” <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Nambo Ayesu pabhakajoha genago bhakaalobholela Ayailo, “Nkotokujogopa, nhobhalele tu, na bhenabho bhapakulama.” <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Ayesu pabhakaika mu nyuumba ja Ayailo bhakaahibhilila bhandu kujingila bhakoto nkati, ila Apetulo, na Ayakobo, na Ayohana, atati na anyongo mundu mwikege jola. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Nambo bhandu bhoha bhatendita kugutanga na kuombolechanga ligongo lya bhenibhala mwali. Nambo Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga, “Nkoto kugutanga, kwa kubhehe mwana jwangawee, atekugoloka tu!” <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Bhenaangota bhakaaheka kwa kwaabhelua, ligongo bhakaimanya yakubhehe bhenibhala mwali bhatekujomoka. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Nambo Ayesu bhakankamula lubhoko bheni bhala amwali na kwaakema, “Mwali, nnyimuke!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Bhenibhala mwali bhakibha bhammomi, na bhakajema. Ngapena Ayesu bhakaakulumikia akaabhelehi bhabhe bhaapekee chakulya. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Akaabhelei bhabhe bhakakangachanga muno, nambo Ayesu bhakaakanikiha bhakoto kwalobholela mundu joha jola genago gagatendikwe.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kwatuma bhenibhala komi na bhabhele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Amatayo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Amaluko 6:7-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Ayesu bhakaakemanga pamo bhenibhala komi na bhabhele, na kwaapekeha machili ga na mamulaka ga kubhoa mahoka goha, na uwecho gwa kwaalamia akaatamwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Ngapena bhakaatumanga bhajaulange kutangachanga ntandaa gwa Annoongo na kwalamianga akaatamwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Bhakaalagiaga bhabhikulobhola, “Nkotokupetulanga choha chela pamjaulanga ulendo, wala nkotokupetula nhimbati, wala nkoba, wala chakulya, wala mbiha, na wala ngobho ja kutingiganya. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Nyuumba joha jela jimpakujingilanga na kupokelwa, mtamange monomwe mpaka pampakubhoka mu chilambo chenecho. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Handa bhandu bhapakunkananga kumpokelanga mu nyuumba yabhenji mmokange mu chilambo chabhenji, nkung'undange lutukunda mumakongono ginu ili kulangiha kubhehe bhenaangota bhatekana kupokela Lilobhe lya Annoongo.” <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Henela, bhenibhala komi na bhabhele bhakajemeka ulendo kujenda kila chijiji mpaka chijiji, bhabhikutangachanga Ngani Jammbone ja Annoongo na kulamiha akaatamwa kila mahali.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahelode bhabhee na lipamba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Amatayo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Amaluko 6:14-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Bahi, Ahelode atabhala jwa ku Galilaya bhakajohanikiha ngani ja goha gagatendikaje, na bhenabho bhakahechuka kwa kubhehe bhandu bhakibha bhakilobholanga, “Bhenibhala Ayohana ambatichaji bhatekuyoka!” <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Nambo bhangi bhakalobholanga Aeliya bhatekwaabhokela, na bhangi bhakalobholanga kubhehe jumo jwa akalondohi bha Annoongo bha lolo bhatekuyoka. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Nambo Ahelode bhakalobhola, “Bhena Ayohana nakaheketa mutwe. Nangocheni nga aganiki chindenda kujohanikiha ngani yabhe?” Bahi bhakapala muno bhaalole.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kwapekeanga chakulya bhandu elupu nhano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Amatayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Amaluko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Ayohana 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Bhenibhala akandundame pabhakabhujanga, na bhakaalobholela Ayesu yoha hibhakatendanga. Ayesu akabhapetulanga, bhakajaulanga akachinabhene kwa kuchiiya ku chilambo chimo chichikemwa Betisaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Nambo lilubhalo lya bhandu pabhakahimanya kubhakajaula Ayesu, bhakaakagula. Bhakaapokelanga na kulobhola nabho nnani ja ukolo gwa Annoongo na kwaalamiha bhenibhala bhoha bhabhakapalanga kulamiwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Lyobha palikajemeka kutipika, bhenibhala akandundame komi bhabhele bhakaajendela Ayesu na kwaalobholela, “Mwataukange bhandu bhajaulange mu hijiji na migomba hihibhandikile, bhakachipatilange chakulya na mahali pakugolokanga, kwa kubhehe pambani patubhile pangali chilebhe.” <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Nambo Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga, “Mwapangange mwangota chakulya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Bhenibhala bhakajangula, “Tubhile na mikate nhano na homba bhabhele tu. Labuda tujabhule tukahemele chakulya cha kwakwelanga bhandu bhoa!” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Kwakubhehe bhakibhanga na akanalome handa 5,000.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Bahi, Ayesu bhakalobholelanga bhenibhala komi na bhabhele, “Mwalobholelange bhandu bhatamange mu mabhoga ga bhandu makomi nhano makomi nhano.” <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Bhenibhala komi na bhabhele bhakatendanga handa chibhalobholilwe. Na bhakaatamianga bhoha. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakatola yeniyela mikate nhano na homba hibhele, bhakalola Kunani kulihunde, bhakaachukulu na kwaalumbalila Annoongo na bhena bhakajimetula ngapena bhakaapekeanga bhanapunji ili bhaapekeange bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Bhandu bhoha bhakalyehe, bhakajukutanga. Na bhenibhala akaandundame bhakakumbanga mbakatika ya hiikahigalila, bhakatweleanga hikapu komi na hibhele.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apetulo bhaalobhola Ayesu kubhehe nga Akilichito bhabhaagulikwe na Annoongo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Amatayo 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Amaluko 8:27-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Lichobha limo, Ayesu bhatendita kujopa pa ntemela, bhakibha pamo na bhanapunji bhabhe. Bhakaakonyanga, “Bholi, bhandu bhalobhola nenga nga aganiki?” <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Bhanapunji bhakaajangula, “Bhangi bhalobhola mwenga nga Ayohana mmbatichaji, na bhangi bhalobhola mwenga nga Aelia, na bhangi bhalobhola mwenga nga jumo jwa alondoi bha Annoongo bha lolo bhabhayokite.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakaakonyanga, “Bholi, mwangota mwalobholanga nenga nga aganiki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Apetulo akajangula, “Mwenga nga Akilichito bhabhaagaulikwe na Annoongo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhalondola nnani ja malilo gabhe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Amatayo 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Amaluko 8:30-9:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Ayesu bhakaakelebhua muno bhakoto kwaalobholela amundu bhoha bhala ngani hejo. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Ayesu bhakalobhola kabhele, “Jitekwaapala Mwana jwa Amundu kulaga muno mu hilebhe hijingi kukanwa na akahokolo, na akaakolo bha akaakung'i na bhabhajigana amuli ga Amusa, na bhenabho lazima bhakomekwe nambo mu lichobha lya tatu baada ja malilo gabhe bhapakuyoka.” <verse eid="LUK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Ngapena bhakalobholelanga bhoha, “Mundu johajola bhabhapala kungagula nenga nga hipalikwa bhachikane bhene, na bhapaalikwa bhabhee amundu bhabhangagula nenga kila lichobha. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Kwa maana mundu jwapala kugukomboha umomi gwabhe bhene, bhapakugahobha, nambo bhoha bhala bhabhapakugujeha umomi gwabhe kwa ligongo lya nenga, amundu habho bhapakugakomboa. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Bholi, bhapakupata chiniki amundu kuchipata chilambo choha na kugutinia umomi gwabhe? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Handa amundu bhoha bhala bhapakumonela honi nenga na majigano gangu, Mwana bha Amundu bhapakummonela honi amundu habho chibhapakuhika mu ng'anyimo gwabhe na ng'anyimo gwa Atati, na ng'anyimo gwa akaatumichi bha kunani kulihunde bhabhabhii bha Annoongo. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Kweli ndenadakunnobholelanga, bhabhilinge bhandu bhangi bhabhajemitinge pambani ngawee mpaka pabhapagubhona ukolo gwa Annoongo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatendebhuka kumiho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Amatayo 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Amaluko 9:2-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Likibha lichobha lya nane baada ja Ayesu kulobhola genago, bhakaapetula Apetulo, na Ayohana, na Ayakobo bhakakwelanga pamo nabho kulitombi kujopa. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Pabhakibha bhatendita kujopa, kubhonekana kwabhe kumiho kukatendebhuka umiho, ngobho yabhe hikibha hihuhu muno na kumelemeta muno. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Popopo bhakabhonanga bhandu bhabhele, Amusa na Aeliya bhabhi kulongela nabho, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />bhakabhonekanga bhabhi na ng'anyimo, bhabhi kulobholanga na Ayesu ngani ja malilo gabhe kubhehe bhapakomekwa konokwe ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Apetulo na akaajabhe bhakibha bhatekugoloka lugono lwa kutopa, nambo pabhakajimuka bhakabhonanga ng'anyimo gwa Ayesu na bheni bhala bhandu bhabhele bhabhakibha bhatekujema pamo na bhenabho. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Bahi, bhenabho bhandu bhabhele pabhakibha bhatendakujaula, Apetulo bhakaalobholela Ayesu, “Hangwana nga yammbone twenga tutame pambani, bahi tuchenge hilendo hitatu, chimo chinu mwenga na chengi ja Amusa, na chengi ja Aelia”. Nambo Apetulo bhakibha ngachimanya chibhalongile. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Apetulo pabhakibha bhalongela malobhe, likahikila lihunde likaawekelanga na bhenaangota bhakajogopanga pabhakajingilanga nkati ja lihunde lyene. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Lilobhe likajohanika kubhoka mu lyela lihunde, likalobhola, “Habha nga mwana jwangu ndekunhagula, munnyohanikiange jonojwe.” <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Baada ja lilobhe helyo kujohanikiha, Ayesu bhakabhonekana bhakibha jika jabhe. Na bhabapunji bhabhe bhakakotokanga bhakotokunnobholela amundu wakati gonogwe.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhaalamiha mwana bhabhi na lihoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Amatayo 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Amaluko 9:14-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Malabhi jakwe baada ja kubhoka kulitombi, lilubhalo likongana lya bhandu likakongana na Ayesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Penapo amundu bhamo mu lyeni lyela lilubhalao bhakapota nyenye bhabhi kulobhola, “Bhakujigana ndenda kunnyopa mwaalole mwanangu kwa ligongo nga mwana jwangu jwa jika! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Ligonog lihoka litenda kwaajingila, bhatendakupota bhapote nyenye, na bhannekela chihundu hindu, na kwaagwia na lipou lyabhoka mkang'wa. Benabho lihoka lyalagia muno na ngaaleka ila mala kachoko. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Ngajopanga bhanapunji bhinu bhammoe bhenabho lihoka, nambo bhangakombola.” <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Ayesu bhakajangula, “Mwe chibhelei chibhou na changahobhalelaa na ndame na mwangota muuda ntandao kiasi niki nga nkombolange kunhobhalela?” Ngapena Ayesu bhakaalobholela bhena amundu, “Munnete mwana jwinu pambani.” <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Hata bhenibhala amwana pabhatendita kuhika, bhenibhala lihoka bhakaagwia pahi na bhakalekela chihindu hindu. Nambo Ayesu bhakalikapila lyenelyo lihoka bhaabhoke mwana, bhakaalamia bhenibhala mwana na kumujia kwa atati mundu. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Bhandu bhoha bhakakangachanga muno kwa ukolo gwa Annoongo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Ayesu bhatenda kulondola kabhele nnani ja malilo gabhe</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Amatayo 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Amaluko 9:30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Bhenibhala bhandu pabhakibha tangu bhakakangachanga nnani ja goha gagatendikwe, na Ayesu bhakalobholelanga bhanapunji bhabhe,<verse eid="LUK 9:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Nnyohanikihange maha ganga gampakunnobholelanga nangocheni, Amwana bha Amundu bhajaula kubhekwa pahi ja mamulaka ja bhandu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Nambo bhenaangota bhangabhahimanyanga maana jakwe niki. Maana ja malobhe genago gakachihiya kwabhenji, henela bhakajogopanga kwaakonya maana ja chilongelo chenecho.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nga aganiki bhabhapakubhehe akolo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Amatayo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Amaluko 9:33-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Kukabhokela kutaukananga akaachinabhene bhenibhala bhanapunji nnani ja aganiki jwaapakubhehe akolo kupunda bhangi bhoha. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Nambo Ayesu bhakagamanya maganikilo hgabhenji, bahi, bhakaapetula amwana chilemba, bhakaabheka kubhandikila na bhenabho, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />ngapena bhakaalobholelanga, “Amundu bhoha bhala jwaapakumpokela habha amwana nchoko kwa lihina lyangu, bhambokelanga nenga, na bhoha bhala bhabhambokela nenga, bhaapokela bhenibhala bhabhandumite. Kwa kubhehe jonijola jwabhile achoko muno kupeta bhoha pakati jinunji nga jwabhile akolo kupeta bhoha.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jwangakanangana na mwangota jono bhabhi upande gwinu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Amaluko 9:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Ayohana bhakalobhola, “Hangwana, tutekummona amundu bhabhi kubhoa mahoka kwa lihina linu na twenga tukaakanikia, kwa kubhehe bhenabho ngabha jumo jwitu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Nambo Ayesu bhakalobhola, “Nkotokwaakanikia, kwa kubhehe bhoabhala bhabhangataukana na mwaangota bhabhii upande gwinu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhandu bha chilambo cha ku Samalia bhakana kwapokela Ayesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Bahi, wakati pagukabhandikila machobha ga Ayesu kupetulikwa kunani Kulihunde, bhenabho bhakapala muno kujaula ku Kuyelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Bahi bhakaatuma bhabhatumwanga kulongolela, na bhenaangota bhakajaulanga na kujingila mu chijiji chimo cha ku Samalia, bhaatendelee kila chilebhe. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Nambo bhandu bha chijiji chela bhakakana kwaapokela Ayesu kwa kubhehe bhakahimanya kwakubhehe bhapala kujaula Kuyelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Bhanapunji bhabhe, angota Ayakobo na Ayohana pabhakabhona genago, bhakalobholanga, “Hangwana, mpala tulagie moto kubhoka Kunani Kulihunde ili gwaatiniange?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Nambo Ayesu bhakaatendebhukila, na kwaakalipilanga. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Ayesu pamo na bhanapunji bhabhe bhakabhoka na kujaula ku chijiji chengi.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Henela chimpalikwa kubhehe bhaakagula bha Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Amatayo 8:19-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Pabhakibhanga nndela bhahi kujaula, mundu jumo bhakalobholela Ayesu, “Mbakunkagula kohakola kumpakujaula.” <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Ayesu bhakaajangula, “Mabweha gatekola mbako, na hijuni ya kunani bhatekola yuho, nambo Mwana jwa Amundu bhangali pakugoloka wala kupomolela”. <verse eid="LUK 9:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Ayesu bhakalobholela amundu bhangi, “Nngagule.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Nambo bhenabho bhakajangula, “Hangwana, nneke hoti nnyaule ngaachike atati bhangu” <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga, “Mwaleke bhabhawilinge bhaachike bhabhawilinge ajabhe, nambo mwenga nnyaule nkatangache ukolo gwa Annoongo.” <verse eid="LUK 9:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Na mundu jongi bhakaalobholela, Hangwana, “Nakunkagula nambo ndenda kunnyopa oti ngaatabhuke bha kwaachangu”. <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Ayesu bhakaalobholela, “Amundu joha jola bhabhajemeka kulema na kongo bhabhii kulola kuyeto, bhena amundu ngapaalikwa mu ukolo gwa Annoongo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhaaatumanga makomi saba na bhabhele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Bahi, pabhakajomola kutenda genago, Hangwana bhakaagula bhanapunji bhangi makomi saba na bhabhele, bhakaatumanga bhalongolele bhanapunji bhabhele bhabhele mu kila chijiji na kila mahali pabhakapala kujaula. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Bhakaalobholela, “Mahuno nga gajingi, nambo bhabhaunanga nga kachoko, bali mwajopange Hangwna bha mahuno, bhaatume bhabhapangana mahengo mu nng'onda gwabhe. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Nangocheni nnyabhulange, muhimanyange yakubhehe ndenda kuntumanga handa ngondolo bhabhajaulanga pakati ja mamehi. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Nkotokutolanga nhuko gwa mbiya, wala nkoba, wala hilatu, wala kwaalamukila amundu bhoha hala nndela. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Handa mpakujingila mu nyuumba joha jela nnobholange oti, ‘Kuchitimalika kubhehe mu nyuumba heje!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />na handa bhabhile amundu bhabhapala kuchitimalika, bahi kuchitimalika kwinunji kupakubhehe na bhenabho, handa ngabha henela jipakummujianga. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Bahi, ntamange mu nyuumba jenajo, kongo mtendanga kulyehe na mmi kung'wenganga chelichela chibhapakumpekeanga, kwa kubhehe bhabhatenda lihengo hipalikwa kupokela malepo. Nkoto kubhoka mu nyuumba jenejo kujaula ku nyuumba jengi. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Bahi pampakujingilanga mu chilambo choha chela nnlyengange na kung'wee hibhapakumpekeanga, <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Mwalamiange akaatamwa bhabhabhilinge konokwe, mwaalobholelange bhandu, ‘Ukolo gwa Annoongo gubhandikile kwaachinu.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Nambo pampakujingila mu chilambo choha chela, na handa bhanganpokelanga, mmokange, nkung'undange lutukunda mmokange monomwe na mwangaota pampakupeta mu ndela yabhenji nnobholange, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Hata lutukunda lwa chilambo chinunji gagatekunnamatilanga mu makongono gitunji tupakugakung'unda. Nambo muhimanyange yakubhehe ukolo gwa Annoongo gubhandikile.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Ndenda kunnobholelanga kubhebhe, Mu lichobha lyela kuhukumula, bhandu bha chilambo chenecho pabhakubhehe na hibhini muno kupunda hibhini ya bhandu bha ku Sodoma na ku Gomola.”<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hipakulaganga hilambo yangaleka mabhou</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Amatayo 11:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Mpakulaganga mwaangota bhandu bha ku Kolazini! na mpakulaganga mwangota bhanntamanga ku Betisaida! Ligongo hilolelo heyo hiikatendeka kwaachinu konikola mu chilambo cha ku Tilo na ku Sidoni, bhandu bha konokwe bhakawalanga ngobho ya magunia kulangia kokoleka kwabhenji kubhehe bhatenditinge mabhou. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Nambo lichobha lya kuhukumula lipakubhehe lya kupepeka mu hilambo ya ku Tilo na ku Sidoni kuchitimalikanga mu hibhini yabhenji kupeta mwangota. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Na mwangota bhangu bha Kapelunaumu, bholi! mpakuchikweanga mpaka kunani kulihunde? Ngabha hopo bhapakuntuluhanga mpaka kwa bhabhawilinge.” <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Ayesu bhakaendelea kwaalobholela bhanapunji bhabhe, “Bhabhapakunnyoanikianga mwangota, bhannyonikia na nenga, na bhabhakana kumpokelanga mwangota, bhakana kumbokela na nenga. Na bhoabhala bhabhakana kumbokela nenga, bhakana kwaapokela bhanibhala bhabhandumite.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhuja kwa bhenibhala makomi saba na bhabhele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Bhenibhala makomi saba na bhabhele bhakabhujanga bhabhi kuhangalala bhakalobhola, bhakalongolanga, “Hangana hata mahoka gakaabhoka bhandu pebipala patukakaalipilanga kwa lina linu.” <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga, “Nkaabhona lichetani namuna chibhatendita kugwee kubhoka kunani kulihunde handa lumuli lwa njahi. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Nnole nimpekiinge uwecho gwa kulebhata majoka na likalambwi, na uwecho nnani ja machili goha ga bhenibha apwati, chakwa choachela chichipakunhulaa. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Hata henela, nkoto kuhachukanga ligongo lihoka litennyeketela, bali nnyangalange ligongo mahina ginunji gatekujaandikwa kunani kuliunde.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhangalala kwa Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Amatayo 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Wakati gogo Ayesu bhakibha bhatwelile na Mboomo ja Annoongo bhakahangalala bhakalobhola, “Ndenda kunchukula mwe Atati, Hangwana bha kunani kulihunde na pachilambo, maana ntekwahianga hakola malango na bhabhakweti lunda hikubho heyeye, ntekwaunukulilanga yana hilemba. Eloo, atati, gonogwe nga gukibha upalio gwinu.” <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Ngapena bhakalobhola, “Atati bhangu bhatekukombolea kupangala hilebhe yoha. Jwaakwa jwaamanya mwana ila nga atati, wala jwaamanya atati ila mwana, na bhoha bhala yakubhehe amwana bhapala kwahunukulila.” <verse eid="LUK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Bahi Ayesu bhakatendebhukia bhanapunji bhabhe na kulongela nabho kwa kuchihiya bhabhi kulobhola, “Ntekutendelwa gammbone na Annoongo amundu yakubhehe bhagalola bhabhagalola! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Nannobholelanga, akalondohi bhajingi bha Annoongo bhakapala kugalola chimmona na bhapala kugajoha genigala nambo bhangakombola kugalola.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanikiha kwa amundu bha ku Samalia bhabhi na upalyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Wakati pagukahika bhakajema bhabhajigana bhamo bha amuli ja Amusa bhakaakonya Ayesu kwa kwaalenga, “Bhakujigana, ndendeniki ili mbate umomi gwa machobha goha?” <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Ayesu bhakaakonya, “Muhimanya niki pamchoma mu amuli ja Amusa?” <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Bhenibhala bhabhajigana amuli ja Amusa, bhakalobhola, “Mwapale Hangwana Annoongo bhinu kwa ntima gwinu goha, na kwa machili ginu, na kwa malango ginu goha na kwa umomi gwinu goha. Na mwapale andami ajinu handa chimchipala mwabhene.” <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Ayesu bhakaalobholela, “Ntekujangula maha. Na ntende henela na mwenga mpakutama.” <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Nambo bhenabho bhabhajigana amuli ja Amusa bhakapala kuchilangia kubhehe amundu bha umanyo, bhakaakonya Ayesu, “Bhenabho andami ajangu nga aganiki?” <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Ayesu bhakaajangula, “Mundu jumo bhakibha bhatenda kutuluka kubhoka Kuyeluchalemu kujenda Kuyeliko. Pabhakibha nndela bhakaabhona amundu bhakupoka hilebhe, bhakaahula ngobho, bhakaapota, bhakajaula na kwaaleka bhabhi kubhandikila na Kujomoka. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Kwa kubhehe, akung'i bha Annoongo bhamo bhakibha bhatenda kupeta ndela jela jela, bhakammona, bhatenda kupeta nnyenje. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Hela hela bhajangatila akung'i bha Annoongo bhamo na bhena pabhakahika mahali penipala bhakaamona na bhenabho bhakapeta upande gongi, bhakaaleka penapo pandela. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Nambo amundu bhamo bha chilambo cha ku Samalia bhabhatendita kujaula ulendo, bhakahika chehemu jela pabhakibha mundu jola bhakakolela kiha. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Bhakahika chehemu jela bhakankolela bhakaajelela hilonda yabhe na kwaapakala mahuta na divai, Ngapena bhakaakweha mu liponda lyabhe bhakanneta mpaka ku nyuumba ja akaageni ili kwaalolekeha. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Malabhi jakwe kundabhi, bhakapetula hipande hibhele maganga ga ulohi nkolongwa na bhakaapekeha bhenibhala akola nyuumba ja akaageni na kulobhola, ‘Mwalolekee amundu habha na chohachela chichipakupunda mbakunnepa, ili atamwa bhalame.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakaakonya, “Pakati ja habha bhandu bhatatu, nga aganiki bhakalangia kubhehe nga ajabhe jonijola jwabhampotite na matimbanyundo?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Bhenibha bhabhajigana amuli ja Amusa bhakajangula, “Bhenibhala bhabhakolile kiha nga andami ajabhe.” Ngapena Ayesu bhakaalobholela, “Nnyaule nkatende helahela,”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhaatyangila Amalata na Amalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Ayesu pamo na bhanapunji bhakwe pabhakibhanga mu ulendo, bhakahikanga pachijiji chimo chichikibha na mwikege jumo jwaakemitwa Amalita, bhakaapokela panyuumba jabhe.<verse eid="LUK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Amalita bhakibha na adada bhabhe bhaakemitwa Amalia, habhobho bhakatama kubhandikila makongono ga Ayesu bhabhi kujohanikia majigano gabhe.<verse eid="LUK 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Nambo Amalita bhatendita kuchiabhua na hilebhe hijingi, Henela Amalita bhakajaula pabhakibha Ayesu, bhakaalobholela, “Hangwana, ngalola yakuhehe anung'una bhangu ndende lihengo lyangu jika jangu? Mwakongolele bahi, bhanyangatile.” <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Nambo Hangwana bhakalobholela, “Amalita, Amalita, ntenda kuchiabhua na hikubho hijingi, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Nambo chilebhe chimo tu chichipalikwa, Amalia bhatekuhagula chenichela chichibhii chammbone muno jwakwa mundu jwapa kumpoka.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhajigana bhanapunji bhabhe kujopa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Amatayo 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Lichobha limo Ayesu bhakibha chehemu jimo bhakijopa. Pabhakajomola kujopa, bhamo bha bhanapunji bhabhe bhakaalobholela, “Hangwana, tutenda kunnyopa ntujigane kujopa handa Ayohana ambatichaji chibhakajigananga bhanapunji bhabhe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga, “Pannyopanga, nnobholange henela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Atati bhitu mummile Kunani Kulihunde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">lina linu litopewe kubhehe chwaapi muno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">kuhangalala na amani mu Mboomo jinu jihike.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Ntupekee chakulya chitu cha machobha goha.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Ntubhokee gatulemwite gitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">handa tweenga twaabhokeanga bhabhatulemwite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">kabhele nkoto kutupelekanga mu malengelo,’”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Ngapena bhakalobholelanga, “Nga aganiki nkati jinu bhabhile na aganja bhabhe bhakaajabhulila nkati ja kilo na kwaalobholela, ‘Tulobhole jumo jwinu jwabhi na aganja, na bhakaajendelela pakati ja kilo na kwaalobholela, aganja nnyahike mikate jitatu na nenga mbakummujikiha. <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Kwa kubhehe aganja bhangu bhatekuhika kubhoka mu ulendo, nanenga nanga chilebhe chakwaapekeha.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Ngapena bhenibhala bha nkati bhajaangula na kulobhola, ‘Nambo hata bhapakujimukahopo kwaapekeha nkate, nambo kwa kubhehe namuna chibhakapunda kwaapembelea bhapakujimuka na kunpekeha chohachela chibhachipala. <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Kweli nannobholelanga, bhapakombola hopo kujimuka na kwaapekeha jenijela mikate jitatu kwa kubhehe aganja bhabhe, nambo kwa kubhehe bhena amundu bhakapunda kwaabhua bhapakujimuka na kwaapekeha chibhachipala.’”<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Bahi na nenga nannobholelanga, nnyopange mwaangota mpakupatanga, nnolehange na mwangota mpakulolanga, nhodikange na mwangota bhapakunyogolela,. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Kwa kubhehe bhoha bhala bhabhajopa bhapata, bhabhalolea bhalola, bhabhaodichanga, nnyango bhajogolelwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />“Bholi nga atati niki nkati jinu, handa mwana jwabhe bhaajopite homba, bhapakwaapekea lijoka badala ja homba? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Na handa mwana bhaajopite litaji bhapakwaapekeha likalambwi.? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Handa mwangota mmilinge akaabhou, mmanyanga kwaapekea bhana bhinu hilebhe yammbone, kweli Atati bhinu bha Kunani Kulihunde bhapakupunda kuntendelanga, bhapakwaapea Mboomo Ja Annoongo bhoha bhabhaajopanga.”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu na Abelizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Amatayo 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Amaluko 3:20-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Lichobha limo Ayesu pabhakibha bhatenda kulibhenga lihoka lilikaatenda amundu kubhehe ngalongela, bahi lyenilyela lihoka palikaamoka kwa bhena amundu bhabhakibha ngalongela, na lilubhalo lya bhandu likakangachanga. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Nambo bhangi bhakalobhoka, “bhangabhoa mahoka gabhou kwa machili ga Abelizebuli akolongwa bha mahoka.” <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Bhandu bhangi, bhakaalenga Ayesu, kwa kupala bhalangie milolelo kubhoka Kunani Kulihunde. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Nambo kwa kubhehe bhena Ayesu bhakagamanya maganikilo gabhenji, bhakaalobholelanga, “Bhandu bha ukolo gohagola handa bhapwatilininge achinabhene kwa achibhene, ukolo hogwe gupakugwee na bhandu bha nyuumba johajela handa bhapwatilana na bhandu bha nyuumba jengi, bhandu bha nyuumba hejo bhapakupwilinganika. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Handa ukolo gwa lichetani gutenda kutaukana gwenw kwa gwene, ukolo gwabhe gupakujema bholi? nongela henela ligongo ndenda kubhoha mahoka kwa machili ga Abeelizebuli.? <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Bhanapunji bhinu bhagabhoa mahoka handa chindenda kumoa nenga, ibhehe bhoili nenga ntenda kunobholelanga nagabhoa maahoka kwa machili ga Abeelizebuli, bahi bhanabho nga bhabhapanhukumula mwangota. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Nambo handa ndenda kugabhoa mahoka kwa machili ga Annoongo muhimanyange yakubhehe ukolo gwa Annoongo gutekubhandikila.”<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“Mundu jwabhile na machili bhabhabhile ya kupotanila yoha pabhalendelela nyuumba jabhe, hilebhe yabhe yoha ngakomboleka kupelikwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Nambo, handa bhaikite mundu bhabhii na machili kupeta bhenabho, bhakaapota na kwaachinda bhena bhapakwaapokonyola chilaha yabhe hibhaitegemea na kubhagana hilebhe yabhe.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Amundu bhoha bhala jwangabhehe pamo na nenga, bhena bhatekubhehe kuyeto na nenga, na bhoha bhala bhangakumba pamo na nenga bhatenda kumalagana.”<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhuja kwa mahoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Amatayo 12:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Lihoka palyaabhoka amundu, bhatendakutindila kulikonja mahali panga machi bhabhikulola mahali pa kupomolela. Nambo handa bhalepile kupata mahali kuchilobholela bhene mbakubhuja mu nyuumba jangu konikola kummokite. <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Pabhahika, na kujikolela nyuumba jitekupyagilwa na jibhekitwe maha. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Bahi, bhenibhala lihoka likajaula na kwatolanga mahoka gangi chaba gabhou kupunda bhenibhala, goha mahoka bhajingila mu mmele gwa bhena amundu.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngani jammbone kubhoka kwa Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Ayesu pabhakalobhola genago, jumo jwa akahikege bhabhabhilinge mu lyelilyela lilubhalao bhakajomboa lilobhe na bhakalobhola, “Bhatekutendelwa gammbone ahikege bhammelike na kunnjongeha,”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Ayesu bhakajangula, “Nambo bhatekundelwa gammbone bheni bhala bhabhajohanikiha lilobhe lya Annoongo na kulijeketela”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chibhelei chichipala hilolelo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Amatayo 12:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Nkutuli gwa bhandu pagukapunda kujonjokeka, Ayesu bhakalobhola, “Chenjeni nga chibhelehi chibhou. Chipala hilolelo ila jenijela ja Ayona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Handa henela Ayona chibhakibha chilolelo kwa bhandu bha ku Ninawi, nga chipakubhehe kwa mwana jwa mundu kwa chibhelehi cha nangocheni. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Lichobha lya kuhukumula, alongoli akolo haikege bha ku Sheba bhapakubhokela pamo na bhandu bha chibhelei heche na bhena bhapakulobhola ubhelei gongio gulemwite. Kwa kubhehe bhakabhokela kutali na bhakahika kujohanikia malobhe gammbone ga akolo Aselemani, nambo pambani bhabhii akolongwa kupunda Aselemani. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Lichobha lyela lya kuhukumula, bhandu bha ku Ninawi bhapakujema pamo na bhandu hubhelei, bhenaangota bhapakulobholanga ubhelei hogo gulemwite. Kwa kubhehe bhandu bha ku Ninani bhakalekanga mabhou. Kwakubhehe bhakalekanga gabhou Ayona bhakaatangachianga, nambo pambani bhabhile akolongwa kupunda Ayona.”<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lumuli lwa mmele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Amatayo 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Jwakwa mundu jwaajakia lumuli na kuluwekela pachibhega, bali kulubheke nnani ja chinala, ili bhandu bhabhajingila nkati ja nyuumba bhakombolange kulola. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Liho linu nga lumuli lwa mmele gwinu, handa miho ginu nga gamomi, bahi mmele gwinu goha gupakumilikilwa. Nambo handa miho ginu ngalola, bahi mmele gwinu goha gupakubhehe mu lubhendu. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Mme miho bahi, nhana gugubhile nkati jinu gukoto kubhehe lubhendu. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Bahi, handa mmele gwinu goha handa gubhile na nhana, pangali chiungo chohachela kubhehe mu lubhendu, mmele gonogwe gupakung'anyima maha handa lumuli palummulikila.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatendakwaakalipila Mafalisayo na bhabhajigana malagilo ga Amusa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Amatayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Amaluko 12:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Ayesu pabhakajomola kulobhola genago, Amfalisayo bhamo bhakaalalika ku nyuumba jabhe kwa chakulya. Nabhena Ayesu bhakajingila na kutama kulyehe. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Bhenibhala Mpalisayo bhakakangacha pabhakolola Ayesu bhakalyehe chakulya pangali kuha mabhoko. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Nambo Hangwana bhakaalobholela, “Mwangota Mafalisayo, ntenda kujelejeha chikombe na yaani kwa panja, nambo kwa nkati ntwelilinge kulyee muno na ubohu. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Mwangota mwapumbapu! Bholi, bhabhatekunhalakia panja ngati nga bhobhobho bhabhatekunhalakia nkati? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Nambo yoha hiiminayo mwaapangange akaahocho kwa ntima guhuhu na mwangota mpakondekwa handa chiiyobholilike mu kwaachalila Annoongo.”<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“Nambo mpakulaganga Mafalisayo, ligongo ngapala kwaatendelenga bhangi maha na kwaapala Annoongoi. Bali mwaabhokea Annoongo lilubhalo limo mu malubhalo komi ya hilebhe hichokochoko handa mbooga ya mahamba na hiikolonikia chaakulya chinong'e. Hipaalikwa kwaatendelanga bhangi maha na kwaapala Annoongo pamo na kubhoka lilubhalo limo mu malubhalo komi.” <verse eid="LUK 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Mpakulaganga mwangota Mafalisayo, ligongo mwangota mpalanga kutamanga mu hitengu ya nnongi ya akaakolongwa mu nyuumba ya konganilana Bhayahudi na kuchalimiwa kwa kuntopeanga palundwanje. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Mpakulaganga, lingongo mwangota mmilinge handa makabuli gangabhekelwa alama, na bhandu bhapetanga nnani jabhenji pangali kuimanya.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Jumo jwa bhabhajigana malagilo ga Amusa bhakajangula, “Bhannyigana, pannongela hikubho heye, ntendakututukana na twenga kabhele.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Ayesu bhajangula, “Mpakulaganga mwangota bhannyigana malagilo ga Amusa, ligongo mwatwekanga bhandu mihigo jakutopa yangapetulikwa, kongo mwangota akaachinabhene ngakwaa hata lukonji kwajangatilanga. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Mpakulaganga, kwakubhehe mwaachengelanga makabuli akaalondoi bha Annoongo bhabhawilinge na akaatati bhinunji. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Kwakubhehe nnangianga mmilinge pamo na akaabhelehi bhinu chibhatenditinge akanahota bhinu ligongo bhenaangota bhakaakomanga akaalondoi bha Annoongo yakubhehe makabuli gabhenji ntekwaachengelanga, ntendakukweanga malilo gabhenji na ngakagulanga genigala gabhatekutangachanga.” <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Na kwa ligongo lyenelyo, Annoongo mu malango gakwe bhakalobhola, “Nnole, mbakutuma kwabhenji akaaalondohi bha Annoongo na akaandundame, bhanaangota bhapakwaakomanga pakati jabhenji na bhangi bhapakwaalagianga.” <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Ngocheni, bhandu bha chibhelei chenjeni mpakuhukumulwanga kwa ligongo miyahi ya akaalondoi bhoha bha Annoongo jijikajitika kubhokela kujemeka kwa chilambo, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />kubhokela komekwa kwa Babeli mpaka Azakalia bhabhakakomekwa pa litatali lya kubhokea mbeeko kwa Annoongo mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo. Eloo, ndendakunnobholelanga, kweli chibhelei chenjeni chipakupotekwa kwa hikubho yabhenji. <verse eid="LUK 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Mpakulaganga mwangota bhannyigana malagilo ga Amusa, ligongo ntekwaabhilanga bhandu kwaamanya Annoongo. Mwangota mwabhene mwangaamanya Annoongo na bhenibhala bhabhakapala kwaamanya ntekwaahibhilanga.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Ayesu pabhakabhoka konokwe, bhabhajigana malagilo ga Amusa na Mafalisayo bhakajemekanga kwaatauka kwa machili muno na kwaanjimwa kwa makonyekelo gakulimba, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />ili bhapalitange kwaakamula kwa malobhe gakwe.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakwakalipila akaandendemundu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Amatayo 10:26-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Wakati hogwe, nkutuli nkolongwa gwa bhandu bhajingi bhakakongana pamo, mpaka bhatendita kulebhatana, Ayesu akajemeka kwaalobholelanga oti bhakanapunji bhabhe, “Nchilolekeange na nkotokwaajiganga Mafalisayo, yakubhehe nga undendemundu. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Chakwa chohachela chichiwekilwe, chipakunukulilwa, na chichitekuchiiya, chipakubhonekana. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Kwa henela, chohachela chintekulongelanga mu lubhendu chipakujoanika muhi. Na chinnongilinge kwa kuhiiya mu yuumba hiitabhwitwe, chipakutangachwa nnani ja litatali lya nyuumba.”<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhabhapalikwa kujogopwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Amatayo 10:28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Ndendakunnobholelanga mwangota hakaaganja bhangu, nkotokujogopanga bhenibhala bhabhakoma mmele, yakubhehe baada ja penapo bhakotokombolanga kutenda chohachela. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Nambo mbakunnangia bhenibhala bhampalikwa kwajogopa, Mwajogope bhenibhala yakubhehe baada ja koma mmele bhakombola kwaajeanga mu mooto gwangaimika machobha goha! Eloo, ndendakunnobholelanga kweli bhenabho munnyogopange.<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Bholi itendakumanyikana kubhehe ngunda nhano bhatendakuuchikwa kwa mbiya kachoko? Nambo Annoongo ngalibhalila chijuni hata chimo. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Eloo, Nkotokujogopanga, mwangota nga bhammbone kupunda yene ngunda, hata idadi ja majungu ga mmutwe gatekubhalanganikwa.”<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwaatangacha na kwaakana Akilichito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Amatayo 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Ndendakunnobholelanga kubhehe, johajola jwaatangacha nnongi ja bhandu kubhehe bhabhii pamo na nenga, helahela Mwana jwa Amundu nabhena bhapakuntangacha kubhehe bhabhii pamo na bhena nnongi ja akaatumichi bha kunani kulihunde bha Hangwana. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Nambo amundu bhoabhala bhabhangana nenga nnongi ja bhandu, nabhena Amwana bha Amundu bhapakunkana nnongi ja akaatumichi bha kunani kulihunde bha Annoongo.”<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />“Amundu bhoabhala bhabhalongela lilobhe lyakuntauka Amwana bha Amundu pabhakulekelelwa nambo bhabhapakwatukana Mboomo ja Annoongo ngalekelelwa machobha goha.”<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />“Pabhapakumpelekanga mwangota mu Nyuumba ja konganilanga Bhayahudi nnoongi ja akaakolo na bhatawala mamulaka, nkotokuchikonya konya nga namuna niki chimpakujangulanga. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Kwa maana Mboomo Annoongo apakunnyigananga cha kulongelanga gono wakati hogwe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulandana na akolo hilebhe apumbapu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Mundu jumo mu nkutuli gwa bhandu bhakaalobholela Ayesu, “Bhannyigana, mwakongolele anung'una bhangu tumetulane hilebhe hibhatulekile atati bhitu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Ayesu bhakajaangula, “Mwaganja, nga ganiki jwaamekite nenga kubhehe ajamelei bha kubhagana kwinunji hilebhe ya atati bhinu?”<verse eid="LUK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Ngapena Ayesu akaalobholelanga bhandu bhoha, “Ntamange kutali na kupala kwa hilebhe hijingi, kwa ligongo umomi gwa amundu ngabhona mu hilebhe hijingi hibhabhinayo.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakaalobholela, kulandanakia hokoko, “Pakibha na amundu bhabhabhile na hilebhe na ng'omba gugukaogola muno. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Bhabhabhi na hilebhe hijingi bhakajemeka kuganikiha muntima, ‘Nanga ngokwe jakubheka mahuno gangu.’” <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />“Ngapena jono tajili akalobhola, ‘Mbakutenda henela, Mbakubhomolana ngokwe yangu na kuchenga jengi ngokwe ngolongwa. Monomwe nga mahuno gangu na hilebhe yangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Ngapena nanenga mbakuchilobholela namwene, ‘Nenga ndekola hilebhe hijingi ndekuchibheekela kwa yaaka hijingi. Ngocheni, mpomolele, nlyee, na ng'wee na nhangalale.’” <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />“Nambo Annoongo bhakalobholela, ‘Mwapumbapu mwenga! Kilo cheni umomi gwinu gutendakupalikwa. Nangocheni yeneyo hiintekubhekela hipakubhehe ya aganiki?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Ayesu bhakajomolekea kulongela, “Henela nga chihibhile kwa bhenibhala bhabhachibhekela hilebhe, bhangali chilebhe chammbone nnongi ja Annoongo.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwaahobhalela Annoongo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Amatayo 6:25-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakaalobholela bhanapunji bhabhe, “Kwa hiyo ndendakunnobholelanga, nkotokuchiabhuanga nnani ja umomi gwinunji, kubhehe mpakulyanganga niki, au nnani ja mimele jinunji kubhehe mpakuwalanga chiniki. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Ligongo umomi nga gwammbone kupunda chaakulya na mmele gwammbone kupunda ngobho. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Mwaaganikiange makongolo, genago ngapandanga wala ngauna, bhangali ngokwe wala pakubhekela chakulya, nambo Annoongo bhatendakuilia. Mwangota nga mwammbone muno kupunda hijuni! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Nga ganiki pakati jinunji yakubhehe bhabhachihabhua muno bhabhakombola kuchijonjokea kachoko umomi gwabhe hata kwa lichaa limo? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Bahi, handa ngakombolanga kutenda chikubho chichokochoko handa chenecho, ligongo lya niki ntendakuchiabhua na kutenda genago gangi? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Nng'anikiange malobha chigakola. Ngatenda mahengo wala kuchitota, nambo ndendakunnbholelanga kubhehe hata akolo Aselemani yakubhehe akawala ngobho yakuhalala muno nambo bhangajibhajila handa limo lya gena malobha. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Bahi ikibha Annoongo bhagaweka henela mahamba ga gakumigonda yakubhehe leleni gabhile malabhi na kugwehe na kugajocha kumooto, bholi apakwawekelanga mwangota bhantenda kuhobhalela kachoko?”<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />“Wala nkotokuchiabhuanga mpakulye niki au mpakung'we niki. Nkotokubhehe na lipamba nnani ja gangani. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Ligongo genago goha gantendakuchilagianga bhandu bhangaamanya Annoongo. Nambo Atati bhinu bha kunani kulihunde bhaimanyi mpalanga genago. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Nambo nnoleange oti ukolo gwa Annoongo na hilebhe heye yoha mpakupekewanga.”<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuchibhekela hilebhe hijingi kunani kulihunde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Amatayo 6:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Nkotokujogopa mwe mwa lilubhalo lichokochoko, ligongo Atati bhinu bhalolite yammbone kumpekeanga mwangota ukolo gwabhe. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Nhuchange hilebhe hinunji mkapekeange hakaocho mbiha heyo. Nchitendelange mihuko ya mbiya ngauumala, na nkachibhekelange hilebhe yangapongoka kuanni kulihunde, mahali yakubhehe hakabwihi ngajibha wala yakubhehe hikoko ngaalibhianga. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Kwakubhehe penipala pahibhile hilebhe yinu, ngapena na ntima gwinu pagupakubhehe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhehe bhakuchilolekea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />“Nchiandaange kutenda mahengo, na himuli hijunji hibhikujaka, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />handa akaatumichi yakubhebhe bhabhuje kubhoka ku ulombela, ili chibhapakuika na kong'onda nnlyango bhakombolange kwaajogolela guna kamo. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Akaatumichi bhenibhala bhapakuhachukanga Hangwana bhabhenji pabhapakwakolela bhatendakwaalendela. Nannobholelanga kweli, bhapakuwala ngobho ya kitutumichi na bhapakwaalobholela ntamange pahi na nenga mbakunhudumianga. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Akaatumichi bhenibhala bhapakuhachukanga Hangwana bhabhenji pabhapakwakolelanga bhabhilinge maha kwa kwaapokela hata handa bhapakuhika kilo muno, au kubhandikila na kuchehe. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Nambo muhimanyange ngani heje yakubhehe, handa hakola nyumba bhakaimanya muda niki abwihi bhatenda kuhika, bhangecheha, wala bhakalekite hopo nyumba jabhe kubhomolekwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Na Mwangota mwenga hipalikwa kubhehe tayali muda goha, kwa maana Amwana jwa Amundu bhapakuhika muda mwangahobhalela.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Antumichi jwakuaminika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Amatayo 24:45-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Ngapena Apetulo bhakakonya, “Hangwana, kulandanikiha hoko kutukongolela twenga jika jitu au bhandu bhoha?” <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Hangwana bhakaajangula, “Nga jwaa bahi antumichi jwakuaminika na bhakutungamanika yakubhehe hangwana bhabhe bhapakwatenda ajemelei nnani ja nyumba jabhe joha, nabhena bhapekehe bhatumichi bhangi chakulya chabhenji kwa muda gugupalikwa? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Ipakubhee nga kuhachuka kwa antumichi jonijola yakubhehe hangwana bhabhe chibhapakubhuja bhapakwakolela bhabhi kutenda henela. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Ndenda kunnobholelanga kweli, bhapakwabheka bhajemelele hilebhe yabhe yoha. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Nambo chihibhile jonijola antumichi bhapakuganikia mu ntima gwabhe, ‘Hangwana bhangu bhatenda kabha kubhuja,’ ngapena bhakajemeka kwaapotanga bhenibhala akantumichi akanalome na haikege na kulyehe na kung'we na kolelwa, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />hangwana bhabhe bhenibhala habhanda bhapakuhika lichobha lyangaganikiana muda gwangagumanya. Bhenabho hangwana bhabhe bhapakwalagia muno na kwabheka pamo na bhandu bhangaaminika.”<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />“Bhenibhala antumichi bhabhahimanya maha upaliho gwa hangwana bhabhe na bhakoto kuchibheka maha wala kutenda handa chibhapala hangwana bhabhe, bhapakwanyamuka muno. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Nambo amundu bhoha bhala bhabhangaimanya lilipalikwa kutendekwa na handa bhateendite hikubho yangapalikwa bhapakwaanyamuka kachoko, na amundu bhabhatati hijingi bhapakulongwa hijingi muno, amundu bhabhabhile na mamulaka makolongwa bhapakonywa muno.”<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhaleta mpwilingano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Amatayo 10:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Ndekuhika kujakia mooto pachilambo, ndendakulokolila gukabhii tayali gujemike kujaka! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Nambo minayo hibhini muno hiimbalikwa nage, ndendakubhuka muno mpaka pagapakweela! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Nng'anikianga ndekuhika kuleta amani pachilambo? Ngabha, ndenda kunnobholelanga ngabha, ndekuhika kuleta mpwilingano. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Kujemeka nangocheni, kupakubhehe na bhandu nhano mu nyuumba jimo, bhatatu kwa bhabhele na bhabhele kwa bhatatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Bhapakupwatanilanga atati na mwana jwabhe na mwana na atati mundu, anyongo na mwali jwabhe na mwali na hanyongo mundu, hakibhabhe na haki mundu. Nabhena hakimundu na hakibhabhe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugumanya muuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Amatayo 16:2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Ayesu bhakagulobholela gonigola nkutuli gwa bhandu, “Handa mmonitinge lihunde litendakupitila kuuwelo, guna kamo, ‘Hula jipakoma,’ na kweli jitenda koma. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Na mwangota handa mujibhonite mboongo ja kuchini jitenda kupoga, na mwangota mwalobhola, kupakubhehe na lyoto, na kubhehe hiyoyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Mwe mwangota andendemundu! Ntendakuhimanya namuna ja kuhimanya kubhonekana kwa chilambo na Kunani. Kwa niki ngaimanya maana ja hikubho hiibhokela ngocheni?”<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpatanange na akaapwati bhinu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Amatayo 5:25-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Kwaniki ngakombolanga mwachinabhene kuamuanga chikubho chichibhi maha? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Panyaula na nchitaki jwinu ku mahakama, nchimile kuelewana na bhenabho mmi ndela. Ngabha henela, bhapakumpeleka kwa machili kwa aliwali, na bhena aliwali bhapakumpeleka kwa linyema na linyemba lipakumpeleka muligelecha. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Nannobholelanga, ngabhoka monomwe mpaka nnepe ulohi gwa mwicho.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Nnekange mmabhou ginunji handa hopo mpakuwenganga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Muda gonogwe bhandu kukibha na bhandu teno, bhabhakaalobholela Ayesu nnani ja bhandu teno bha ku Galilaya yakubhehe Apilato akolo bha ku Yuda bhakakulumikia bhakomekwe na miyahi yabhenji jihangalanwe na hinyama hiichinjitwe ligongo lya mbeeko. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Nabhena Ayesu bhakalobholelanga, “Nng'anikianga yakubhehe bhandu bha ku Galilaya yakubhe bhakawe malilo ga namuna yeneyo bhenaangota bhakalemwanga kupeta bhandu bha ku Galilaya bhangi? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Ngabha hopo! Mwangota handa ngalekanga mabhou ginu, mwangota mpakuwenga helahela. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Au bhenibhala bhandu komi na nane bhabhwilinge pabhakagwelwanga na nnala konokwe kuchilambo cha ku Siloamu, nng'anikianga habhobho bhakibhanga akabhou kupeta bhandu bhoha bhabhatamitanga ku Yelusalemu? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Nanobholelanga, ngabha hopo! Mwangota handa ngalekanga mabhou ginu bhoa mpakuwenganga hela hela.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulandana kwa nkongo gwa ntini gwangaogola mabibo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga ngani heje, “Amundu bhamo bhakibha na nkongo gwa ntini gugupanditwe mu ng'oonda gwabhe gwa mzabibu, bhakahika ili kulolea tini mu nkongo hogwe, nambo bhangapata hata limo. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Henela bhakaalobholela bhakulolekea nng'onda, ‘Nnole, kwa muda gwa yaaka hitatu nangocheni ndekubhehe kuhika kulolea mabibo mu ntini hogo, nanenga nangapata hata limo. Nhekete! kwaniki guendelee kuhalibiana mmandopi?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Nambo Jonijola jwakulokea nng'onda akajangula, ‘Hangwana, nneke kabhele kwa chaka chimo na kupunda, nanenga mbakulemela na kubhekela mbolea. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Handa ngaogolahopo mabibo chaka chichiika, yammbone, mguhekete,’”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kwaalamiha haikege bhamo lichobha lya kupomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Lichobha limo Ayesu bhatendita kujigana mu Nyuumba ja konganilana Bhayahudi lichobha lya kupomolela. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Mu Nyuumba jenejo kukibha na mwikege jumo bhabhakatamikwa na mahoka kwa yaaka komi na nane, ng'ongo gwabhe kugapenda na bhakalepela kujema gwema. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Ayesu pabhakaabhona, bhaakakema, na kwaalobholela, “Mwikege nnamite chitamwa chinu,” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Ayesu bhakabheka mabhoko nnani jabhe, mala bhakajema gwema bhakajemeka kwalumbalila Annoongo. <verse eid="LUK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Nambo akolo bha nnyumba ja konganilanga Bhayahudi bhakatumbala ligongo Ayesu bhatekwalamia bhena haikege lichobha lya kupomolela. Henela akolo bha nyuumba ja konganilanga Bhayahudi bhakaendelea kugulobholela nkutuli gwa bhandu, “Gabhi machobha chita mpalikwanga kutenda lihengo, mu machobha hago, nhikange nnamange, nambo nkotokuhikanga Lichobha lya Kupomolela.” <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Pena bahi Hangwana bhakaajangulanga, “Mwe mwangota akandendemundu! Bholi, kila jumo jwinu ngaajogolela ng'oombe jwabhe au liponda jwabhe kubhoka mu lichinga bhakaapelekwa kwaang'wea machi Lichobha lya Kupomolela? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Na hojojo mwikege, bha ubhelehi gwa Aibulahimu, Lichetani bhaatabhite kwa yaaka komi na nane yenjeni, yangapaalikwa kujogolekwa chitabho chenjeni Lichobha lya Kupomolela?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Pabhakajomola kulobhola genago, akapwati bhabhe bhakaabhona honi nambo bhena bhangi bhoha bhakaahangalalanga ligongo lya hikubho yoha hiibhakaitenda.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulandana kwa mbeju njoko ja nkongo gwa haladali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Amatayo 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Amaluko 4:30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakakonya, “Bholi, Ukolo gwa Annoongo gulandine na niki? au mbakugulandanikia na chiniki? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Ukolo gubhile handa mbenu njook ja nkongo gugukemwa nhaladali, yakubhehe amudu bhakajitola bhakajipanda mu ng'onda gwabhe, jikakola na kubhehe nkongo nkolongwa na hijuni ya kunani bhakachenganga hiyua mu nyaambi yabhe.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulandana kwa chiloongo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:33">Amatayo 13:33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Ayesu bhakakonya kabhele, “Mbakugulandanikia ukolo gwa Annoongo naniki? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Gulandana na chilongo yakubhe mwikege jwatolite na kuangalana mu madebe gatatu ga ukobha mpaka goha gukatutumuka.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nniyango gwa kunying'inyala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Amatayo 7:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21-23">21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Ayesu bhakapeta mu hilambo na hijiji, bhabhi kwaajigananga bhandu wakati bhakibha mu ulendo kujaula ku Yeluchalemu. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Mundu jumo bhakaakonya, “Hangwana, nga bhandu kachoko tu bhapakuokolewanga?” <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />Ayesu akalobhola, “Nchimilange kujingila kwa kupetela nniyango gwa nying'inying'i, kweli ndendakukongolelanga, bhandu bhajingi bhapakujigana kujingila nambo bhakombolanga hopo. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Wakati gutendakuhika akola nyuumba pabhakujimuka na kujigala nnliyango, mpakujemanga panja na mmi kong'onda nnliyango na kulobhola, ‘Hangwana, ntujogolele nniyango.’ Nambo bhenabho bhapakuunyangulanga, ‘Nimmanyanga hopo Mwangota wala kunpitilanga.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Ngapena mpakujangulanga, ‘Tukalyehe na kung'wee pamo namwenga, kabhele nkatujigana palugwinjili.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Nambo bhenabho bhapakunnyangula na kulobhola, ‘Nimmanyangahopo mwangota wala kumpitilanga. Mmokange kwachangu mwakakola mabhou!’” <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />“Penapo bhapakuhechukanga na lilaka muno, chimpakwabhona Aibulaimu, Aichaki na Ayakobo na akaalondohi bhoha bhakibha mu ukolo gwa Annoongo, nambo mwangota mpakubhehe bhapakuunyeha panja. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Bhandu bhapakuika kubhoka kuuwelo, kuulabho, na kuchini, na kachikachini bhoha bhapalyehe yakulya yakubhehe Annoongo bhatekwaapanganikiha na bhapakubhehe Akolo bhabhenji. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Bhenibhala bhakujomolekeha na bhapakubhehe bha kujemeka, na bhenibhala bha kujemeka bhapakubhehe bha kujomolekeha.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhachigutila chilambo cha ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Amatayo 23:37-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Muda gogogo Mapalichayo na bhandu bhangi bhakajendela Ayesu na kwalobholela, “Mmoke pambani nnyabhule chehemu jengi kwa kubhehe Ahelode bhapala kunkoma.” <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Ayesu bhakajangula, “Nnyabhulange nkaalobholele bhena libweha, kubhehe, ‘Leleni na malabhi mbakugabhenga mahoka na kwalamianga akaatamwa, na lichobha lya tatu mbakujomola lihengo lyangu.’” <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Hata henela, kwa leleni, malabhi na pakelu, hipalikwa nnyaule na ulendo ngwangu, kwa kubhehe bhakwa alondohi bhapakomekwa panja ja ku Yeluchalemu!. <verse eid="LUK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Mwe Yelusalemu, mwenga bhamwakoma akaalondoi kwa kwapotanga maganga! mala hijingi ndekulokolila kwaakumbanga bhana bhinu pamo handa ngoko chibhakondekana yaana yabhe kuhi mapapatilo gakwe nambo mwangapala! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Nnolange nyumba jinunji jilekitwe ukebha, ndenda kunnobholelanga ngamonanga kabhele mpaka muda gola pampakulobholanga, ‘Bhatekutendelwa gammbone bhenabho bhabhahika kwa lihina lya Hangwana.’”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhaalaamiya amundu bhabhabhile na chitamwa cha chakutupa mmele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Lichobha limo lya kupomolela Ayesu pabhakalalikwa kulyehe chakulya kaja kwa bhamo bha akaakolo bha makaafalisayo na bhandu bhabhakibhanga penapo bhatendita kwaalolekea muno. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Popopo nnongi jabhe Ayesu pakibha na amundu bhamo bhabhakibha na chitamwa cha kutupa mmele goha. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Bahi, Ayesu akaakonyanga Mapalichayo na bhabhajiganga malagilo ga Amusa, “Bholi, malagilo gapala kunnamia mundu lichobha lya kupomolela au ngabha?” <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Nambo bhakatamanga jiii. Nambo Ayesu bhakankamula bhena atamwa na kwalamia, gubhannekitaje ajabhule. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Ngapena Ayesu akaakonyanga, “Nga aganiki pakati jinunji mwana au ng'ombe bhagwiile mulihembo ngateenda chindema kwaabhoa hata likabhehe lichobha lya kupomolela?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Na bhenaangota bhakibha hopo na chakulongela.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuchitulua na kuchikwea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Ayesu bhakabhona bhenibhala akaageni bhabhaalalikwe bhatendakuchiagulila kutama hitengu ya nnoongi bhakaalobholelanga kwa ngani heje, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Handa amundu bhannalike paulombela, nkoto kutama hitengu ya kutopea ikoto kubhehe bhatekupanganikiwa chene chitengu bhabhaalikwe akolongwa kupunda mwenga. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Handa ntamite penapo bhenibhala bhabhannalikinge mwangota bhabhele bhapakuhika kunnobholela, ‘Mmoke pachitengu chinu mwape bhatame bhenabho,’ penapo mpakola honi nnongi ja bhandu na mapakujemeka kuhegelela na kutama pa hitengu yangatopea. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Nambo handa bhannalike paulombela nnyabhule nkatame pa hitengu yangatopea ili pabhapakuhika bhenibhala bhabhannalike bhannobholele, ‘Aganja bhangu nnyaule nkatame pakutopea muno.’ Penapo mpakutopela nnoongi ja akaageni bhoha bhabhanlola. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Kwa kubhehe kila amundu bhabhapakubhehe akolongwa bhapakubhehe achoko choko, na bhabhabhile achoko choko bhapakubhehe akolongwa.” <verse eid="LUK 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakaalobholela na bhenibhala bhabhakaalalikanga, “Handa mpakwatelekelanga bhandu chaakulya cha muhi na kimuho, nkoto kwaalalikanga akaaganja bhinu bhabhabhii na hilebhe, wala akaanung'una bhinu, wala akaandami ajinu, bhakoto na bhenabho bhakaannalika, mpakubhehe ntekulepwa chinkaatendelanga. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Nambo panhalakia chaakulya cha paulombela mwakemange bhandu akaahocho na akanangwabha na bhabhapolite na bhangalolanga, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />namwenga nga chimpakutendelwa gammbone na Annoongo ligongo bhenaangota bhanga cha kummujikia mwenga. Maana Annoongo bhapakunmujikiha mwenga lichobha lya kwaayohanga bhandu bhabhakondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanikiha kwa lichobha likolongwa lya chaakulya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Amatayo 22:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Bahi pabhakajoa genago jumo jwa bhenibhala bhabhakatama nabho kulyee chaakulya pamo na Ayesu bhakalobhola, “Mbaya jonijola jwapakulyehe chaakulya mu ukolo gwa Annoongo.”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Ayesu bhakaajangula, “Pakibha na amundu bhamo bhabhakahalakia lichobha likolongwa lya kulyee na kwaalalikanga bhandu bhajingi. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Palikahika lichobha likolongwa lya kulyee chaakulya bhakantuma mmanda bhajaule bhakaakeme bhandu bhabhalalikwe, ‘Nhikange kwa maana hilebhe yoha hibhile maha.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Nambo bhandu bhoha bhakajemekanga kuchitetelanga ligongo lya kulepelanga kuhika. Bha kujemeka bhakaalobholela bhenabho abhanda, ‘Ndekuhemela nng'onda, hipalikwa nyahule ngagulole, choonde nnjamehe.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Joongi bhakalongela, ndekuhemela ng'ombe komi bha kulemela, nangocheni ndendakunnyopa nyaule kwaajiganga, choonde nnjamehe. <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Joongi bhakalobhola, ndekulombela mwikege nangocheni, ngombolahopo kuhika.<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Jonijola mmanda bhakajaula, kwalobholela Hangwana bhabhe gagabhokile. Bahi, bhenibhala hakola nyuumba bhakatumbala, bhakalobholela abhanda bhabhe, ‘Mmoke chindema, nnyaule mu ndela ngolongwa na ndela njokonjoko mu chilambo, nkaaletange pambani hakaocho, bhabhapolite, na bhangalolanga na akanangwabha.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Bhenibhala abhanda bhakalobhola, ‘Hangwana, chenichela chinntekunagia chitendikwe handa chintekunnagia nambo tangu gubhi upenyo mahali pa lichobha likolongwa.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Hangwana bhakaalobholela abhanda, nnyaule mu ndela ngolongwa na ndela njokonjoko ya pachilambo nyaule nkaakulumikiange bhandu bhajingilange na bhatwelelange mu nyuumba jangu. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Maana ndenda kunnobholelanga pakati ja bhenibhala bhabhaalalikwe na kukananga bhaakwa bhabhapakulyanganga chaakulya changu cha lichobha likolongwa!”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiipalikwa kubhehe bhanapunji bha Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Amatayo 10:37-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Bahi bhandu bhajingi bhakalongana na Ayesu. Ngapena Ayesu akaatendebhukila bhandu na kwalobholelanga, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Handa amundu bhoabhala jwaapala kubhee anapunji bhangu hipaalikwa bhambale nenga kupeta chibhaapala atati bhabhe na anyongo bhabhe na hanu bhabhe na bhaana bhabhe na akaanung'una analome na akahikege, na hata chibhachipala bhene na handa ngatenda henela ngapalikwa kubhehe bhanapunji bhangu. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Mundu johajola jwakoondahopo kulaga na kujomoka pabhangagula ngakombola kubhee anapunji bhangu.”<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />“Maana nga ganiki pakati ja mwangota, handa bhapalite kuchenga nyuumba ngolongwa, ngatama hopo pahi na kubhalangana na kulola handa bhabhile na ulohi gwa kujomolekea kucheengela? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Kwa kubhee handa bhajeemike kuchenga nyuumba ja matopaali na kuchenga nchingi ngapena na kulepela kujomolekea kuchenga jene nyuumba, bhandu bhabhaalola bhapakujemekanga kwaaheka, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Bhapakulobholanga, ‘Habha amundu bhakajemeka kuchemga nambo bhaleepile kujomolekea.’”<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Nnobhole kulandanikia kongi ikabhee bhabhii akolo, bhabhapala kujaula kupootana na akolo bhangi, bhatama hopo pahi na kuganikia manyemba gakwe elufu komi bhapakombolanga kupootanga na akolo bhabhabhii na manyemba elufu makomi gabhele bha akolo bhangi? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Handa bhabhonite ngakombola, bhapakwatumanga akaatumichi bhabhe bhajaulange ili bhakombolange kuelewana muuda gonowe akolo bhangi bhabhii tangu kutali. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Henela, bahi, jwaakwa hata jumo jwinunji jwapakubhee bhanapunji bhangu handa ngaleka yoha hibhabhii nayo.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwinyo gwanga nong'a</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Amatayo 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Amaluko 9:50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Mwinyo nga gwammbone, nambo handa kuhobhie kunong'na kwakwe mpakulekela chiniki ili jibhujile kabhele mu kunong'na kwakwe? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Mwinyo ngapaa kabhele kulekelwa mu mandopi wala kutenda mbolea, bhandu bhapakujijea tu. Mgakamulange genigala gabhankongolilinge!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Kulandanikia na ngondolo jwaobhite</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Amatayo 18:12-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Lichobha limo bhabhatochanga kodi na akakola mabhou bhajingi bhakajaulanga kwajohanikia Ayesu <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Mafalisayo na bhabhajigananga Malagilo ga Amusa bhakajemekanga kwakokolekela, bhabhi kulobholanga, “Mwalolange habha amundu! Bhatenda kwapokelanga bhabhilinge na mabhou, na kulyee nabho.” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Ayesu bhakajangula kwa kulandanikia.<verse eid="LUK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Handa jumo jwinunji bhabhi na ngondolo makomi komi na handa bhahimanyite jumo jwabhe atekuhobha, bhapakutenda niki? Bholi, ngaaleka bheni bhala makomi tisa na tisa kulikonja na kujaula kunnolea bhamo bhabhahobhite mpaka bhampate? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Nabhena handa bhampatite, kwa kuhangalala bhapakumpapa pa mabhega gabhe <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />na handa bhabhujite kwachabhe. Ngapena bhapakwakema maganja gabhe na akaandami na kwalobholelanga, ‘Nhangalalange pamo nanenga, ndekumpata ngondolo jwangu jumo jwaakahobha.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Ndenda kunkongolelanga, hela hela kupakubhee na kuhangalala muno kunani Kulihunde ligongo lya akola mabhou bhamo bhabhalekite kulemwa, kupunda bhenibhala makomi tisa na tisa bhabhakondekwa nnongi ja Annoongo yakubhee bhanga na lilemwa lyakupala kuleka.”<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kulandanikia na njejeka jijihobhite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Ayesu bhakaendelea kulongela, “Handa haikege bhabhile hipande komi ya madini ga mbiha na bhakaobhea chipande chimo, bholi, ngajakiha lumuli na kupyagila mu nyuumba na kujilolea muno mpaka bhajipate?” <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />“Handa bhajipatite, bhapakwaakema akaaganja bhabhe na akaandami ajabhe na kwaalobholela, ‘Nhangalalange pamo na nenga, nijipatite chipande changu chimo cha madinu ga mbiha chichikahobha nichipatite.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Kabhele ndendakunnobholelanga, henela nga chibhapakuhachukanga bhatumichi bha kunani kulihunde bha Hangwana ligongo lya jwaalemwite jumo na kuleka mabhou.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanikia na kakombo jwaahobhite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Ayesu bhakapunda kulongela, “Pakibha na mundu jumo bhakibha na akakombo bhabhele akanalome. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Jonijola nchokochoko bhakaalobholela atati bhabhe, ‘Atati, mmbekehe hilebhe yangu.’ Henela bhakaametulilanga na kwaapekeanga bhaana bhabhe bhoha bhabhele. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Penapo, jonijola nchoko choko bhakakumba hilebhe yakwe yoha yakibha nayo, bhakajaula chilambo cha kutali na konokwe bhakajita jita hilebhe yabhe kwa uloloi. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Pabhakajomola kujita jita hilebhe yoha hiyakibha nayo, kukibha na njala jalikuluta ku chilambo chela choha, na bhenabho bhakajemeka kulaga. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Ngapena nkakombo jola bhakajaula kujopa lihengo kwa akola chilambo bhamo bha cheni chela chilambo, na bhenibhala akola chilambo bhakaapekea lihengo lya kuliha magolobhe. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Bhenibhala nkakombo bhakalokolila kulyee chakulya chibhalilinge magolobhe nambo jwakwa mundu jwakaapekeha chakulya. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Nambo luunda gwabhe pagukajemeka kwaabhujila, bhakaganikia mu ntima gwabhe bhakalobhola, ‘Bhatumichi bhalengwa bhabhatendanga lihengo kwa atati bhangu yakubhee bhatenda kulyanganga chakulya chijingi na kuhiigaa, na nenga nibhii pambani ndenda Kujomoka na njala! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Mbakubhoka na kubhuja kwa Atati bhangu na kwalobholela, atati, ndekulemwa kwinu atati na nnongi ja Annoongo kunani Kulihunde. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Mbalikwa hopo kabhele kungema mwana jwinu nndende jumo jwa akaabhanda bhinu.’” <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Bahi, bhakabhoka kujaula kwa atati bhabhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Nambo pabhakibha tangu kutali, atati bhakaalola, ntima gwabhe gukatwelela kiha. Bhakaabhutukila amwana bhabhe, na kwanyambatila na kwaachalimia kwa kuhangalala.” <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Jonijola nkakombo bhakaalobholela Atati bhabhe, “Ndekulemwa nnoongi jinu na nnoongi ja Annoongo kunani kulihunde. Mbalikwahopo kabhele kukemwaa mwana jwinu.” <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Nambo atati bhabhe bhakalobholela bhatumichi, “Nnetange chindema!” “Nnetange ngobho jijibhile jammbone muno, mwaweke pete mulukonji lwabhe na champali ya bei ngolongwa mmakongono gabhe. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Ngapena nkaapetule mwana jwa ng'oombe jwakunakana twaachinje ili tutendange lichobha likolongwa na tulyee. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Kwa maana jonjoni mwanangu bhakajomoka na nangocheni bhamomi, bhakibha bhahobhite nangocheni bhabhonikine! Ngapena bhakajemekanga kuhangalala.”<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Muda gonogwe, jonijola mwana nkolongwa bhakibha kumigonda. Pabhakabhandikila kaja, bhakajoa lilobhe lya mijembo na bhandu bhatenda kuhinanga. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Bhakaakema antumichi bhamo bhakaakonya, ‘Chibhi niki?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Bhenabho antumichi bhakaalobholela, ‘Anung'una jwinu bhatekuhika, Atati bhinu bhatekwachinjila ng'ombe nchokochoko jwakunakana ligongo mwana jwabhe bhatekubhuja bhabhi bhamomi.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Jonijola mwana nkolongwa bhakatumbala na bhakakana hata kujingila nkati ja nyuumba. Bahi atati bhabhe bhakabhoka panja na kwapembelea. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Nambo bhenabho akakombo bhakaajangula atati bhabhe, ‘Atati nnyohanikie! yaaka yoha heye ndekuntumikila kwa yaaka hijingi na hata lichobha limo nangaleka kutenda chikanobholela, nambo mwanga mbekeha hata mwana jwa mbuhi ili hangalale na akaaganja bhangu! <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Nambo pabhahikite kaaja habha mwana bhinu yakubhehe bhatekujita jita hilebhe yoha kwa akaikege bhakupala muno ngongola mwenga ntekwachinjila mwana jwa ng'oombe jwakunakana!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Atati bhabhe bhakaajangula, ‘Mwana jwangu, ntekubhee nanenga machobha goha na yoha himi nayo nga hinu. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Nambo chiipalikwa kutendeka nga kuhachuka na kuhangalala ligongo hojojo anung'una bhinu bhakajomoka nangocheni bhabhi bhamomi, bhakibha bhahobhite leleni bhabhonikine.’”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Kulandanikia kwa ajemelei bhakumanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Ayesu bhakaalobholela bhanapunji bhabhe, “Pakibha na amundu bhamo akola hilebhe bhabhakibha bhajemelela hilebhe yabhe. Akola hilebhe bhakajoa kubhee ajemelei bhabhe bhatenda kujita jita hilebhe yatendita kujemelela. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Lichobha limo jono akola hilebhe bhakaakema na kwaakonya yakubhee nga chikubho niki heche chinichijoine nnani jinu, ‘Nangocheni mmalangane mabhalangano ga hilebhe hintenda kujemelela kwa kubhee ligongo ngaendelea kubhee mwa ajemelei bhangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Bhenibhala ajemelei bhakaganikia muntima gwabhe, ‘Mbakutenda niki nangocheni? Hangwana bhangu bhatenda kumoa lihengo lya kujemelela hilebhe yabhe. Nanga machili gakombola kulema, nanenga mona honi kujopajopa. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Nangocheni niimanyi chimbakutenda ili handa bhamoite lihengo lyangu lya kujemela hilebhe yabhe, bhandu bhakombolange kumbokela mu nyuumba yabhenji.’”<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Henela akaakema kila jumo jwa bhenibhala bhabhaalonganga. Bhakaalobholela bhenibhala bha kujemeka, “Mwakajahika hilengwa kwa akola hilebhe bhangu?” <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Ngapena bhakajangula, “Mangondingo mia jimo makomi nane na nhano ga mahuta ga mzeituni, bhenibha ajemelei akaalobholela, ntole likalatachi lya ligambo linu, ntame chindema, nnyandike makomi tisa na nusu. <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Ngapena bhakaakonya jwa bhele, mwenga mwakajaika hilengwa? Bhakajangula, magunia makomi gabhele ga ngaano. Bhenibhala ajemelei bhakaalobholela, mtole likalatachi lya ligambo nyaandike chindema magunia mia jimo na makomi sita! <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Bhenibhala hangwana bhakaalumbalila bhenibhala ajemelei namuna chibhabhile bhakupenya. Kwa maana bhandu bha chilambo heche bhapenyitinge muno. Nambo bhandu bhabhakagula Annoongo ngabha bhakumanya handa bhenaangota.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Ndendakunnobholelanga, “Ayesu bhakaendelea kulongela ntumiange hilebhe ya pachilambo kuchipatilanga maganja, ili pahipakujomoka mpokelwange na Annoongo mu matamo ga machobha goha. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Amundu bhoha bhala bhabhaaminika mu hilebhe hichoko muno bhaaminika mu hilebhe hikolongwa, na bhoabhala bhangaaminika mu hilebhe hichoko muno ngaaminika mu hilebhe hijingi. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Bahi, Handa mwangabhee bhakuaminika kwa kutumia hilebhe ya pachilambo hilebhe ya pachilambo, nga ganiki jwapakunhamini kwa hilebhe ya kweli? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Handa ngaaminika kwa hilebhe ya amundu bhangi nga aganiki bhabhapakunhamini kumpekea hilebhe hinu mwabhene?”<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />“Jwaakwa antumichi jwakombola kwatumikilanga akakolo bhabhele. Kwa kubhee bhapakwaapala jumo na kwaachimwaa joongi. Ngakombolanga kwatumikila Annoongo na mbiha kwa wakati gumo.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majigano gangi ga Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Amatayo 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Amaluko 10:11-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Nambo Mafalisayo bhabhakibhanga bhapalanga mbiha pabhakagajoha genago, bhakajemeka kwaabhelua Ayesu. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga, “Mwangota bhandu mchitendanga kubhee bhammbone nnongi ja bhandu, nambo Annoongo bhatenda kuimanya mitima jinunji. Kwa kubhee yakubhee bhandu bhachilola kubhee chammbone muno chitenda kuchimwa nnoongi ja Annoongo.”<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />“Malagilo ga Amusa na majigano ga akaalondohi bha Annoongo gatendita kutangachwa mpaka muda gwa Ayohana. Kujemeka gono muda Ngani Jammbone ja Ukolo gwa Annoongo jitenda kutangachwa na kila jumo bhajingila monomwe kwa machili. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Nambo nga kujojoka muno kunani kulihunde na chilambo kupeta kupunda hata lijaandiko limo kubhoka mu Malagilo ga Amusa.”<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />“Mundu johajola jwampekea hanu bhabhe talaka na kulombela hanu jongi bhatenda ngongola, na amundu bhoa bhala bhabhalombela ahikege bhabhalekitwe, bhatenda ngongola.”<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akola hilebhe na Alazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Pakibha na mundu jumo akola hilebhe bhabhatendita kuwala ngobho ya kualala na ya bei ngolongwa na bhatendita kutama umomi gwa kuchikonja machobha goha. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Pannlyango pa bhena akolo hilebhe pakibha na haocho bhamo lina lyakwe Alazalo bhabhakibha hilonda mmele goha. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Bhenabho Alazalo bhakalokolila kuchijukutia kwa chakulya chichikagwehe pahi ja mecha kwa bhenibhala akola hilebhe. Hata himbwa hikahikanga kwaalamba hilonda yabhe! <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Lichobha limo bhenibhala haocho Alazalo bhakajomoka, nabhena antumichi bha kunani kulihunde bha Hangwana bhakaapetula bhatame pamo na Aibulahimu, na bhenibhala akola hilebhe bhakajomoka na bhakaachika. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Jonojwe akola hilebhe, pabhakibha mu hibhini muno mahali kwa bhandu bhabhawilinge, bhakalola kunani, na bhakaabhona Aibulahimu kwa kutali na Alazalo kubhandikila na bhena. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Henela bhenibhala akola hilebhe bhakaakema kwa lilobhe likolongwa, ‘Mwe Atati Aibulahimu ngolee kiha na mwaatume Alazalo bhachubhike lukonji lwabhe nkati ja machi bhagukolonikie lulimi lwangu, ligongo ndenda kuulala muno pamoto mahali pambani. <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Nambo Aibulahimu bhakaajangula, mwanangu nkombokele mwenga nkapokela yaambone mu umomi gwinu, nambo Alazalo bhakapokela gangalimmbone mu umomi gwabhe. Nambo nangocheni Alazalo bhatendakuchikonja pambani na mwenga ntendakulaga. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Kupunda ja genago nkati jitu na mwangota konokwe, kubhekitwe lihembo likolongwa, ili bhenibhala bhabhapalanga kubhoka kongo kuhika konokwe bhakotokombola, wala mundu joha jola bkotokombola kujoomboka konokwe kuhika kwaachitu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Bhenibhala akola hilebhe bhakaapembelea, atati Aibulahimu ndenda kunnyopa, muntume Alazalo bhajaule kwa akaanung'una bhangu, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />maana ndekola akaanung'una bhangu nhano. Bhajaule bhakaakelebhue ili bhenaangota bhakoto kuhikanga kongoni ku hibhini. <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Aibulahimu bhakajangula, anung'una bhinu bhabhii na Amusa na akaalondohi bha Annoongo, mwaalekange bhabhajohanikiange bhenaangota. <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Bhenibhala akola hilebhe bhakalobhola, ngabha henela atati Aibulahimu, nambo amundu handa bhayookite na kwaajendelela na kwaakelebhua bhapakulekanga mabhou na kwaatendebhukila Annoongo, <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Na bhena Abulahimu bhakaalobholela, handa bhangajohanikianga Amusa na akalondohi bha Annoongo, na hata handa bhajawile amundu bhabhayookite kubhoka kwa bhabhawilinge ngaajonikianga.”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Majigano naani ja mabhou na kulekelelwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Amatayo 18:6-7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Amaluko 9:42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Ayesu bhakaalobholela bhanapunji bhabhe, “Hilebhe hiiyajambukia amundu kutenda mabhou hibhile machoba goha, kulaga kupakubhee kwaachebha amundu bhenibha bhenibhala bhabhapakwaajambukia amundu kutenda mabhou. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Hikabhii mbaya kwa amundu bhanabho kwaatabha liganga likolongwa pantandala gwabhe na kwaajea mubahali kuliko kwaabhila jumo jwa akaanung'una habhabha.” <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Henela, nchilolekeange! “Handa anung'una bhinu bhatendite mabhou mwaakelebhue, na bhena handa bhalekite mabhou, mwaalekelele. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Handa bhannemwite pa saba kwa lichobha, na penipala pabhabhuja kwaachinu kulobhola na kuleka mabhou gabhe nga hipaalikwa mwaalekelele.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhobhalela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Akaandundame bhabhe bhakaalobholela Hangwana, “Nntujonjokee kuhobhalela.” <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Na bhena Ayesu bhakajangula, “Handa nkolitinge kuhobhalela kuchoko choko hana njelegwa ja haladali, nkombolanga kugulobholela hogo nkongo gwa nkuyu, ‘Ntupuke nkamele mubahali,’ Na gonogwe gukajeketela.”<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihengo lya antumichi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Ayesu bhakalobhola, “Ikabhee bhamo bhinunji atekola abhanda bhabhalema kuming'onda au bhabhailia ngondolo, bholi, pabhakwalobholela abhanda bhabhe pabhabhuja kubhoka kumigonda, nhike pambani ntame nlyee chakulya? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Bholi, badala jakwe, ngaalobholela, ndelekele chaakulya, nilyee, nchijigane kundumikila pandendakulyee na kung'wee, baadae mpakombola kulyee na kung'wee? <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Bholi, jono mundu apakunchukulu antumichi hojwe ligongo bhakatenda chenichela chichikapaalikwa kutenda? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Hela hela na mwangota handa nnyomwilinge kutenda gabhannagihe, nnobholange, twenga nga bhatumichi tu bhatutendite gagapaalikwa.”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kwaalamia akaatamwa mambujupuju komi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Ayesu pabhatendita kujaula Kuyelusalemu, bhakapeta kunpaka gwa ku Samalia na ku Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Pabhakibha bhatenda kujingila mu chijiji chimo, bhakakongana na bhandu komi bhabhakibhanga na itamwa ya mambujupuju. Na bhenaangota bhakajemanga kutali, <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />bhakakwe lilobhe, bhakaalobholela, “Ayesu, Hangwana, ntukolee kiha!” <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Pabhakabhonanga bhakaalobholelanga, “Nnyaulange nkachilangiange kwa akaakung'i.” Nabhena pabhakibhanga nndela bhabhi kujaula, bhakalamanga itamwa yabhenji na kondekwa handa chiiyobhalilike kwa kujopa. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Jumo jwabhenji pakabhona kubhee bhalamite, bhakabhuja kongo bhabhikwaalumbalila Annoongo, kwa lilobhe likolongwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Bhakachijeha pa makongono ga Ayesu na kwaachukulu. Amundu bhenabho bhakibha Amsamalia. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Henela Ayesu bhakaakonya, “Bholi, nangaalamianga bhandu komi na bhenaangota bhakakondekwa handa chiiyobhalilike ja kwaajopa? Bholi bhabhilinge koji bhenibhala tisa? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Bhakwa hata bhamo bhabhabhonikine bhabhikubhuja kwaatopea Annoongo nga habha ageni tu?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakaalobholela, “Nnyimuke nnyaule kwaachinu, kuhobhalela kwinu kutekunnamia.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhika Kwa ukolo gwa Annoongo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Amatayo 24:23-28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Lichobha limo Mapalisayo bhakaakonya Ayesu, “Ukolo gwa Annoongo gupakuhika lii?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:20">Bhenabho bhakaajangula, “Ukolo gwa Annoongo ngahika kwa namuna ja kubhonekana kwa miho, <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Wala bhakwa amundu bhabhapakulongela, gongo pambani, au gwago kwakola, kwakubhee Ukolo gwa Annoongo gubhii nkati jinunji.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakaalobholela bhanapunji bhabhe, “Machobha gatendakuika yakubhee mpakulokolilanga kulola lichobha limo lya machobha ga nenga Amwana bha Amundu, nambo ngajibhona. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Bhandu bhapakunnobholelanga, ‘Nnolange bhenibhala kwakola!’ Au, ‘Habha pambani!’ Nkotokubhutukilanga. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Kwakubhee nenga Amwana bha Amundu mu lichobha lyangu mbakubhee handa kung'anyima kwa njahi, gugumulikila kulihunde kujemeka kujomolekeha kongi mpaka bhangi. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Nambo mbaalikwa nenga Amwana bha Amundu kulaga oti, na nkanikwa na bhandu bha chibhelei hecheche.”<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Handa chiibhile mu machobha ga Anuhu, nga chiipakubhee mu machobha ga nenga Amwana bha Amundu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Mu machobha ga Anuhu bhandu bhatendita kulyee, na kung'wee, na kulombelanga na kulombwanga mpaka lichobha lela Anuhu pabhakajingila mu ntumbwi nkolongwa gugukakemwa chapina, hula ngolongwa jikakoma jikaakomanga bhandu na hilebhe yoha hikajomoka. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Ikibha hela hela mu machobha ga Alutu. Bhandu bhatendakulyee na kung'wee, bhatendita kuhemela na kuuchanga, na bhatendita kulemanga na kuchenganga. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Nambo lichobha lyela Alutu pabhakabhoka ku Sodoma, moto gwa chibeliti kubhoka kunani gukajitika na kwaatinianga bhoha. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />“Henela nga chiipakubhehe lichobha lyela nenga Amwana bha Amundu chimbakubhokela. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Mu lichobha helyo, mundu joha jola jwabhile litatali lya nyuumba jakwe, bhakoto kutuluka ili kuhipetula hilebhe yakwe hibhile nkati ja nyuumba na bhabhabhii kumigonda bhakoto kubhuja kwaachabhe. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Nkombokelange gagaakolile hanu bha Alutu! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Mundu johajola jwaajiga kuguokoa umomi gwabhe bhapakugahobhea na johajola jwapakuobheha umomi gwabhe bhapakugaokoa. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Ndenda kunnobholelanga, mu kilo hecho bhandu bhabhele bhapakubhee bhagolwike pa chindanda chimo, bhamo bhapakwaanyakula, bhangi bhapakulekwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Hakaikege bhabhele bhapakubhehe bhabhi kuyaga yaakulya pamo palikanga lya kuyagila yaakulya, bhamo bhapakunyakulwa na bhangi bhapakulekwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Bhandu bhabhele bhapakubhenganga kumigonda bhamo bhapakunyakulwa na bhamo bhapakulekwa.”<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Ngapena bhakaakonya, “Haga gapakubhokela kooji Hangwana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Bhakaajangula, “Papabhile na chinyama chichiwile, ngapena matumbuhi gapakondekana.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Kulandana kwa nhwelwa na aliwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Bahi, Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga bhanapunji bhabhe kulandanikiha kongoni, ili kwaalangianga namuna chiipalikwa kwaajopa Annoongo machobha goha pangali kutotokela. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Bhakalobhola, “Mu chilambo chimo pakibha na aliwali yakubhee bhakibha ngaajogopa Annoongo wala kwaatopea amundu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Mu chilambo hecho bhakibha nhwelwa jumo yakubhee bhatendita kuhika kwaachabhe mala kwa mala kwa aliwali bhenabho na bhabhikwaapembelea, ‘Choonde ndendakunyopa nnyaangatile ili ngombole kupata hilebhe yangu kubhoka kwa apwati bhangu!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Aliwali bhenabho bhatenditakana kwaajangatila nhelwa bhenabho kwa muuda ntandamao. Nambo bhakalobhola mumtima gwabhe, ‘Kwakubhee nenga ngaajogopa Annoongo wala nangali ngani amundu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />Nambo ligono nhelwa habha bhaendelea kunhabhua hipaalikwa naapekee chibhapala, ila handa ngaapeke bhapakunda kunhuabhua habhua machobha goha!’”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Ngapena Hangwana bhakalobhola, “Ng'anikiange muno genago gabhalongile bhena aliwali bhangatenda lihengo lyabhe chiipalikwa chibhalongela. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Bholi, Annoongo ngaatetelanga bhenibhala bhangu bhabhahagwile, bhabhaagutila kilo na muhi? Bholi, bhapakana kwaajonikia? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Ndendakunnobholelanga, bhapakwapekea chimpalanga chindema. Nenga Amwana bha Amundu chimbakuhika, bholi mbakwakolela tangu bhandu bhatendakuhobhalela pachilambo?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanikia kwa Amfalisayo na atocha kodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakaabholelanga kwa kulandanikiha, bhandu yakubhee bhabhachibhonanga kubhee bhatendakondekwa nnongi ja Annoongo na bhabhaabheluanga bhangi, bhakalobhola. <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Bhandu bhabhele bhakajaulanga mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo kujopa, jumo jwabhenji bhakibha Amfalisayo na jongi bhakibha antocha kodi. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Bhenibhala Amfalisayo bhakajema, chibhabhile bhene bhakalobhola, Annoongo, ndendakunchukulu kwakubhee nenga ngabha handa bhandu bhangi yakubhee, akaabhwihi, akaabhou na bhangoongola hata mmihopo handa atocha kodi habha. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Nenga ndendakutabha pa bhele kwa juuma, ndendakubhoa libhoga limo mu mabhoga komi ya hilebhe hiimbata. <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Nambo bhenibhala antocha kodi bhakajema kwa kutalika, pangali hata kunyakula miho gabhe kunani kulihunde, bali bhakachipota pantima kwa kuhumala, bhabhikulobhola, mwee Annoongo, nngoole kiha nenga naakola mabhou. <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga, ndendakunnobholelanga, habhabha antocha kodi bhakabhuja kaja bhakibha bhatekondekwa nnongi ja Annoongo kuliko bhenabho Amfalisayo. Kwakubhee bhohabhala bhabhachikwea bhapakutuluka, na bhohabhala bhapakutulukikwa bhapakwaakwea.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatendakwaapalia gammbone bhana bhachokochoko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Amatayo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Amaluko 10:13-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Bhangu bhatendita kwaapelekela Ayesu bhana bhachokochoko ili bhaabhekele mabhoko gabhe. Bhanapunji bhabhe bhapakabhonanga henela, bhakaalipilanga kwa malobhe gankalipa. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Nambo Ayesu akaikemanga yeniyela yaana bhahikange kwaachabhe, bhakalobhola, “Mwaalekange bhana bhachoko choko bhaikange kwaachangu, wala nkoto kwahibhilanga, kwakubhee ukolo gwa Annoongo nga gwa bhandu handa heye yaana. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Ndendakunnobholelanga kweli, amundu bhaobhala bhabhangapokela ukolo gwa Annoongo handa amwana habha achoochoko, ng'o ngajiingila mu ukolo gwa Annoongo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akolo bhabhabhile na hilebhe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Amatayo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Amaluko 10:17-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Akolo bhamo, Ayahudi, bhakaakonya Ayesu, “Bhannyigana bhammbone, ndendee chiniki ili ngombole kugupata umomi gwa machobha goha?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Ayesu akaajangula, “Kwa niki kungema nenga nammbone?” Ayesu akaakonya, “Bhakwa bhabhabhile bhammbone ila nga Annoongo jika jabhe.<verse eid="LUK 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Ntenda kuhimanya amuli, ‘Nkototenda ngoongola, nkotokoma, nkotokujibha, nkotokulobhola unami, mwatopehe atati bhinu na anyongolo bhinu.’”<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Bhakajangula, “Amuli yoha heyeye ndekamula kubhokela ugwana gwangu.” <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Ayesu pabhakajoha haga, bhakalobholela, “Tangu ntekupongokelwa na chilebhe chimo. Nnyabhule nkauche kila chilebhe chimminacho, mwapekehe hakaocho, na mwenga mpakubhee na ngokwe kunani kuliunde. Ngapena nhike nngagule.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Pabhaakajoha ngani jenejo, bhakahumalika muno, kwakubhee akibha mundu jwabhile na hilebhe hijingi.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Ayesu bhakaalola kulobhola, “Nnyoanikie namuna chiibhile kulimba kwa amundu bhabhabhile na hilebhe hijingi kujiingila mu Ukolo gwa Annoongo! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Nga kujojoka muno kwa chinyama chikolongwa chichikemwa ngamia kupeta mu lipobhole lya chindano kuliko amundu bhabhabhile na hilebhe hijingi kujingila mu Ukolo gwa Annoongo.” <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Bhenibhala bhabhakajoanga genago, bhakaakonya, “Nga aganiki bahi, bhabhapakombola kuokoka?” <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Ayesu bhakajaangula, “Gangakomboleka kwa bhandu, kwa Annoongo gatendakomboleka.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Ngapena Apetulo bhakaalobholela Ayesu, “Twenga tutekuileka yoha hiitubhinayo na kunkagula mwenga.” <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Ayesu bhakajaangula, “Nhobhalelange ndendakunkongolela, jwakwa hata jumo jwalekite nyuumba jabhe, au hanubhabhe, au hanung'una, au atati bhabhe na anyongo bhabhe au bhana ligongo lya Ukolo gwa Annoongo,<verse eid="LUK 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />Yakubhee ngapokelahopo pa hijingi muno mu machobha gangani na machobha gagahika na kugupata umomi gwa machobha goha.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhalondola pa tatu nnani ja malilo gabhe na kuyoka kwabhe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Amatayo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Amaluko 10:32-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Ayesu bhakaatolanga nyeenje bhenibhala bhanapunji komi na bhabhele na kwalobholelanga, “Nyoanikiange! Tupakujenda ku Yelusalemu na konokwe kila chilebhe chichijaandikwe na akaalondohi nnani jangu nenga Amwana bha Amundu chipaakwela. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Amwana bha Amundu bhapakwakamua mmabhoko ga bhandu bhangaamanya Annoongo na bhengaangota bhapakwabhelua na kwaatukana na kwahunila mata. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Bhapakwapota mihimbati na kwakoma, nambo lichobha lya tatu bhapakuyooka.” <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Nambo bhanapunji bhabhe bhangaelewa mana gakwe ngani hejo, ligongo jikibha ja chitibha kwachabhenji, na bhenaangota bhangaimanyanga Ayesu bhakongolela niki.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhaalamia bhangalola</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Amatayo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Amaluko 10:46-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Ayesu pabhatendita kubhandikila ku Yeliko, bhangalola bhamo bakibha batamite nngulugulu ja ndela bhabhikujopa kwaajangatila. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Jwangalola hojwe pakajoha nkutuli gwa bhandu gutendakupeta, bhakakonya, “Chibhile chiniki?” <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Bhakalobholela, “Ayesu bha ku Nazaleti bhatendakupeta.” <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Ngapena bhangalola bhenabho bhakakwea lilobhe, bhakalobhola, “Ayesu, Amwana bha Adaudi, nngolehe kiha!” <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Bhenibhala bhabhalongolile nnongi bhakaakalipila ili bhakotoke! Nambo bhenabho bhangalola bhakapunda bhakakwea libhole, bhabhikulobhola, “Amwana bha Adaudi ngolee kiha!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Ayesu bhakajema, bhakakulumikia bhenabho amundu bhalete kwachabhe. Pabhakabhandikila, Ayesu bhakaakonya, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Mpala niki nintendele?” Bhakajangula, “Hangwana, mbala kulola.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Ayesu bhakaalobholela, “Nnole kuhobhalela kwinu kutekunnamia.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Popopo bhangalola bhenabho bhakakoombola kulola na bhakaakagula Ayesu, kongo bhabhikwalumbalila Annoongo. Bhandu bhoha pabhakabhonanga lyenelyo, na bhenaangota bhakaalumbalila Annoongo.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu na Azakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Ayesu bhakajingila kunnyini ku Yeliko, na pabhatenditakupeta mu ndela ja chene chilambo. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Pakibha na amundu bhamo lihina lyabhe Azakayo, bhabhakibha akolo bha akaatocha kodi, na bhena bhakibha akola hilebhe. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Bhenabho bhakibha bhatenda kupala kwabhoona Ayesu nga amundu bha namuna niki. Nambo bhakalepela kwaabhoka ligongo bhakibha ajipijipi, na bhandu bhakibhanga bhajingi muno. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Henela bhakabhutukila nnongi, bhakakwela nnani ja nkongo gwa nkuyu ili bhakombole kwaalola Ayesu, kwa kubhee bhakaimanya Ayesu bhakibha bhatendakupeta ndela hejo. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Ayesu pabhakahika penipala pahi ja gono nkongo gwa nkuyu, bhakalola nnani, bhakaalobholela, “Azakayo, ntuluke chindema, kwakubhee leleni mbakubhehe ageni ku nyuumba jinu!” <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Henela Azakayo bhakatuluka chindema, na bhakaapokela Ayesu mu nyuumba jabhe kwa kuhangalala muno. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Bhandu bhoa pabhakalolanga genago, bhakajemekanga kokolekanga bhabhi kulobhola, “Bhajaula kubhee ageni kwa amundu akola mabhou.” <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Nambo Azakayo bhakajema kwalobholela Hangwana, “Nnyohanikie, Hangwana! Nenga mbakwapekeanga chibhoga chimo mu mabhoga komi ya hilebhe yangu mbakwapekea akahocho, na nenga handa ndekwapokonyola amundu chilebhe choha chela, mbakwabhujikia pa ncheche.” <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakaalobholela Azakayo, “Leleni, mwenga na bhandu bha yuumba jinu bhatekuokolewa, kwakubhee amundu habha kabhele nga amwana bha Aibulahimu. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Kwakubhee nenga Amwana bha Amundu ndekuhika kulolea na kuokoa chenichela chichihobhite.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanikia kwa akaatumichi komi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Amatayo 25:14-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Bhandu pabhatenda kujohanikia Ayesu, bhatendita kuganikia kubhee Ukolo gwa Annoongo gubhandikile kupiitila, ligongo bhakibha bhabhandikile kuhika ku Yelusalemu. Napena Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga kwa kulandanikia. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Henela bhakaalobholela, “Amundu bhamo bha chilagwa cha ukolo, bhakajaula chilambo cha kutali ili bhakapokele mamulaka ga kubhehe akolo, ngapena bhakabhuja. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Henela bhakibha tangu kujaula, bhakabhakema akaatumichi bhabhe komi na kila bhamo kwaapekeha libhoga lya mbiha na kwaalobholelanga, ‘Bhatendelange mahengo mpaka pabhapakubhuja.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Nambo bhandu bha chilambo chabhe bhakaachimwa na kwapelekela chalaamu na kulobhola, ‘Tupaalahopo amundu habha kubhee akolo bhitu.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Hata henela amundu bhenabho bhapata mamulaka na kubhuja kwaachabhe kubhee akolo, ngapena bhenibhala bhatumichi bhabhe bhabhatekwapekeanga mbiha, ili bhaimanyange nga chilebhe niki chichijonjokike kwa kila jumo jwabhenji chibhapatite baada ya kutendela lihengo. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Antumichi bha kujemeka bhakahika na kulobhola, Hangwana, kwa chibhoga cha mbiya chenichela chinkambekea ndekupata pa komi kwa chibhoga chiukambekea. <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Bhenibhala Hangwana bhakaajangula, ntekutenda yammbone mwenga antumichi bhambone! Kwakubhee ntekubhehe antumichi bhakuaminika mu hilebhe hichoko, mpakubhee ajemelei mu hilambo komi. <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Antumichi bhabhele bhakahika, bhakalobhola, Hangwana, mbatite mabhoga nhano kubhoka mu libhoga limo linkambekea. <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Hangwana bhabhe bhakajangula, mwenga ndendakummeka ajemelei bha hilambo nhano. <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Antumichi bhangi akahika na kulobhola, Hangwana, mbiha jinu jenje pambani. Ngajibheka maha mu chitambaa. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Ligongo ngannyogopa kwakbhee mwenga nga amundu bha mandolotolo. Ntenda kutola mahali mwangabheka chilebhe na ntendakuhuna mahali yakubhee mwangapanda chilebhe. <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Hangwana bhabhe bhakajangiula, mbakunhukumula kwa malobhe ginu mwabhene, mwenga antumichi mwabhou! Handa mwakahimanya yakubhee nenga nga amundu bha mandolotolo, yakubhee ndenda kutola hilebhe na kuhuna pangapanda. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Kwa niki mwangapeleka mbiha yangu kwa bhandu bhabhatendanga mahengo ili bhakombolange kumujikia hiijonjokike, na nenga ndole jijibhi jangu na liba jabhe? <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Ngapena bhakaalobholelanga bhenibhala bhabhakibhanga bhabhajemite pakubhandikila, mwaapokonyole mbiha yabhe mkaapekehe jonijola jwapatite mabhoga komi. <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Na bhenabho bhakaalobholela, Hangwana, bhenabho tayali bhakolite mabhoga komi ga mbiha? <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Na bhenabho bhakaajangula, ndendakunnobholelanga kubhee, kila jwabhile na chilebhe, bhapakunjokewa, na bhenibhala bhanga chilebhe, hata chenichela chihabhii nacho chipakupetulikwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Nambo bhena akaapwati bhangu, yakubhee ngapalanga kubhee akolo bhabhenji, mwaletange pambani, mwakomange papapa nnongi jangu!”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhajingila Ku yeluchalemu kwa kuhangalala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Amatayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Amaluko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Ayohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Ayesu pabhakajomola kulobhola genago, bhakalongolela kujaula ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Nabhena pabhakabhandikila chilambo cha ku Betifage na ku Betania kubhandikila na litombi lilikemwa Mzeituni, bhakaatuma bhanapunji bhabhe bhabhele na kwalobholela, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />nyabhulange mu chijiji chela chichibhile nnongi jinunji, “Pampakujiingila monomwe, mpakunkolela mwana jwa liponda, yakubhee bhangaapetula amundu nnani jabhe, bhabhi bhatabhwite penapo, munnyogole, munnete pamba. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Handa amundu bhankonyite, kwa niki ntenda kunnyogola, mumnobholele, ‘Hangwana bhatenda kumpala.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Bhenibhala bhabhakatumwanga bhakajaula, bhakakolela kila chilebhe handa chibhakalobholelwanga na Ayesu. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Pabhakibhanga bhatenda kunnyogola jonijola mwa liponda, akola liponda bhakaakonyanga, “Kwa niki ntendakunyogolanga jonojwe mwana jwa liponda?” <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Bhenibhala bhanapunji bhakajangulanga, “Hangwana bhatenda kwapala.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Bahi, bhakaapelekela kwa Ayesu, na bhena baada ja kutandika ngobho yabhenji nnani ja jonojwe mwana liponda, na Ayesu bhakantamila panani jakwe. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Pabhatendita kuendelea na ulendo, bhandu bhakajanjaanga ngobho yabhenji mundela.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Pabhakahika kubhandikila ku Yelusalemu, pa kujemeka chielelo cha litombi lya Mizeituni, nkutuli goha gwa bhanapunji bhabhe bhakajemeka kwaalumbalila Annoongo kwa kuhangalala kwa lilobhe likolongwa ligongo lya yakangachika hibhaibhonitinge. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Bhakalobholanga, “Bhatendelwa gammbone Akola bhabhahika kwa lihina lya Hangwana! Amani kunani kulihunde kwa Annoongo na ng'anyimo konokwe kunani muno.”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Penapo Mafalisayo teno bhabhakibha mu nkutuli gwa bhandu bhakakongolela Ayesu, “Bhannyigana, mwakanakie bhanapunji bhinu!” <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Ayesu bhakajaangulanga, “Ndenda kunnobholelanga mwangota, handa habha bhakotwikinge, maganga gapakupota nyenye.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatendakuchigutila chilambo cha ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Ayesu pabhakabhandikila chilmbo cha ku Yelusalemu na kuchilola chilambo, bhakachigutila, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />bhabhi kulobhola, “Mbaya nkahimanyate leleni genigala yakubhee gagaleta amani! Nambo nangocheni gatekuchiia pamiho ginu. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Machobha gatenda kunhikila, yakubhee akapwati bhinu bhapakuntindila na kumpota kubhoka pande yoha. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Bhapakung'wia pahi mwenga na bhandu bhinu. Ngannekelanga hata liganga limo nnani ja likukumba linu. Ligongo bhakibha ngapala kugumanya muuda yakubhee Hangwana bhapakunnetela wokopu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Amatayo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Amaluko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Ayohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakajingila mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo, bhakajemeka kwabhenganga panja bhenibhala bhabhatenditakuuchanga hilebhe monomwe, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />nabhena bhakaalobholelanga, “Jijaandikwe, ‘Nyuumba jangu jipakubhee nyumba ja kwaajopa Annoongo, nambo ntenditinge mbaako ja akaabwihi.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Ayesu bhatendita kwaajigana kila lichobha mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo. Akaakung'i bhakolongwa, bhabhajigananga malagilo ga Amusa na akaakolo bha bhandu bhakapalanga kwaakoma, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />nambo bhangapatanga ndela ja kwaakamula ligongo bhandu bhoha bhakaakagula bhabhikujoonikia malobhe gakwe kwa kutungamanika.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Makonyekelo nnani ja mamulaka ga Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Amatayo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Amaluko 11:27-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Lichobha limo Ayesu, pabhatendita kujigana bhandu mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo na kwaatangachia Ngani Jammbone, akaakolo bha makuhani na bhabhajigana malagilo ga Amusa pamo na akanahota bhakahika kwaachabhe, <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />bhakaakonya, “Ntulobholele, ntenda hikubho heye kwa mamulaka ga aganiki? Nga aganiki bhabhampekie mamulaka gangani?” <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Ayesu bhakaajangulanga, “Nanenga mbakunkonyanga. <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Bholi, mamulaka ga kubaticha kwa Ayohana gakabhoka kunani kulihunde kwa Annoongo au kwa bhandu?” <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Nambo bhakakongolelanga akachinabhene, “Handa tulobhwile, gubhokite kunani kulihunde kwa Annoongo, bhapakutukonya, kwa niki mwangahobhalelanga? <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Nambo handa tulobhwile, gubhokite kwa bhandu, bhandu bhoha bhapakutupota maganga, ligongo bhatendakuhobhalela yakubhee Ayohana bhakibha akaalondohi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Bahi bhakajangulanga, “Ngaimanya mamulaka genago gakabhoka koji.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Ayesu bhakalobholelanga, “Na nenga ngaannobholelanga ndenda kutenda kwa mamulaka aganiki.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanikia kwa bhabhajahikanga nng'onda kwa malepo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Amatayo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Amaluko 12:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Ayesu bhakaendelea kwakongolela bhandu kulandanikia hoko, “Mundu jumo bhakapanda nng'onda gwa mizabibu, bhakalijaika kwa akaalemi, na bhena bhakajaula kutama chilambo cha kutali, bhakatama konokwe kwa machobha gajingi. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Machobha ga mahuno pagakahika, amundu bhenibhala bhakaatuma antumichi bhabhe kwa akaalemi bhenibhala nng'oonda ili bhakapetule mabibo kachoko ga nng'onda kwa mzabibu. Nambo bhandu bhenibhala bhabhakajaika bhakampota na bhakammujia mabhoko jika. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Bhenibhala Hangwana bhakaatuma ntumichi jongi, nambo bhenabho kabhele bhakampota yela yela na kwaatendela hikubho ya honi na kwaabhujia mabhoko jika. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Bhakaatuma kabhele antumichi bha tatu, na bhena bhakanhulaa na kwaajea panja ja ng'onda. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Bahi jonojwe nkola nng'onda gwa mizabibu akalobhola, ‘Ndende niki? Mbankuntuma mwana jwangu junaampala, ngomboleka habhabha bhapakwatopea.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Nambo bhenibhala akaalemi bhabhakajahika nng'oonda pabhakaabhona bhakakongolelana akaachinabhena, ‘Hojo nga nnekelwa, bahi twaakome ili hilebhe yabhe hibhee yitu.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Henela bhakampianga panja ja nng'onda gwa mizabibu, bhakankoma.” Bahi Ayesu bhakakonya, “Bholi, bhena akola nng'onda gwa mizabibu bhapakwatendelanga niki bhenibhala bhabhakajaika ng'onda? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Bhapakuhika kuwakoma bhenabho akaalemi bhabhakajahika na kwaapekeha akaalemi bhangi gono nng'onda gwa mzabibu.” Bhandu pabhakajoha genago bhakalobhola, “Annoongo bhalipitie kutali ngani hejo jikoto kubhokela!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Nambo Ayesu bhakaalolanga, bhakaalobholelanga muno “Majaandiko haga ga Annoongo gabhile na maana niki? Gagalobhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">Liganga bhalikaniite na akaachengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">nangocheni litekubhehe liganga likolongwa lya nnyenje lya kuchengela nyuumba!”<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />“Amundu bhohabhala bhabhagwee nnani ja liganga helyo bhapakuhengeleka hipande hipande na bhohabhala lilipakwaagwela lipakwaayaga kubhehe ukobha.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkonyekelo nnani ja kulepa kodi.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Amatayo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Amaluko 12:13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Bhabhajigana malagilo ga Amusa na akaakung'i bhakolongwa bhakaimanya kubhee kulandanikia konokwe kukibha kwaachabhenji, bhakalolea ndela ja kwaakamula palapala ila bhakaajopanga bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Bahi, bhakaloleanga upenyo gwammbone gwa kwaakamula. Bhakaahonga bhandu teno bhabhachitembanga kubhehe bhakuaminika, bhakaatumanga bhaakamule Ayesu kwa makonyekelo, na henela bhakombolange kwaabheka mu machili na kwaapeleka kwa akakolo bha chilikali ja ku Loma. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Bhenabho bhakulolekea bhakaakonya Ayesu, “Bhannyigana tuimanyite kubhee nnobhola na kujigana gabhile kweli, tutenda kuhimanya kubhehe mwenga mwanga ngapendelea, mwenga mwajigana ukweli nnani ja ndela ja Annoongo. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Bholi, malagilo ga Amusa gatendakutelekelea twenga kulepa kodi kwa akolo bha ku Loma? <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Nambo Ayesu bhakahimanya kujanjaluka gwabhenji, bhakaalobholelanga, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />Nnangiange mbiha. Bholi, pamio na majandiko gagabhile nnani jabhe nga ga aganiki?” <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Na bhenaangota bhakajangula, “Nga ja akolo akolongwa bha ku Loma.” Ngapena Ayesu bhakaajangula, “Bahi mwaapekee akolo bha Loma chichibhile cha akolo bha ku Loma, na chiibhile cha Annoongo mwapekee Annoongo.” <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Bhakalepela kwaakamula kwa lilobhe lyoha lyela penipala nnongi ja bhandu henela bhakatamanga jihii bhakikangachanga chibhakajangula.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkonyelekeo nnani ja kuyooka.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Amatayo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Amaluko 12:18-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Ngapena Masadukayo teno yakubhehe bhalobholaga kwaakwa kuyoka, bhakaajendela Ayesu na kwaakonya, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />“Bhannyigana, Amusa bhakatujandikila yakubhehe handa anung'una jumo bhawile na kwaaleka hanu bhabhe pangali yaana bahi ipaalikwa anung'una bhaabhujile malekwe ila bhakoombole kwaabhelekea bhaana bhenabho anung'una bhabhe. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Bahi, pakibha na akaalongo saba, bhakujemeka bhakalombela haikege bhakawee pangali kubheleka mwana <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Anung'una bha bhabhele na bhenabho bhakawee pangali kubheleka mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Na ikabhee henela kwa anung'una bha tatu bhakalombela nhwelwa Ikabhehe yelayela kwa anung'una bhoha saba bhakalombela bhenabho ahikege na bhoha bhakawee pangali kubheleka mwana <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Kwa kujomolekea na bhenibhala haikege bhakawee <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Bholi, lichobha lya bhabhawilinge kuyoka bhenibhala haikege bhapakubhee hanu bha aganiki? Ligongo akaanung'una bhoa saba bhakannombela bhena haikege.” <verse eid="LUK 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Ayesu bhakaajangulanga, “Bhandu bha chilambo cha nangocheni bhatenda kulombela na kulombwa, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Nambo bhandu yakubhee Annoongo bhapakulola bhapalikwa kuyoka na kutama mu chilambo chichiika bhenabho ngalombela na wala kulombwa kabhele. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Bhenabho ngajomoka kabhele ligongo bhapakubhanganga handa akaatumichi bha kunani kulihunde bha Hangwana na bhenaangota bhapakubhanganga bhana bha Annoongo, ligongo Annoongo bhatekwajalianga kutama kabhele. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Hata Amusa bhakaalangia kubhee bhabhawilinge bhapakuyoka. Mu majaandiko gabhe gagajaandikwe nnani ja chitekete chichijakita mooto, pabhakalobhola Hangwana nga Annoongo bha Aibulahimu nga Annoongo bha Aisaka na nga Annoongo bha Ayakobo. <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Bahi, bhenabho ngabha Annoongo bhabhawilinge kwa kubhee bhoha bhabhatamanga kwaachabhe nga bhabhabhilinge bhamomi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Bhangi bha bhenibhala bhabhajiga Malagilo ga Amusa bhakajangulanga, “Bhannyigana nga ntekujangula maha.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Pabhakajomola genago bhakwa amundu bhangi bhangalenganga kwaakonya kabhele nkonyekelo gongi.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akilisto nga amwana bha aganiki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Amatayo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Amaluko 12:35-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Ayesu bhakaakonyanga, “Bhandu bhalongela bholi kubhee Akilisto bhabhagulikwe na Annoongo nga amwana bha Adaudi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Ligongo Adaudi bhene mu chitabu cha Zabuli bhalobhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">Hangwana bhakaalobholela, Hangwana bhangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">Ntame upande gwangu gwa ukolo na mamulaka<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />Mpaka akaapwati pabhapakubhee chitengu cha kulebhata makongono ginu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Bahi handa Adaudi bhakaakema, “Hangwana, ikomboleka bholi Akilisito kubhee mwana bha Adaudi?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mmangange miho na bhabhajigana Malagilo ga Amusa.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Amatayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Amaluko 12:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Bhandu bhoa pabhatendita kwaajonikia, Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga bhanapunji bhabhe, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Mmangange miho na bhabhajigana malagilo ga Amusa bhabhapalanga kujendajenda kongo bhabhibhawalitinge ngobho hitandamao. Na kupala kuchalimiwa na bhandu pamakonganilo ga bhandu na kutama pa hitengu ya kutopeka mu lichobha likolongwa na kutama mu hitengu yakutopea mu Nyuumba ja konganilana Bhayahudi. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Bhabhaapokonyola nyuumba hakaikege bhabhawelilwe na akanalome bhabhenji na kuchali chala jitandamao ili bhabhonekane kwa bhandu. Ligongo lyenelyo bhapakuhukumulwa pakolongwa muno kupunda bhandu bhangi!”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Chadaka ja nhelwa haocho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Amaluko 12:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Ayesu pabhakibha mu Nyuumba ja Annongo, bhakaabhonanga akaakola hilebhe bhabhikulekelanga chadaka yabhenji mu lichanduku lya chadaka mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo, <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Bhakaabhona kabhele nhelwa nhocho bhabhikulekela senti hibhele monomwe. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Ayesu bhakalobhola, “Kweli ndendakunnobholelanga habha haikege bhabhatekuwelwa na hangwana bhabhe nga bhabhatekulekela chadaka ngolongwa kupunda bhandu bhoha. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Ligongo bhandu bhoha bhabhohitinge kubhoka mu hilebhe hiipundite kubhoka mu hilebhe yabhenji. Nambo habhabha mu kulaga kwabhe bhabheekile yoha hibhabhinayo ligongo lya umomi gwabhe.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhalondola nnani ja kubhomolekwa kwa Nyuumba ja Annoongo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Amatayo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Amaluko 13:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Bhandu kachoko bhanapunji Ayesu bhatendita kulongelanga nnani ja Nyuumba ja Annoongo, namuna chibhakaalakia kwa maganga gagaalalie Nyuumba ja Annoongo na chadaka yakubhee bhandu bhaabhokie Annoongo. Bahi Ayesu bhakalobhola, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Gangani goha gammonanga pambani, machobha gapakuhika yakubhehe lyakwa hata liganga limo lilipakuhigalila nnani ja liganga lyengi, ligongo kila chilebhe chipakuhalibika.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhalondola hilolelo ja machobha gakupela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Amatayo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Amaluko 13:3-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Bhakaakonya, “Bhannyigana, hilebhe heye hipakubhokela lii? Nga hilolelo niki hiipakutulangia twenga kubhehe gatendakubhandikila kuteendeka?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Ayesu bhakaajangulanga, “Mmangange miho, bhakoto kuntembanga. Maana bhajingi bhapakubhokelanga kupetela lina lyangu, kila bhamo bhabikulobhola bhenabho, nga nenga na, mwangota pampakubhonanga henela muhimanye kubhee muda gonogwe gubhandikile! Nambo mwangota nkotokwaakagulanga. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Bahi, pampakujoanga ngani ja ngoondo na ukomu, nkotokujogopanga, ligongo hipaalikwa gabhokele oti genago na kupela kwakwe ngaabhokela gunakamo.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Penapo bhakapunda kulongela, “Bhandu bha chilambo chimo bhapakupotananga na bhandu bha chilambo chengi na ukolo gongi. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Kupakubhehe malendemelo makolongwa ga undopi, njala na hitamwa jakujogoa. Kupakubhee na hilebhe ya kujogoha na hilolelo hikolongwa kubhoka Kunani Kulihunde. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Nambo kabula goha gangabhokela, bhapakunkamulanga mwangota na kunpotekanga. Bhapakunpelekanga mu Nyuumba ja majopelo na kuntabhanga muligelecha, npakubhekwa nnoongi ja Akolo bha mamulaka na akaakolongwa kupetela lina lyangu. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Nambo hikubho yeneyo hipakupeanga upenyo gwa kwaalobholelanga bhandu hikubho yangau. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Nambo nkoto kubhee na bhoga mu mitima jinunji nnani ja chimapakulongelanga kabula ja bhanganhukumulanga, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Kwa kubhee nenga mbakunpekehanga malobhe gakulongela na malango yakubhee jwakwa hata akaapwati bhinu bhapakombolanga kutaukananga mwangota. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Akaabhelei bhinu na anung'una bhinu na akaalongo bhinu na akaaganja bhinu bhapakunng'alukanga mwangota na bhangi bhinu bhapakunkoma. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Bhandu bhoa bhapakunchimwanga mwangota ligongo lya kungagula nenga. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Nambo mboomo yinu hipakubhee maha muno machobha goha. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Bhenibhala bhabhapakutungamanika mpaka kulepa nga bhapakubhee na umomi gwa machobha goha.”<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhalondola nnani ja kubomolekwa kwa chilambo cha ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Amatayo 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Amaluko 13:14-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“Pampakulola Chilambo cha ku Yelusalemu chitekutimbililwa na manyemba, mmanyange yakubhehe machobha gakubomolekwa chilambo chenecho gabhandikile. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Penapo, bhabhabhilinge ku Yudea bhabhutukilange kumatombi, bhenibhala bhabhabhilinge ku chilambo cha Yelusalemu bhabhokange, na bhenibhala bhabhabhilinge kumigonda bhakoto kubhujanga kunnyini. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Kwa kubhee gono gupakubhee nga muda gwa kulepa mabhou gagatendikwe ili hikweele hikubho yoha hibhajandike Annoongo. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Bhapakulaganga bhenibhala akahikege bhabhile na chitumbo na akahikege bhabhile na ilemba ya kujongea, kwa kubhee mu machobha genago kupakubhee na hibhini ngolongwa muno na kuchimwa kwa Annoongo kupakwaahikila bhena bhandu bha chilambo cha ku Isilaeli. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Bhangi bhapakomwa kwa upanga, bhangi bhapakupetulikwa na kwaatabha muchitabho, bhangi bhapakupetulikwa kwa machili kubhoka kungondo na kwaapwilingania mu hilambo yengi. Chilambo cha ku Yelusalemu chipakutawaliwa na bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi na bhandu bha hilambo yengi mpaka muuda pagupakweela.”<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhuja kwa Mwana bha Amundu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-35">Amatayo 24:29-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Amaluko 13:24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />“Kupakubhee na hilolelo mu liobha na mwehi na ndondwa. Pambani pachilambo, bhandu bhapakulaganga na kujogopaanga ligongo lya kulindimila kwa mawimbi ga mubahali. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Bhandu bhapakuhinduka ligongo lya bhoga, kwa kubhona hikubho hiipakubhokela pachilambo. Kwa kubhee machili ga gakubhoka kulihunde gapakupukunyika. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Penapo chibhapakunola nenga Amwana bha Amundu ndenda kuhika Kunani kulihunde pamo na makakala na ung'anyimo mkolongwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Muda chikubho chenecho chiipakujemeka kutendeka, nnyemange na kujiinula mimutwe jinunji kunani, Kwa maana ukomboi gwinu gutekubhanduikila.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majigano kubhokana na nkongo gwa ntini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Amatayo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Amaluko 13:28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga kulandanikiha kongo, nlolekeange nkongo gugukemwa ntini na mikongo jengi joha. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Chimmona yakubhee mikongo jijingi jijemike kuhipuka mahamba, mmanyange kubhee muda gwa chuku gubhandikile. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Yela yela, handa mmonitinge hikubho yeneyo hitenda kubhokela muimanyange yakubhehe ukolo gwa Annoongo gubhandikile kubhokela. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Ndenda kunlobholelanga kweli, ubhelei gugupakugalola genago ngapelahopo mpaka hikubho yoha chiipakubhokela <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Lihunde na chilambo chipakupela, nambo malobhe gangu gapakutama machobha goa.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ipaalikwa ncheange</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Mmangange miho, mitima jinunji ikoto kutopelwa na umomi gwa kulokolila, na kung'wee ugembe na kupupulikila nnani ja umomi. hata lichobha helyo lipakubhokela kwa kung'ang'anuka handa ntambo pagutangila chinyama. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Kwa kubhee lichobha helyo lipakwahikila bhandu bhoa bhabhatama pachilambo poha. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Ncheange na kujopa machobha goha, kongo mwajope Annoongo machobha goha ili nkombolange kuokoka kwa haga goha gagapakubhokela, na nkombolange kujema nnoongi ja Mwana bha Amundu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Bahi, kila muhi Ayesu bhakibha bhatenda kujigana bhandu mu Nyuumba ja Kujopela na kilo bhatenda kujaula kugoloka ku litombi lilikemwa Mizeituni. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Bhandu bhoha bhakibha bhatenda kujimuka kundabhi muno na kujaula kwaajohanikiha Ayesu.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Mpango gwa kwaakoma Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Amatayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Amaluko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Ayohana 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Lichobha likolongwa lya mikate jangalekelwa chilongo, jikemitwa Pasaka, jikibha jitenda kubhandikila. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Akaakung'i Akolo na bhabhajigana bha Malagilo ga Amusa bhakibha bhakilolekea ndela ja kwaakoma Ayesu, na bhenaangota bhatenditanga henela chitikita ligongo bhakaajogopanga bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Bahi, lichetani bhakaajingila Ayuda bhakemitwa Aisikalioti, jumo jwa bhenibhala akandundame komi na bhele. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Henela Ayuda bhakajaula, na kulongela na akahakolo bha Akaakung'i na akaajemelei bha Nyuumba ja Annoongo nnani ja chibhapakwaakoma Ayesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Na bhenaangota bhakaangalala na kulagana nabho kwaapekea mbiha. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Ayuda bhakajeketela, na bhakibha bhakilolea namuna ja kwaagaluka wakati bhandu bhakibha bhakwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lichobha likolongwa lyakupela lya Pasaka ja Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Amatayo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Amaluko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Ayohana 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Bahi, Lichobha lya mikate jangalekelwa chilongo jikahika. Helyo nga lichobha lya mwanangondolo jwa lichobha likolongwa lya kulyehe bhatenda kuchenjwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Ayesu bhakaatumanga Apetulo na Ayohana, bhakaalobholelanga, “Nnyaulange nkatutelekele chakulya cha lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka ili tupate kulyehe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Na bhena angota bhakaakonya Ayesu, “Mpala tunpanganikie koji hecho chakulya cha lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Ayesu bhakaajangula, “Nnyohanikiange! pampakuhika kunnyini, mpakwalola amundu bhamo bhabhapetwile chibhega cha machi, mwakagulange mpaka mu nyuumba chibhapakujingila, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />na mwangota mwalobholele akola Nyuumba, bhakujigana bhankonya, chibhi koji chuumba yakubhee nenga na bhanapunji bhangu tupakulyee chakulya mu lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka? <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Na bhenabho bhapakunlangia chuumba chikolongwa kulitatali, yakubhee chibhile na kila chilebhe chibhekitwe tayali. Ntupanganikie mwonomwe.” <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Na bhenabho pabhakajaula bhakakolela kila chilebhe handa Ayesu chibhaalobholile. Henela bhakabheka tayali Pasaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chakulya cha Hangwana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Amatayo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Amaluko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Bhakolinto 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Muda pagukahika, Ayesu bhakatama pamo na akaandundame bhabhe kulyee chakulya. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Ngapena bhakaalobholela, “Ndekulokolila muno kulyee Pasaka jenjeni pamo na mwangota kabula ja kulaga kwangu. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Nannobholelanga kubhee, ngalyee hopo kabhele lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka mpaka Annoongo pabhapakubhee bhatekwaakomba bhandu bhabhe bhoa na kutabhala?”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Pabhakatola chikombe chichibhii na divai bhakaachukulu Annoongo, bhakalobhola, “Mpokelange heche chikombe cha divai mng'wangange mwabhoa. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Kwa kubhee nannobholelanga, ngang'wee hopo kabhele divai ja libibo lya zabibu mpaka ukolo gwa Annoongo chigupakuhika.” <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Ngapena bhakatola nkate, akaachukulu Annoongo, bhakagumetula, bhakaapekea akaandundame bhabhe bhabhi kulobhola, “Gongo nga mmele gwangu gugubhoitwe ligongo linu. Ntendange henela kwa kungombokela nenga.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Yela yela pabhakajomolanga kulyee bhakatenda yela yela, bhakatola chikombe cha divai bhakalobhola, “Jenje divai mu chikombe nga lilagalo liyono, kupetela mihai jangu. Mihai jangu jipakujitika ligongo lya mwangota.”<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />“Nambo nnolange! Bhenibhala bhabhapakung'aluka bhalyee na nenga pambani pamecha. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Kweli mwana jwa Annoongo bhajenda komekwa handa chibhakapanga Annoongo, nambo kulaga kupakubhehe kwaachakwe, bhenibhala bhabhapakwaagaluka.”<verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Penapo bhakajemeka konyana nga bheneki nkati jitu pabhapakutenda ngani hejo?<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutaukana nnani ja aganiki bhapakubhee akolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Kukabhokela kutaukananga nkati ja bhenabho akandundame nnani ja nga aganiki nkati jabhenji bhapakuganikilwa kubhehe akolo kupeta bhangi. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Ayesu bhakaakongolela, “Akaakolo bha pachilambo bhaakulumikia bhandu kwa machili na bhena bhapalanga kemwa, bhandu bhabhajangatilanga bhangi. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Nambo jikoto kubhehe henela nkati jinunji, ila bhoa bhala bhabhabhile akolo nkati jinu hipalikwa bhabhee achoko kupeta bhoa, na jwabhile akolo hipalikwa bhabhee antumichi kwa bhoa. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Kwa maana, nga aganiki bhabhile akolo? Bhenibhala bhabhatamite pahi kulyee chakulya, au bhenibhala bhabhatumikila? pangali lipamba nga bheni bhala bhabhatama pamecha kulyee chakulya! Nambo nenga ndekubhee nkati jinunji handa antumichi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />“Mwangota nga muigalile pamo na nenga mu machobha goha ga kulengelwa kwangu, <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />na, handa Atati bhangu bhabhambile ukolo, hela hela nanenga mbakwapekeanga mwangota ukolo, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />ii mkombolange kulyee na kung'wee pamecha jangu ja ukolo gwangu na kutama mu hitengu ya ukolo kuhihukumula hilongelo komi na bhele ya chilambo cha ku Isilaeli.”<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhalondola kubhehe Apetulo bhapakwagaluka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Amatayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Amaluko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Ayohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Ayesu bhakalobhola, “Asimoni, Asimoni, nnyohanikie, lichetani bhakapala kunpepetanga mwangota handa amundu chibhapeta ngano. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Nambo nenga ndekunnyopela mwenga ili kuhobhalela kwinu kukoto pongoka. Namwenga chimpakumujila nenga nbhahimalichange akaanung'una bhinu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Nabhena Apetulo bhakajangula, “Hangwana nenga ndekujeketela kujaula pamo na mwenga kuchitabho na hata Kujomoka,” <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Ayesu bhakaajangula, “Ndenda kunnobholela mwenga Apetulo, tangu likambaliko kujemba kilo cha leleni mpakungana patatu kubhee ngamanya nenga.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muuda gwa kujogoha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Ngapena, Ayesu bhakaakonyanga bhanapunji bhabhe, “Penipala panakampalanga nnyaulange pangali nhuko gwa mbiha, pangali nhuko gwa champali nkapongokewa na choha chela?” Bhakajangulanga, “Hopo, twangapongokewa na chilebhe choha chela.” <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Na bhena Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga, “Nambo nangocheni, bhabhabhile na nhuko gwa mbiha gwaupetule, na bhabhi na chikoba hela hela gwaupetule. Na bhoha bhala bhabhangabhee na upanga bhauche likoti na bhaguhemele gumo. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Kwa kuhee Majandiko ga Annoongo gajaandikwe, ‘Bhakabhekwa mu lilubhalo limo na akaabhou,’ Nanenga nannobholelanga chikubho heche chipalikwa likweele kwaachangu. Chichijandikwe nnani jangu chipalikwa chikweele. Annoongo galobhwile, Annoongo, ‘Bhakabhekwa pamo na akaabhou,’ gapalikwa gakweele.” <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Akandundame bhabhe bhakalobholanga, “Hangwana, nnyohanikie pambani gabhile mapanga gabhele.” na bhenabho bhakajangula, “Bahi itoshite.”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayesu bhajopa panani ja litombi lya Mizeituni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Amatayo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Amaluko 14:32-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakabhoka na kujaula kulitombi lya Mizeituni handa chibhakayobholela, na akanapunji bhabhe bhakaakagula. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Pabhakahika konokwe, bhakaalobholela bhanapunji bhabhe, “Nnyopange nkotojingilanga mmalengelo.” <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Ngapena bhakabhoka bakajaula kutali kachoko kwa amundu kujeha liganga, bhakatindibhala majugwa, na bhakajopa, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />bhakalobhola, “Atati, handa ikombolike kulaga kongo kubhee kutali na nenga. Nga handa chimbala nenga ila kwa upaliho gwinu ili gukweele.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Penapo, akaatumichi bha Kunani kulihunde bha Annoongo bhakaabhokela na kwalekela ntima. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Nabhena bhakibha mu kulaga muno, bhakajopa kwa kuchimila, na lihuke likaapita handa mandondo ga mihai gakagwee pahi. <verse eid="LUK 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Pabhakajaomola kujopa, bhakaabhujila bhanapunji bhabhe, bhakaakolela bhate kugolokanga kwa kubhehe bhakibha bhatekuhechukanga. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Nabhena bhakaakonyanga, “Bholi ntegolokanga? Nnyimukange nnyopange ili nkoto kujingilanga mmalengelo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayesu bhatenda kamulikwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Amatayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Amaluko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Ayohana 18:3-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Ayesu pabhakibha tangu bhatenda kulongela nabho, nkutuli nkolongwa gwa bhandu gukahika, gubhi kulongolelwa na bhenibhala bhabhakemitwa Ayuda, jumo jwa bhenibhala akandundame komi na bhabhele. Ayuda bhakajaula kwaapekeha chalamu kwa kwaanyambatila. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Nambo Ayesu bhakalobholela, “Bholi Ayuda! Ntenda kung'aluka nenga Mwana jwa Mundu kwa kunjalimiha kwa kunyambatila?” <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Bheni bhala bhanapunji bha Ayesu pabhakabhonanga genigala gagabhandikile kubhokela, bhakalobhola, “Hangwana, twaheketange kwa mapanga gitu?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Na jumo jwabhenji bhakampota abhanda bha akung'i akolongwa, bhakaheketa lichikilo lyabhe lya kunnelo. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Nambo Ayesu bhakalobhola, “Nkotoke!” Bhakalikwaa chikilo lya jonijola mundu bhakalama. <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakaabholelanga akaakung'i akolo, akolongwa bha bhabhalolekeha Nyuumba ja Annoongo na akanahota bhabhakahikanga kwaakamula, “Bholi, ntekuhikanga na mapanga na himbonga, handa nenga ndekuhengelana malagilo? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Machobha goa nakibha pamo na mwangota mu lugwani lwa Nyuumba ja Annoongo machobha goha mwangangamulanga. Nambo, gongoni nga muuda gwinunji, nga muuda gwa utawala gwa lubhendu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apetulo bhaakana Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Amatayo 26:57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Amaluko 14:53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Ayohana 18:12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Ngapena bhakakamula Ayesu, bhakaapetula kujaula nabho kunyuumba ja Akung'i akolongwa. Nambo Apetulo bhakaakagula Ayesu kwa kutali. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Pabhakakungananga moto pakati ja lugwani na kutamanga pamo, Apetulo nabhenabho bhakatama pamo nabho. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Antumichi bhamo bha Annoongo haikege, pabhakaabhona Apetulo bhatekutama kubhandikila na mooto bhakaalolekea muno, bhakalobhola, “Hojo mundu bhakibha pamo na Ayesu!” <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Nambo Apetulo bhakaakana na kulobhola, “Mwee ahikege! Naamanya hopo habha amundu” <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Pabhakajomola kulongela, amundu bhangi bhakabhona Apetulo, bhakalobholela, bhakahika mundu jongi bhakaabhona Apetulo bhakalobhola, “Mwenga nga jumo jwabhenji!” Nambo Apetulo bhakaajaangula, “Hangwana mwee, ngabha nenga!” <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Palikapeta lichaa limo, bhakapunda kulongela, “kweli habha mundu bhakibha pamo na Ayesu, kwa maana na bhenebho bhabhokite ku Galilaya!” <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Nambo Apetulo bhakajangula, “Hangwana mwee, nenga nichimanya hopo chinnongela!” Na popopo pabhakibha tangu kulongela, likambaliko likajemba.<verse eid="LUK 22:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Nabhena Hangwana bhakaatendebhukila na kwalola Apetulo. Nabhena Apetulo bhakakombokela genigala malobhe yakubhehe Hangwana bhakaalobholela, “Leleni tangu likambaliko kujemba mpakungana patatu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Apetulo bhakapita panja, bhakapata hibhini muntima gwabhe na bhakaguta muno.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manyemba bhaatendela mbeenje Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Amatayo 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Amaluko 14:65</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Bhenihala bhandu bhabhakibhanga bhatenda kwalendelela Ayesu bhakajemekanga kwatendelanga mbeenje na kumpota. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Bhenaangota bhakaatabha chitambaa kumiho na kwaakonya, “Nnondole! ntulobholele aganiki jwampotite?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Bhakaendelea kulobhola malobhe gajingi ga kwaatukana.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu nnongi ja lichebule lya Bhayahudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Amatayo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Amaluko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Ayohana 18:19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Pajikahika kundabhi, chebule cha akanaota bha bhandu pamo na akolo bha akaakung'i na bhabhajigana Malagilo ga Amusa, bhakakongana pamo, na bhakaaleta Ayesu nnongi ja chebule jenijela. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Bhakaalobholela, “Handa mwenga nga Akilisito, ntukongolele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Ayesu bhakajangula, “Hata nankongolilinge ngahobhalela nenga. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Na handa nankonyitinge likonyekelo, nganyangula hopo. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Nambo kujemeka nangocheni, nenga Mwana jwa Mundu mbakutama upande gwa kutopea gwa Annoongo Akola machili.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Penapo bhoha bhakaakonyanga, “Mwenga nga Mwana jwa Annoongo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Bhenabho bhakaajangulanga, “Mwangota ntekulobholanga yakubhee nenga nga nenga.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Ngapena bhakalobholanga, “Bholi, tupala niki chakupunda? Twenga twachinabhene tujowine bhabhi kulobhola pakang'wa jabhe mwene.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Ayesu bhapelekwa kwa Apilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Amatayo 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Amaluko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Ayohana 18:28-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Ngapena nkutuli goha gwa bhandu gukajimuka na kwapeleka Ayesu kwa Apilato, <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Na bhenabho bhakajemekanga kwachitaki bhabhi kulobhola, “Tutekwalola habha amundu bhabhi kwalobholelanga bhandu bhitu, bhabhi kwaibhilanga bhandu bhakotokulepanga kodi kwa akolo bha ku Loma na kuchikema bhena nga Akilisito, akolo.” <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Bahi, Apilato bhakaakonya Ayesu, “Mwenga nga akolo bha Bhayahudi?” Ayesu akajangula, “Mwenga nga bhannobhola.” <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Ngapena Apilato bhakaalobholelanga akakolo bha akaakung'i na nkutuli goha gwa bhandu, “Nangakubhona kulemwa koha kola kwa habha amundu” <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Nambo bhenaangota bhakachimilanga kulongela, “Bhatenda kwakolekea bhandu kwa majigano gabhe kubhee bhakupendekula malagilo mu chilambo choa cha ku Yudea, bhakajemekanga ku Galilaya. Nangocheni bhabhi pambani Payelusalemu!”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhapelekwa kwa Ahelode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Apilato pabhakajoa genago, bhakakonya, “Bholi, hojo mudu nga bha ku Galilaya?”<verse eid="LUK 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Pabhakahimanya yakubhehe Ayesu bhakibha pahi ja mamulaka ga Ahelode, bhakaapeleka kwa Ahelode, yakubhe kwa gono muda bhakibha ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Ahelode bhakahachuka muno chibhakaabhona Ayesu. kwa kubhee kwa muuda ntandamao bhakibha bhatekujoha ngani hijingi nnani ja bhenabho, kabhele bhakapala kwaalola bhabhi kutenda yakangachika hijingi. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Bahi, Ahelode bhakaakonya makonyekelo gajingi, nambo Ayesu bhangaajangula lilobhe lyoha lyela. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Gono muuda akolo bha akaakung'i na bhabhajigana Malagilo ga Amusa bhakibhanga bhabhi kubhoa machitaka gabhenji kwa machili muno.<verse eid="LUK 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Bahi, Ahelode pamo na manyemba gabhenji bhakabheluha Ayesu na kwatendela mbenje, ngapena bhakaweka ngobho yakuhalala muno, bhakaabhujia kwa Apilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Lichobha helyo Ahelode na Apilato bhakibha maganja ligongo lya chikubho hecho kwa kubhee pena kandai bhakibhanga akaapwati.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhahukumulwa komekwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Amatayo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Amaluko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Ayohana 18:39-19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Bahi, Apilato bhakaakema pamo, akaakung'i akolo, na akaakolo bha bhandu, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />na bhakaalobholelanga, “Munnetitinge mundu hojo pambani na kwaachitaki kubhee bhatenda kwaakolekea. Nangocheni nnyohanikiange! Panakalolekea muno nnongi jinu ndekolela bhangalemwa choa chela. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Nga nenga jika, ila hata Ahelode bhangachibhona chalemwite chohachela, nga kwa maana bhaabhujie kwaachitu. Nga kweli yakubhehe amundu habha bhangalemwa choachela chichipakwaatenda komekwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Kwa henela mbakulumikiha bhapotwe mihimbati, na mbakwaleka.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Jikibha nga chiiyobhalilike Kwakubhee jikabhee nga hipalikwa kwajogolela atabhwa jumo muuda gwa lichobha likolongwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Nambo bhandu bhoha kwa lilobhe limo bhakapotanga nyenye, habha amundu bhakomekwe! “Tupala ntujogolele Abalaba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Bhenabaho Abalaba bhakibha bhatabhwite muchitabho ligongo lya bhandu bhakaatendea bhandu kutenda gangali kubha, na kwaatenda bhandu bhakomekwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Apilato bhakapala kwalekela Ayesu, henela bhakalobhola nabho kabhele. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Nambo bheni bhala bhakapotaanga nyenye, “Mwaabhambe panchalaba, mwaabhambe panchalaba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Apilato bhakaalobholela patatu, “Bhalemwite niki habha amundu? monahopo chaalemwite lilyapaliha kunkoma, kwa henela mbakwapota luyakato, ngapena nalekelele.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Nambo bhandu bhakapunda kupota nyenye kwa machili bhabhi kulonganga kubhehe Ayesu bhabhambe panchalaba. Henela nyenye yabhenji hikajohanika. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Henea, Apilato bhakakoonda kwaabhoa Ayesu handa chibhakapalanga. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Bhakaajegolea bhenibhaka bhabhakatabhwa mu chitabho ligongo lya undendemundu, na hikubho yakoma bhandu, bhenibhala bhabhampalanga akaabhoa Ayesu bhaatendele chibhapalanga.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kwaabhanda panchalaba.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Amatayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Amaluko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Ayohana 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Manyemba pabhakibhanga bhatenda kwapeleka Ayesu, bhakakongana na mundu jumo kubhoka ku chilambo cha ku Kilene bhabhakibha bhabhokita kumigoda. Bhakaatweka nchalaba bhakaakulumikia bhagutole kuyeto kwa Ayesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Nkutuli nkolongwa gwa bhandu gukaakagula Ayesu, nkati jabhenji bhakibha na akaikege bhakibhanga bhatenda kujemba kwa kuhechukanga na kwaagutila. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Ayesu bhakaatendebhukila na kwaalobholelanga, “Mwangota akahikege bha Kuyelusalemu! nkotokung'utilanga nenga, nambo nchigutilange mwakachina bhene na kwa ligongo lya bhana bhinu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Kwa maana muda gupakuhika kubhee bhandu bhapakulobholanga, nnolange, ‘Bhatekutendelwa gammbone bhenibhala ahikege ntoonga yakubhee lutumbo lwabhe lwangabheleka na mabhele gabhe bhanganyongea bhana!’” <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Muuda hogwe, ngapena bhandu bhapakujemeka, kulilobholela litombi, “Ntugwelange!” na litombi, “Ntuwekele!” <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Kwa maana, handa bhatekundendela henela nenga nangalemwa ipakubhee bholi kwa amundu bhabhalemwite?<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Bhandu bhangi bhabhele akaabhou, bhakapelekwanga kwa Ayesu ili bhaabhambange pamo na Ayesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Pabhakaikanga papakemitwa, “Lingambwa lya mutwe,” penapo nga pabhakaabhamba Ayesu pamo na bhenabho na bhenabho akaabhou, bhangi upande gwa kunnelo na bhangi upande gwa kunchiji. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Ayesu bhakalobhola, “Hatati, mwachamee, kwa kubhehe ngamanyanga chibhatendanga.” Ngapena bhakabhabhananga ngobho yabhe kwa kuhagula kwa gudugudu. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Bhandu bhakibhanga bhajemitinge penipala bhabhi kulolangana. Na bhena akaakolo bha Bhayahudi bhakaatendela mbenje bhabhi kulobhola, “Bhatekwaaokoa bhangi, nangocheni bhachiokoe bhene, handa bhenabho nga Akilisito, bhabhaagulikwe na Annoongo.” <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Na manyemba bhakaatendelanga kabhele mbeenje, bhakaapekeha chiki, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />bhenaangota bhakaalobholela “Handa kweli mwenga nga Akolo bha Bhayahudi, nchiokoe mwabhene.” <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Nnani ja nchalaba gwabhe pakibha na chibao chichikajandikwa malobhe haga, “Habha bha akolo bha Bhayahudi.” Majandiko haga gakibha bhatekujandikwa kwa chilongelo cha Chiyunani, na Chilatini na Chiebulania. <verse eid="LUK 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Jumo jwa bhenibhala akaabhou bhabhakabhambwa pamichalaba jitatu pamo na Ayesu, bhakaaponja bhakalobhola, “Mwenga nga kweli Akilichito? Nchiokoe mwa bhene na twenga.” <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Nambo bhenibhala abhou jongi bhakaakelebhua ajabhe bhakalobhola, “Bholi, mwenga ngaajogopa hopo Annoongo, na kwa kubhee twenga tutekubhambwa handa bhenabho? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Mwe na nenga tupalikwa kupata hukumu jenjeni, kwa kubhee twapokela malepo kubhokana na hikubho yitu, nambo habha amundu bhangatenda choha chela chibhou.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Ngapena bhenibhala abhou bhakalobholela Ayesu, “Mwee Ayesu, ngombokele chimpakujingila mu ukolo gwinu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Ayesu bhakaajangula, “Nannnobholela kweli, lele nupe mpakubhee pamo na nenga kunani kulihunde.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayesu bhatendakujomoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Amatayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Amaluko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Ayohana 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Jikibha handa saa sita ja muhi, lihobha likaleka kujaka, na lubhendu lukawekela chilambo choa mpaka saa tisa, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />kwa kubhee lihobha likaleka kubhoa nhana. Lipanjia ja Nyuumba ja Annoongo nga likapapuka ipande hibhele kubhoka kunani mpaka pahi. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Ayesu bhakaguta kwa lilobhe likolongwa, bhakalobhola, “Atati, mumabhoko ginu ndenda kujikamua mboomo jangu.” Pabhakajomola kulobhola genago, bhakajomoka. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Penapo Alinyemba akolo jwa ku Loma pabhakalola gagabhokile bhakaalumbalila Annoongo bhabhi kulobhola, “Kweli hojo mundu bhakibha mundu bhabhakondekwa nnongi ja Annoongo.” <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Bhandu bhoa bhabhakibha bhatekongananga penapo ligongo lya ngani ja chikubho hecho, pabhakalola gagabhokile, bhakabhujanga kwaachabhenji, bhabhi kuchipotanga pamitima jabhenji kwa kuumalika. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Bhandu bhoa bhabhakakongananga penapo bhabhakaamanya Ayesu pamo na bhenibhala akahikege bhabhakibha bhabhakaakagula kubhoka ku Galilaya bhakajema kutali bhabhi kulolekea hikubho heyo.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kuchikwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Amatayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Amaluko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Ayohana 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Kukibha na mundu bhamo bhakemitwa Ayusufu, bhenibha bhakibha bhamo bha Chebule ja Bhayahudi, amundu bhanabho bhatenita kondekwa noongi ja Annoongo. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Bhenabho bhangakonda na kuhumula kwa Chebule na hikubho hibhaitenditinge, amundu bhenabho bhakibha bhabhokela mu chilambo cha Alimataya, na bhatendita kulendela kuhika kwa Ukolo gwa Annoongo. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Ngapena Ayusufu bhakajenda kwa Apilato, bhakaajopa bhampekee mmele gwa Ayesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Bhenabho bhakagutulua mmele hogwe kubhoka panchalaba, na kuguigilila chaanda ja kuhalala, bhakagubheka mulikabuli lilikibha bhalibhachite pamwala, kubhee likibha tangu lyangachikiwa mundu joha jola. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Lyenelo likibha lichobha lya kuchibheka tayali kwa kubhee jikibha kujemeka kwa lichobha lya kupomolela. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Bhenibhala akahikege bhabhakibha bhatenda kwaakagula Ayesu kubhoka ku Galilaya, bhakapalola mahali pabhakagugonekaa mmele gwa Ayesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Bhakabhujanga kaaja, bhakapetula mahuta bhakagabheka tayali mahuta gakunungila na mahuta gakwaapakala Ayesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Lichobha lya kupomolela nga bhakapomolelanga handa chiiyobhalilike.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Kuyoka kwa Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Amatayo 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Amaluko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Ayohana 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Lichobha lya kujemeka lya juma, kundabhi muno, ahikege bhala bhakajenda kulikabuli bhakapetula mahuta gakunungila bhabhakagabheka tayali. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Bhakakolela liganga lyela lipilingitwe kutali ja nnyango gwa likabuli. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Nambo pabhakajingila nkati, bhangagubhona mmele gwa Hangwana Ayesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Pabhakibhanga tangu bhatekuhechukanga nnani ja chikubho hecho, gunakamo akanalome bhabhele bhabhakawala ngobho yakung'anyima muno, handa nga njahi. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Bhakajingilwa na bhoga, akahikge bhenibhala bhakakotimanga pahi. Ngapena bhenibhala bhandu bhakaalobholelanga, “Kwa niki ntenda kunnolea jwabhile jwaamomi pakati ja bhabhawilinge? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Bhenabho bhaakwa pambani, bhatekuyoka! Nkombokelange chibhakannobholelanga pakibha konikola ku Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />Penipala pabhakalobhola, ‘Nenga Mwana bha Mundu mbalikwa kondekwe mmabhoko ga bhandu bhangali mmbone, akaabhou, bhamambe na lichobha lya tatu mbakuyoka.’” <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Penipala bhenibhala akaikege bhakagakombokela malobhe gakwe, <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />pabhakabhujanga kubhoka kulikabuli, bhakaalobholelanga bhenibhala komi na bhamo pamo na bhangi bhoa chikubho chenecho. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Bhandu bhabhakakongolela yeniyela ngani kwa akaandundame bhenabho bhakibha Amaliamu Magidalene na Ayoana na Amaliamu anyongo bhabhe Ayakobo, pamo na bhangi bhabhakalongana nabho. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Nambo Akandundame bhenibhala bhangahobhalelanga malobhe genigala gabhakalobholelwanga na bhenibhala akahikege na ngani hibhatendita kulongela. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Nambo Apetulo bhakabhoka, bhakabhutuka lubhelo mpaka kulikabuli. Pabhakalingulila nkati ja likabuli bhakalola tu jeni jela chanda hitekuhigalila penipala. Bhakabhuja kaja kongo bhatenda kuhechukanga nnani ja gagabhokile.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kwaabhokela bhandu bhabhele mu ndela ja ku Emau</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Amaluko 16:12-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Lichobha lyolyo, bhanapunji bhabhele nkati ja bhanapunji bha Ayesu bhakibha bhatenda kujaula mu chijiji chimo chikemitwa ku Emau, kukibha kutali kwa handa maili saba kubhoka ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Bhakibha bhatendakongoloka akaachinabhene nnani ja hikubho yoha hihibhokile. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Pabhakibhanga tangu bhatendakulongela na kulobholelana nnani ja ngani jenejo, Ayesu bhene bhakabhokela, kujenda nabho pamo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Bhakaabhona kwa miho gabhenji, nambo bhangakombolanga kwaamanya. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Bhakaakonyanga, “Nkongolokanga hikubho niki kongo mmi kujendanga?” Bhenibhala bhandu bhakajemanga jihi, pamiho pabhe pakibha na lukenja. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Jumo jwabhe, jwaakemitwa Akileopa, bhakajangula, “Bholi, mwenga nga ageni jika jinu pa Yelusalemu yakubhehe mwangamanya gagabhokile machobha gani?” <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Nabhena bhakajangula, “Hikubho niki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Bhenabho bhakaajangulanga, “Hikubho hiyapatite Ayesu bha ku Nazaleti. Bhenabho bhakibha alondoi akola machili ga kutenda na kujigananga nnoongi ja Annoongo na nnongi ja bhandu bhoha. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Akolo bha akaakung'i na akaakolo bha bhandu bhakaabhoa ili bhakomekwe, na bhenabho bhakaabhamba panchalaba.<verse eid="LUK 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Nambo twenga tukahobhalela yakubhehe bhenabho nga bhapakuchikomboa chilambo cha ku Isilaeli. Kupunda genago goha, leleni nga lichobha lya tatu tangu hikubho heyo hiibhokile. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Kabhele, akaikege teno bha kwaachitu bhatekutung'ang'anua. Bhakajahulanga kulikabuli kundabhi muno, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />Bhanga gukolelanga mmele gwa Ayesu. bhakabhujanga bhakalobholanga bhatekulola maganikiho ga antumich bha kunani kulihunde bha Hangwana kubhee bhakaalobholelanga yakubhehe Ayesu bhamomi. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Bhangi bhitu bhakajaulanga kulikabuli bhakalolange genigala gagakalobholekwa na bhenabho akahikege, nambo bhenabho bhangaabhona Ayesu.” <verse eid="LUK 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga, “Mbona ntekubhee mwaajinga henela na mu mitima jinunji jakutopa henela kugahobhalela goha gagalobhwile na akaaondohi? <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Bholi, yangapalikwa Akilisito bhabhatekuagulikwa na Annoongo kulaga, na henela bhajingile mu nng'anyimo gwabhe?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Na Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga hikubho yoha gagapalikwa bhenabho mu Majandiko ga Annoongo kujemeka Majandiko ga Amusa mpaka ga akaalondoi bhoha. <verse eid="LUK 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Pabhakabhandikilanga chenichela chijiji chibhakachijendelanga, Ayesu bhakatenda handa bhajaula nnongi mu ulendo, <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Nambo bhenaangota bhakaapembelea Ayesu na kwalobholela, “Ntame pamo na twenga, maana kutekupilila, na kilo chitekubhandikila.” Bahi, bhakajingila pachijiji, bhakatama pamo nabho. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Pabhakatama kulyee chakulya pamo na bhenaangota, bhakagutola nkate, bhakagutendela yammbone, ngapena bhakagumetula, na kwapekeanga. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Popopo miho gabhenji gakaunukulikwa, na bhenaangota bhakaamanya, nambo bhenabho bhakabhoka pakati jabhenji. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Bahi, bhakakongolelananga, “Bholi, mitima jinunji jangaachu wala kuhangalala pabhakibha bhatenda kutulobholela Majandiko ga Annoongo konikola kundela?” <verse eid="LUK 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Penapo bhakajimukanga gunakamo na kubhujanga kuchilambo cha ku Yelusalemu, konokwe bhakaakolelanga bhenibhala komi na jimo na bhandu bhangi bhabhakibhanga pamo bhakondekininge. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Bhakalobholanga, “Kweli Hangwana bhatekuyoka, bhaabhokile Asimoni.” <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Ngapena bhenibhala bhanapunji bhabhele bhakakongolela gagabhokile nndela na namuna chibhakaamanya Ayesu penipala pabhakagumetula nkate.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhaabhokela bhanapunji bhabhe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Amatayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Amaluko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Ayohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 1:6-8">Amatayo 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Pabhakibhanga bhatendakubholanga ngani hejo, bhenabho Ayesu bhene bhakajema pakati jabhenji, bhakaalobholelanga, “Upalyo gwa Annoongo gubhehe na mwangota.” <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Bhena angota bhakang'ang'anuka na kujogopa bhakiganikiha kubhehe bhatekulolanga lihimwi. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Nambo Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga, “Kwaniki ntenda kujogopanga, kwaniki mbilinge na lipamba mu mitima jinunji? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Nnolange mmabhoko gangu na mmakongono gangu, yakubhehe nga nenga namwene. Nngwaange nnolange, kwa maana lihimwi lyanga mmele na wala mahupa handa chimmonanga nenga.” <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Pabhakalobhola genago, bhakaalangia mabhoko na makongono gabhe. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Wakati tangu bhangakombolanga kuhobhalela kubhee nga bhenabho ligongo lya kuhangalala na kangachanga, bhakaakonyanga, “Mmi na chilebhe chohachela cha kulyee?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Bhakaapekea chipande cha homba jubhammanike. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Bhakachitola chipande na kulyehe, bhoha bhabhikwaalola. <verse eid="LUK 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakaalobholela, “Heye nga ngani hiinakannobholela panakibha tangu na mwangota gagapalika gaapitile goha gagajaandikwe mu malagilo ga Amusa na akaalondohi na mu chitabu cha Zabuli gapaliikwa gakwele.” <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Ngapena, bhakagawekula malango gabhenji ili bhakombolange kugamanya Majaandiko ga Annoongo. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Na bhakaalobholelanga, “Nga gajaandikwe gangani mu Majaandiko ga Annoongo, kubhee Akilisito bhapakulaga na kujomoka na lichobha lya tatu bhapakuyoka, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />nga kubhee hilambo yoha hipakutangachiwa n kwa lihina lyangu kwa ngani ya kuleka mabhou na kulekelelwa mabhou gabhenji. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Mwangota nga bhannolitinge na kujoha hikubho heyo <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Na nenga namwene mbakutumianga bhenibhala yakubhee Atati bhangu bhatekuhaidi, nambo mwangota mu heche chilambo mpaka penapo pampakupokelanga machili kubhoka kunani kulihunde.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatendakupetulikwa kujaula kunani kulihunde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Ngapena bhakaalongolela panja ja kunnyini mpaka ku Betania, nga bhakanyolola mabhoko gabhe kunani, bhakaajopelanga gammbone ga Annoongo. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Pabhatendita kwaajopela gammbone kubhoka kwa Annoongo, muuda bhakatolekwa na kwalekanga na bhakajaula kunani kulihunde. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Ngapena bhenaangota bhakaajopa bhenabho, bhakabhujanga ku Yelusalemu bhabhi kuhachukanga muno. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Muda goa bhakatamanga nkati ja Nyuumba ja Annoongo bhabhi kwaalumbalilanga Annoongo.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>